#: src/getting-started/rust.md:6
msgid "Getting Started: Rust"
msgstr "入门：Rust"

#: src/getting-started/rust.md:8
msgid ""
"The single dependency a Rust downstream needs is the umbrella [`purrdf`]"
"(https://crates.io/crates/purrdf) crate. It re-exports the RDF 1.2 "
"implementation surface at its root and carries every other published crate "
"under a stable module (`purrdf::sparql`, `purrdf::shapes`, `purrdf::shex`, "
"`purrdf::gts`, `purrdf::entail`, `purrdf::validate`, `purrdf::slice`, "
"`purrdf::iri`, `purrdf::xsd`, `purrdf::events`) — anything a consumer "
"legitimately imports is reachable from `purrdf` alone, never by reaching "
"into a sub-crate."
msgstr ""
"Rust 下游唯一需要的依赖是总括 crate [`purrdf`](https://crates.io/crates/"
"purrdf)。它在根部重新导出 RDF 1.2 实现接口，并把其他每个已发布的 crate 置于一"
"个稳定的模块之下（`purrdf::sparql`、`purrdf::shapes`、`purrdf::shex`、"
"`purrdf::gts`、`purrdf::entail`、`purrdf::validate`、`purrdf::slice`、"
"`purrdf::iri`、`purrdf::xsd`、`purrdf::events`）——使用方合理导入的任何内容都"
"只凭 `purrdf` 即可到达，绝不需要深入某个子 crate。"

#: src/getting-started/rust.md:21
msgid ""
"The MSRV is Rust **1.98** on the stable channel: by policy the code uses "
"zero nightly (unstable) features, so stable 1.98 builds it. The repository's "
"own toolchain floats on nightly for its sharper lints; see [Versioning & "
"Releases](../project/releases.md)."
msgstr ""
"MSRV 为 Rust **1.98**，位于 stable 通道：按政策，代码不使用任何 nightly（不稳"
"定）特性，因此 stable 1.98 即可构建。仓库自身的工具链浮动跟随 nightly，以获得"
"更锐利的 lint；参见[版本管理与发布](../project/releases.md)。"

