msgstr "# 项、四元组、具体化节点、注解、二进制块\n"

#: src/getting-started/python.md:119
msgid ""
"`gts_to_sqlite(data, path)`, `gts_to_duckdb(data, path)` and "
"`gts_to_parquet(data, out_dir)` write those same five tables out, in the "
"projection's own row order — so exporting a container twice produces the "
"same content. SQLite needs nothing beyond the standard library; the other "
"two raise `ModuleNotFoundError` naming the extra to install "
"(`purrdf[duckdb]`, `purrdf[parquet]`)."
msgstr ""
"`gts_to_sqlite(data, path)`、`gts_to_duckdb(data, path)` 与 "
"`gts_to_parquet(data, out_dir)` 按投影自身的行顺序写出同样的五张表——因此把一"
"个容器导出两次会产生相同的内容。SQLite 只需标准库；另外两者会抛出 "
"`ModuleNotFoundError`，并指明需要安装的 extra（`purrdf[duckdb]`、"
"`purrdf[parquet]`）。"

#: src/getting-started/python.md:126
