msgid ""
"b\"<https://example.org/alice> <https://schema.org/name> \\\"Alice\\\" .\""
msgstr ""
"b\"<https://example.org/alice> <https://schema.org/name> \\\"Alice\\\" .\""

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:46
msgid "\"application/n-triples\""
msgstr "\"application/n-triples\""

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:57
msgid ""
"Keep a `CompiledJsonLdContext` (or `JsonLdSerializeOptions::compiled`) when "
"the same application context is used for many datasets. "
"`JsonLdContextRegistry` resolves context IRIs and `@import` only from caller-"
"supplied immutable local documents; PurRDF never performs network context "
"loading."
msgstr ""
"当同一个应用上下文用于许多数据集时，请保留一个 `CompiledJsonLdContext`（或 "
"`JsonLdSerializeOptions::compiled`）。`JsonLdContextRegistry` 只从调用方提供"
"的不可变本地文档中解析上下文 IRI 与 `@import`；PurRDF 从不经由网络加载上下"
"文。"

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:64
msgid ""
"Write the versioned document to a file, then pass it to any RDF-producing "
"CLI path:"
msgstr "把带版本的文档写入文件，然后把它传给任何产生 RDF 的 CLI 路径："

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:71
msgid ""
"The option is rejected for non-JSON-LD/YAML-LD output, canonical output, non-"
"graph SPARQL results, and carrier projections rather than being ignored."
msgstr ""
"对于非 JSON-LD/YAML-LD 输出、规范化输出、非图形式的 SPARQL 结果以及载体投影，"
"该选项会被拒绝，而不是被忽略。"

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:89 src/concepts/jsonld.md:107
msgid "\"jsonld\""
msgstr "\"jsonld\""

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:94
msgid ""
"`Store.dump`, `MutableDataset.dump`, immutable `RdfDataset`, and the RDFLib "
"compatibility `Graph.serialize` surface accept the same configuration. "
"Prefixes explicitly bound on a compatibility graph become its caller context."
msgstr ""
"`Store.dump`、`MutableDataset.dump`、不可变的 `RdfDataset` 以及 RDFLib 兼容层"
"的 `Graph.serialize` 接口都接受同一配置。在兼容层图上显式绑定的前缀，会成为其"
"调用方上下文。"

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:98
msgid "JavaScript and WebAssembly"
msgstr "JavaScript 与 WebAssembly"

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:110
msgid ""
"Use `serializeConfigured` for one-shot requests. `QueryEngine` exposes "
"matching configured methods for CONSTRUCT and DESCRIBE graph results, and "
"the playground worker accepts the same options document on its serialization "
"path."
msgstr ""
"一次性请求请使用 `serializeConfigured`。`QueryEngine` 为 CONSTRUCT 与 "
"DESCRIBE 图结果提供对应的可配置方法，playground 的 worker 在其序列化路径上也"
"接受同一份选项文档。"

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:116
msgid ""
"Compile options with `purrdf_jsonld_context_compile`, reuse the returned "
"`PurrdfJsonLdContext` with `purrdf_serialize_jsonld_configured`, then "
"release it with `purrdf_jsonld_context_free`. The serializer accepts exactly "
"one options byte slice or compiled handle. Buffers and errors retain the "
"normal libpurrdf ownership rules."
msgstr ""
"用 `purrdf_jsonld_context_compile` 编译选项，用 "
"`purrdf_serialize_jsonld_configured` 复用返回的 `PurrdfJsonLdContext`，然后"
"用 `purrdf_jsonld_context_free` 释放它。序列化器只接受恰好一个选项字节切片或"
"一个已编译句柄。缓冲区与错误仍遵循 libpurrdf 通常的所有权规则。"

#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:122
msgid ""
"YAML-LD uses the same context lens. Its optional schema URL changes only the "
"deterministic YAML language-server header; it does not change RDF semantics."
msgstr ""
"YAML-LD 使用同一个上下文视角。其可选的模式 URL 只改变确定性的 YAML 语言服务器"
"头部；它不改变 RDF 语义。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:8
msgid ""
"Byte-deterministic serialization ([Codecs & Determinism](codecs.md)) means "
"the _same dataset_ always emits the same bytes. Canonicalization is the "
"stronger property: two _different in-memory datasets that are isomorphic_ — "
"the same graph up to blank-node relabeling — canonicalize to the same bytes."
msgstr ""
"逐字节确定的序列化（[编解码器与确定性](codecs.md)）意味着*同一个数据集*总是输"
"出相同的字节。规范化是更强的性质：两个*不同的、彼此同构的内存数据集*——即在空"
"节点重新标记意义下相同的图——会规范化为相同的字节。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:13 src/project/conformance.md:39
msgid "RDFC-1.0"
msgstr "RDFC-1.0"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:15
msgid ""
"PurRDF implements W3C [RDF Dataset Canonicalization (RDFC-1.0)](https://"
"www.w3.org/TR/rdf-canon/) natively in the kernel, tested against the W3C "
"`rdf-canon` fixture suite (65 vectors — 64 eval plus 1 negative — all green; "
"see [`docs/CONFORMANCE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/"
"blob/main/docs/CONFORMANCE.md))."
msgstr ""
"PurRDF 在内核中原生实现了 W3C [RDF 数据集规范化（RDFC-1.0）](https://"
"www.w3.org/TR/rdf-canon/)，并依据 W3C `rdf-canon` 测试夹具套件进行测试（65 个"
"向量——64 个求值用例加 1 个负例——全部通过；参见 [`docs/CONFORMANCE.md`]"
"(https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/"
"CONFORMANCE.md)）。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:21
msgid ""
"The entry point is `canonicalize` (with a `canonicalize_with` variant for "
"choosing the hash), producing canonical blank-node labels and, one layer up "
"in `purrdf-rdf`, canonical flat N-Quads over the frozen IR:"
msgstr ""
"入口点是 `canonicalize`（另有 `canonicalize_with` 变体用于选择哈希），它产出"
"规范的空节点标签，并在上一层的 `purrdf-rdf` 中，基于冻结的 IR 产出规范的扁平 "
"N-Quads："

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:28
msgid ""
"// Canonical labels are stable across runs, hosts, and language bindings.\n"
msgstr "// 规范标签在不同运行、不同宿主与不同语言绑定之间保持稳定。\n"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:32
msgid ""
"Use canonicalization when you need a content identity for a graph: hashing, "
"signing, deduplication, or comparing datasets produced by different writers."
msgstr ""
"当需要为图确定内容身份时，使用规范化：哈希、签名、去重，或比较由不同写出器产"
"生的数据集。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:35
msgid "Native relabeling with source attribution"
msgstr "带源归属的原生重新标记"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:37
msgid ""
"Use `canonical_relabel` when the next stage consumes a native dataset. It "
"keeps RDF 1.2 terms, reifiers, annotations, graph declarations and source "
"locations without rendering and reparsing a canonical document."
msgstr ""
"当下一阶段消费的是原生数据集时，使用 `canonical_relabel`。它保留 RDF 1.2 项、"
"具体化节点、注解、图声明与源位置，而无须呈现并重新解析一份规范文档。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:41
msgid ""
"When a compiler or analyzer must associate source nodes with that result, "
"use `canonical_relabel_with_mapping`. It records the actual term mapping "
"during the same rebuild, after one canonical-label search:"
msgstr ""
"当编译器或分析器必须把源节点与该结果关联起来时，使用 "
"`canonical_relabel_with_mapping`。它在同一次重建中、经过一次规范标签搜索之"
"后，记录实际的项映射："

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:49
msgid "\"source node not retained\""
msgstr "\"source node not retained\""

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:50
msgid ""
"// Associate source receipts and owner metadata with canonical_value here.\n"
msgstr "// 在此把源回执与所有者元数据关联到 canonical_value。\n"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:55
msgid ""
"`source_node` must belong to the exact input dataset; `output_node` belongs "
"to this result. A same-index ID from another dataset cannot be detected. The "
"map includes nested triple components, literal datatypes, composite embedded "
"blanks and already-interned IRIs, reifier and annotation terms, and empty "
"named graphs. Unused dictionary entries omitted by the rewrite return `None`."
msgstr ""
"`source_node` 必须属于确切的那个输入数据集；`output_node` 属于本结果。来自另"
"一数据集、索引相同的 ID 无法被检测出来。该映射包括嵌套的三元组组成部分、字面"
"量数据类型、复合嵌入的空节点与已驻留的 IRI、具体化节点与注解项，以及空的命名"
"图。被重写省略的未使用字典条目返回 `None`。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:61
msgid ""
"The map uses four bytes per source term, with constant-time lookup. The "
"existing `canonical_relabel` API does not allocate it. The map is not a "
"durable identity or proof certificate: persist resolved RDF identities with "
"authenticated input and output receipts, never raw `TermId` values. Source "
"roles and standpoint ownership remain the caller's metadata, not "
"consequences of canonical labels."
msgstr ""
"该映射为每个源项使用四个字节，查找为常数时间。现有的 `canonical_relabel` API "
"不会分配它。该映射不是持久的身份或证明凭证：应把已解析的 RDF 身份与经过认证的"
"输入和输出回执一起持久化，绝不要持久化原始的 `TermId` 值。源角色与立场"
"（standpoint）归属仍然是调用方的元数据，而不是规范标签的推论。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:67
msgid "Over RDF 1.2 constructs: two forms, named apart"
msgstr "在 RDF 1.2 构造之上：两种形式，以不同的名字区分"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:69
msgid ""
"RDFC-1.0 has no notion of reifiers, annotations or triple terms. A dataset "
"that is plain RDF 1.1 canonicalizes identically everywhere in PurRDF; one "
"that carries those constructs canonicalizes in one of two forms, and which "
"one you are holding is part of the identity:"
msgstr ""
"RDFC-1.0 没有具体化节点、注解或三元组项的概念。纯 RDF 1.1 的数据集在 PurRDF "
"中处处以相同方式规范化；携带这些构造的数据集则以两种形式之一规范化，而所持有"
"的是哪一种，本身就是身份的一部分："

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:74
msgid ""
"**The flat form** — `canonical_flat_nquads` in `purrdf-rdf` rewrites the "
"statement layer to plain `rdf:reifies` / annotation triples first and "
"canonicalizes _that_ triple set under conformant RDFC-1.0. This is what the "
"CLI's `convert --canonical`, the wasm `Dataset.canonicalize()` and the W3C "
"conformance gate run."
msgstr ""
"**扁平形式**——`purrdf-rdf` 中的 `canonical_flat_nquads` 先把陈述层重写为普通"
"的 `rdf:reifies` / 注解三元组，再在符合规范的 RDFC-1.0 下对*该*三元组集合进行"
"规范化。CLI 的 `convert --canonical`、wasm 的 `Dataset.canonicalize()` 以及 "
"W3C 一致性关卡运行的都是这一形式。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:79
msgid ""
"**The `purrdf-rdfc12` v2 profile** — `canonicalize` in `purrdf-core` keeps "
"the statement layer and lowers it into a reserved `urn:purrdf:rdfc:` "
"namespace instead (any input already carrying that namespace is refused, "
"unless it is written in one of the two shapes the profile itself emits — "
"those fold back into the statement layer, which is what makes "
"canonicalization idempotent over its own output). It agrees with RDFC-1.0 "
"byte for byte only on the RDF 1.1 subset, and a digest taken over its output "
"**must not be labelled RDFC-1.0**; `CANON_PROFILE_ID` / "
"`CANON_PROFILE_VERSION` name the profile at runtime. The normative text is "
"[`docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/"
"purrdf/blob/main/docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`purrdf-rdfc12` v2 profile**——`purrdf-core` 中的 `canonicalize` 保留陈述"
"层，并改为将其降级到保留的 `urn:purrdf:rdfc:` 命名空间中（任何已经携带该命名"
"空间的输入都会被拒绝，除非它以该 profile 自身所输出的两种形态之一写成——这些形"
"态会折叠回陈述层，这正是规范化在其自身输出上具有幂等性的原因）。它仅在 RDF "
"1.1 子集上与 RDFC-1.0 逐字节一致，对其输出所取的摘要**不得标记为 RDFC-1.0**；"
"`CANON_PROFILE_ID` / `CANON_PROFILE_VERSION` 在运行时指明该 profile。规范性文"
"本是 [`docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/"
"purrdf/blob/main/docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md)。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:91
msgid "Isomorphism"
msgstr "同构"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:93
msgid ""
"`datasets_isomorphic(a, b)` decides whether two frozen datasets are RDF-"
"structurally isomorphic: the same quads under a blank-node bijection. "
"Canonicalization gives the equivalent verdict — two datasets are isomorphic "
"iff their canonicalizations are equal — but the direct check is the "
"convenient form for tests and harnesses. PurRDF's own conformance harnesses "
"use RDFC-1.0 isomorphism to compare, for example, SHACL Rules output graphs "
"against expected inferred graphs."
msgstr ""
"`datasets_isomorphic(a, b)` 判定两个冻结的数据集是否在 RDF 结构上同构：即在某"
"个空节点双射下具有相同的四元组。规范化给出等价的裁决——两个数据集同构，当且仅"
"当它们的规范化结果相等——但直接检查是测试与测试框架中更方便的形式。例如，"
"PurRDF 自己的一致性测试框架使用 RDFC-1.0 同构来比较 SHACL Rules 的输出图与预"
"期的推理图。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:101
msgid "Diff"
msgstr "Diff"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:103
msgid ""
"`dataset_diff(a, b)` produces a structural diff between two frozen datasets, "
"including an `isomorphic` verdict. For a human-facing review flow, `purrdf-"
"rdf` additionally provides per-subject Symmetric-CBD extraction "
"(\"describe\") and a review-friendly Turtle normalizer, so a graph change "
"reads like a code change."
msgstr ""
"`dataset_diff(a, b)` 在两个冻结的数据集之间产生结构化 diff，其中包括一个 "
"`isomorphic` 裁决。对于面向人工审阅的流程，`purrdf-rdf` 还提供按主语的对称 "
"CBD（Symmetric-CBD）提取（\"describe\"）以及一个便于审阅的 Turtle 归一化器，"
"从而使图的变更读起来就像代码变更。"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:109
msgid "Choosing the right tool"
msgstr "选择合适的工具"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:111
msgid "Need"
msgstr "需求"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:111
msgid "Use"
msgstr "使用"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:113
msgid "Same dataset → same bytes"
msgstr "同一数据集 → 相同字节"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:113
msgid "any native serializer (always true)"
msgstr "任何原生序列化器（始终成立）"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:114
msgid "Same _graph_ (up to blank nodes) → same bytes, RDF 1.1 subset"
msgstr "同一*图*（在空节点意义下）→ 相同字节，RDF 1.1 子集"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:114
msgid "RDFC-1.0 (`canonicalize` or `canonical_flat_nquads`, identical here)"
msgstr "RDFC-1.0（`canonicalize` 或 `canonical_flat_nquads`，此处二者相同）"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:115
msgid "Same _graph_ with reifiers/annotations → same bytes"
msgstr "带具体化节点/注解的同一*图* → 相同字节"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:115
msgid ""
"`canonical_flat_nquads` (RDFC-1.0 over the flattened layer) or "
"`canonicalize` (`purrdf-rdfc12` profile) — not interchangeable"
msgstr ""
"`canonical_flat_nquads`（在扁平化层上运行 RDFC-1.0）或 `canonicalize`"
"（`purrdf-rdfc12` profile）——二者不可互换"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:116
msgid "\"Are these two datasets the same graph?\""
msgstr "「这两个数据集是同一张图吗？」"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:116
msgid "`datasets_isomorphic`"
msgstr "`datasets_isomorphic`"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:117
msgid "\"What changed between these datasets?\""
msgstr "「这两个数据集之间有什么变化？」"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:117
msgid "`dataset_diff` + describe/normalize"
msgstr "`dataset_diff` + describe/normalize"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:118
msgid "Content-addressed transport of a graph"
msgstr "图的内容寻址传输"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:118
msgid "[GTS](../gts.md) (BLAKE3 content ids)"
msgstr "[GTS](../gts.md)（BLAKE3 内容 id）"

#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:120
msgid ""
"API details are on [docs.rs/purrdf-core](https://docs.rs/purrdf-core) (the "
"`canonicalize`, `datasets_isomorphic`, and `dataset_diff` items) and "
"[docs.rs/purrdf-rdf](https://docs.rs/purrdf-rdf) (describe and "
"normalization)."
msgstr ""
"API 细节见 [docs.rs/purrdf-core](https://docs.rs/purrdf-core)"
"（`canonicalize`、`datasets_isomorphic` 与 `dataset_diff` 条目）与 [docs.rs/"
"purrdf-rdf](https://docs.rs/purrdf-rdf)（describe 与归一化）。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:6
msgid "SPARQL: Querying"
msgstr "SPARQL：查询"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:8
msgid ""
"PurRDF's SPARQL stack is native and three-layered, gated by the W3C SPARQL "
"1.1 and 1.2 conformance suites:"
msgstr ""
"PurRDF 的 SPARQL 栈为原生实现，分为三层，并以 W3C SPARQL 1.1 与 1.2 一致性测"
"试套件把关："

#: src/sparql/querying.md:11
msgid ""
"**[`purrdf-sparql-algebra`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-sparql-algebra)** — "
"parses query and update text into a PurRDF-owned, RDF 1.2-native query "
"algebra (`Query`/`GraphPattern`, `Update`/`GraphUpdateOperation`). Parse and "
"algebra only."
msgstr ""
"**[`purrdf-sparql-algebra`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-sparql-algebra)** —— 把查"
"询与更新文本解析为由 PurRDF 自有、原生支持 RDF 1.2 的查询代数（`Query`/"
"`GraphPattern`、`Update`/`GraphUpdateOperation`）。仅负责解析与代数。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:15
msgid ""
"**[`purrdf-sparql-eval`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-sparql-eval)** — the "
"multiset evaluator over the frozen IR's `DatasetView`, entirely in interned "
"`TermId` space."
msgstr ""
"**[`purrdf-sparql-eval`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-sparql-eval)** —— 基于冻结 "
"IR 的 `DatasetView` 的多重集求值器，完全在驻留的 `TermId` 空间中运行。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:18
msgid ""
"**[`purrdf-sparql-results`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-sparql-results)** — the "
"results boundary ([next chapter](results.md))."
msgstr ""
"**[`purrdf-sparql-results`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-sparql-results)** —— 结果"
"边界（[下一章](results.md)）。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:21
msgid "All three are re-exported under `purrdf::sparql`."
msgstr "三者都在 `purrdf::sparql` 下重新导出。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:23
msgid "A first query"
msgstr "第一个查询"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:28
msgid "// A tiny dataset in interned TermId space.\n"
msgstr "// 驻留 TermId 空间中的一个微型数据集。\n"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:36
msgid "// Evaluate through the SparqlEngine seam; parsed plans are memoized.\n"
msgstr "// 通过 SparqlEngine 扩展点求值；解析后的计划会被记忆化缓存。\n"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:40
msgid ""
"\"SELECT ?what WHERE { <https://example.org/cat> <https://example.org/says> ?"
"what }\""
msgstr ""
"\"SELECT ?what WHERE { <https://example.org/cat> <https://example.org/says> ?"
"what }\""

#: src/sparql/querying.md:43
msgid "\"evaluates\""
msgstr "\"evaluates\""

#: src/sparql/querying.md:50
msgid ""
"The `SparqlEngine` trait itself lives in `purrdf-core`, so hosts can swap "
"engines behind one seam; `NativeSparqlEngine` is the shipped implementation."
msgstr ""
"`SparqlEngine` trait 本身位于 `purrdf-core` 中，因此宿主可以在同一个扩展点背"
"后替换引擎；`NativeSparqlEngine` 是随附的实现。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:53
msgid "What the front-end covers"
msgstr "前端覆盖的范围"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:55
msgid ""
"**Query** — all four query forms (SELECT/ASK/CONSTRUCT/DESCRIBE), basic "
"graph patterns, `OPTIONAL`, `UNION`, `MINUS`, `GRAPH`, `FILTER`/`BIND`/"
"`VALUES`, property paths, `GROUP BY`/aggregates, `EXISTS`/`NOT EXISTS`, "
"solution modifiers, RDF 1.2 quoted triple terms (`<<( s p o )>>`), `LATERAL` "
"(a SEP-0006 extension — see [below](#lateral-sep-0006)), and the SEP-0009 "
"composite datatypes with their `FOLD` aggregate and `UNFOLD` graph pattern "
"(see [below](#composite-datatypes-sep-0009))."
msgstr ""
"**查询** —— 全部四种查询形式（SELECT/ASK/CONSTRUCT/DESCRIBE）、基本图模式、"
"`OPTIONAL`、`UNION`、`MINUS`、`GRAPH`、`FILTER`/`BIND`/`VALUES`、属性路径、"
"`GROUP BY`/聚合、`EXISTS`/`NOT EXISTS`、解修饰符、RDF 1.2 引用三元组项"
"（`<<( s p o )>>`）、`LATERAL`（SEP-0006 扩展，见[下文](#lateralsep-0006)），"
"以及 SEP-0009 复合数据类型及其 `FOLD` 聚合与 `UNFOLD` 图模式（见[下文](#复合"
"数据类型sep-0009)）。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:63
msgid ""
"**Update** — `INSERT DATA`/`DELETE DATA`, the `DELETE`/`INSERT … WHERE` "
"family (`WITH`/`USING`, `DELETE WHERE`), `LOAD`, and `CLEAR`/`DROP`/`CREATE`/"
"`ADD`/`MOVE`/`COPY`."
msgstr ""
"**更新** —— `INSERT DATA`/`DELETE DATA`、`DELETE`/`INSERT … WHERE` 系列"
"（`WITH`/`USING`、`DELETE WHERE`）、`LOAD`，以及 `CLEAR`/`DROP`/`CREATE`/"
"`ADD`/`MOVE`/`COPY`。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:66
msgid ""
"**Beyond the grammar** — everything else arrives through the caller-keyed "
"extension seams described further down this page, never as new syntax: [path "
"witnesses](#path-witnesses-binding-the-derivation-not-the-endpoints), [full-"
"text search](full-text.md), [GeoSPARQL](geosparql.md) and [embedding nearest "
"neighbours](embedding-knn.md) are each a property function (or, for the "
"`geof:` family, a scalar function) registered under an IRI the caller "
"supplies."
msgstr ""
"**语法之外** —— 其余一切都经由本页后文描述的、由调用方提供键的扩展点进入，绝"
"不以新语法的形式出现：[路径见证](#路径见证绑定推导过程而不是端点)、[全文检索]"
"(full-text.md)、[GeoSPARQL](geosparql.md) 与[嵌入最近邻](embedding-knn.md)，"
"各自都是注册在调用方所提供 IRI 下的一个属性函数（对 `geof:` 系列而言，则是标"
"量函数）。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:74
msgid ""
"Anything outside this surface — and every malformed query — is a typed "
"`ParseError`, never a silently degraded parse."
msgstr ""
"超出这一接口的任何内容——以及每一个格式错误的查询——都是带类型的 `ParseError`，"
"绝不会是静默降级的解析结果。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:77
msgid "How the evaluator works"
msgstr "求值器的工作方式"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:79
msgid ""
"**Multiset (bag) semantics** — solutions are a bag, preserved until "
"`DISTINCT`/`REDUCED`, per the SPARQL algebra."
msgstr ""
"**多重集（bag）语义** —— 按照 SPARQL 代数，解是一个多重集，在 `DISTINCT`/"
"`REDUCED` 之前一直保持。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:81
msgid ""
"**Interned evaluation** — constants resolve to a dataset `TermId` once; "
"solution comparison is an integer compare; computed FILTER/BIND values that "
"already exist in the dataset are promoted to the interned id at mint time."
msgstr ""
"**驻留求值** —— 常量只解析一次，得到数据集中的 `TermId`；解的比较是整数比较；"
"计算出的 FILTER/BIND 值若已存在于数据集中，会在生成时提升为驻留 id。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:84
msgid ""
"**Property paths in-engine** — the full path algebra (`* + ? / | ^ !()`) "
"evaluated over the same indexed surface, wasm-safe."
msgstr ""
"**引擎内属性路径** —— 完整的路径代数（`* + ? / | ^ !()`）在同一个带索引的接口"
"上求值，且 wasm 安全。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:86
msgid ""
"**Cost-based BGP planning** — join order is chosen by a cost model; "
"`NativeSparqlEngine::explain_query` exposes the chosen order as an ordered "
"list of triple-pattern strings so you can audit planner decisions without "
"running the query."
msgstr ""
"**基于代价的 BGP 规划** —— 连接顺序由代价模型选定；"
"`NativeSparqlEngine::explain_query` 以三元组模式字符串的有序列表形式公开所选"
"顺序，从而无需运行查询即可审查规划器的决策。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:90
msgid ""
"**`EXISTS`/`NOT EXISTS`, defensibly** — one substitution-based definition "
"(SEP-0007), answered either by a memoized existence probe or by the per-row "
"definition itself, chosen per site by a prepare-time admissibility proof — "
"see [below](#exists-under-sep-0007)."
msgstr ""
"**`EXISTS`/`NOT EXISTS`，有据可依** —— 采用单一的、基于替换的定义"
"（SEP-0007），其应答要么来自记忆化的存在性探测，要么来自逐行定义本身，二者按"
"调用位置由预备阶段的可采纳性证明选定——见[下文](#sep-0007-下的-exists)。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:94
msgid ""
"**The SERVICE seam** — `SERVICE` federation is evaluated through a **host-"
"injectable `ServiceResolver`**: the engine itself performs no I/O, so "
"federation stays wasm-portable and the host decides how (and whether) remote "
"endpoints are reached — down to per-service headers, credentials and "
"capabilities (see [below](#per-service-context-the-serviceresolver-seam)). "
"Where it stops: PurRDF ships no HTTP client (the exchange is an "
"`HttpTransport` trait the Rust host implements) and no shipped surface — "
"CLI, Python, wasm or C — installs a resolver, so a non-`SILENT` `SERVICE` or "
"`LOAD` there fails by name; federation is a Rust-host composition. All seven "
"W3C `service` federation cases pass through this seam. The forwarded body is "
"re-emitted through the deterministic serializer — the federation wire format "
"— whose parse → serialize → re-parse fidelity is swept over the 823-item "
"corpus (every vendored W3C and first-party query and update text, plus this "
"book's own examples) with an empty exception ledger."
msgstr ""
"**SERVICE 扩展点** —— `SERVICE` 联邦查询通过一个**可由宿主注入的 "
"`ServiceResolver`** 求值：引擎本身不执行任何 I/O，因此联邦查询保持 wasm 可移"
"植，并由宿主决定如何（以及是否）到达远程端点——细至每个服务的请求头、凭据与能"
"力（见[下文](#逐服务上下文serviceresolver-扩展点)）。其边界在于：PurRDF 不随"
"附任何 HTTP 客户端（交换通过 Rust 宿主实现的 `HttpTransport` trait 进行），且"
"任何随附的接口——CLI、Python、wasm 或 C——都不会安装解析器，因此在这些接口上，"
"非 `SILENT` 的 `SERVICE` 或 `LOAD` 会点名失败；联邦查询是 Rust 宿主的组合能"
"力。全部七个 W3C `service` 联邦测试用例都经由这一扩展点通过。转发的查询体通过"
"确定性序列化器重新输出——即联邦查询的线上格式——其「解析 → 序列化 → 重新解析」"
"的保真度已在包含 823 项的语料上全面检验（每一份随库固化的 W3C 与第一方查询和"
"更新文本，加上本书自身的示例），例外台账为空。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:110
msgid ""
"**Governed twins and explain receipts** — every query/update entry point has "
"a governed counterpart running under caller-set ceilings (fuel, answer rows, "
"intermediate cells, scratch bytes, remote requests, deadline) that trips "
"with certified rows rather than a wrong answer, and `explain_query` returns "
"a `QueryExplanation` whose ledger decomposes the fuel spent per algebra node "
"and per charge point, beside the cost planner's estimate for each basic "
"graph pattern. The normative charge schedule and the frozen 50-case governor "
"corpus are documented in [`docs/SPARQL-GOVERNOR-PROFILE.md`](https://"
"github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/SPARQL-GOVERNOR-"
"PROFILE.md)."
msgstr ""
"**受治理的孪生入口与 explain 回执** —— 每个查询/更新入口都有一个受治理的对应"
"入口，在调用方设定的上限（燃料（fuel）、答案行数、中间单元格数、暂存字节数、"
"远程请求数、截止时间）下运行，触发时给出经认证的行，而不是错误答案；"
"`explain_query` 返回一个 `QueryExplanation`，其台账按代数节点与计费点分解所消"
"耗的燃料，并附上代价规划器对每个基本图模式的估计。规范性计费表与冻结的 50 例 "
"governor（执行调控器）语料记录在 [`docs/SPARQL-GOVERNOR-PROFILE.md`](https://"
"github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/SPARQL-GOVERNOR-"
"PROFILE.md) 中。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:119
msgid ""
"**Hard-fail** — an out-of-scope algebra node or unimplemented builtin is a "
"typed `EvalError::Unsupported`, never a partial or wrong answer."
msgstr ""
"**硬失败** —— 超出范围的代数节点或未实现的内置函数都是带类型的 "
"`EvalError::Unsupported`，绝不会是部分或错误的答案。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:122
msgid "SPARQL 1.2 temporal arithmetic and adjustment"
msgstr "SPARQL 1.2 时间运算与调整"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:124
msgid ""
"`+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, and unary `-` extend past the numeric tower to "
"`xsd:dateTime`/`xsd:date`/`xsd:time` (instants), `xsd:duration` and its two "
"subtypes `xsd:dayTimeDuration`/`xsd:yearMonthDuration`, and the five "
"Gregorian partial-date types (`xsd:gYearMonth`, `xsd:gYear`, `xsd:gMonth`, "
"`xsd:gMonthDay`, `xsd:gDay`). The SPARQL 1.2 Query specification's own text "
"defines no arithmetic beyond the numeric tower; the one documented table is "
"[SEP-0002](https://github.com/w3c/sparql-dev/blob/main/SEP/SEP-0002/"
"sep-0002.md)'s, which this section follows for coverage. `ADJUST` (below) is "
"SEP-0002's remaining, non-arithmetic addition."
msgstr ""
"`+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 以及一元 `-` 的适用范围超出数值类型体系，扩展到 "
"`xsd:dateTime`/`xsd:date`/`xsd:time`（时刻）、`xsd:duration` 及其两个子类型 "
"`xsd:dayTimeDuration`/`xsd:yearMonthDuration`，以及五种公历部分日期类型"
"（`xsd:gYearMonth`、`xsd:gYear`、`xsd:gMonth`、`xsd:gMonthDay`、"
"`xsd:gDay`）。SPARQL 1.2 Query 规范自身的正文未定义数值类型体系之外的任何运"
"算；唯一有文档记载的表格来自 [SEP-0002](https://github.com/w3c/sparql-dev/"
"blob/main/SEP/SEP-0002/sep-0002.md)，本节的覆盖范围即依照该表。`ADJUST`（见下"
"文）是 SEP-0002 其余的、非运算类的新增内容。"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:134
msgid "The operator table"
msgstr "运算符表"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:136
msgid ""
"SEP-0002's table has 24 rows: 11 are comparisons (`<`/`>` between two "
"`yearMonthDuration`s or two `dayTimeDuration`s, `=` between two `duration`s, "
"and `=`/`<`/`>` between two `date`s or two `time`s), already covered by "
"ordinary value comparison. The remaining 13 are arithmetic:"
msgstr ""
"SEP-0002 的表格共有 24 行：其中 11 行是比较（两个 `yearMonthDuration` 之间或"
"两个 `dayTimeDuration` 之间的 `<`/`>`，两个 `duration` 之间的 `=`，以及两个 "
"`date` 之间或两个 `time` 之间的 `=`/`<`/`>`），已由普通的值比较覆盖。其余 13 "
"行是运算："

#: src/sparql/querying.md:141
msgid "Operands"
msgstr "操作数"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:141 src/sparql/querying.md:932
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: src/sparql/querying.md:143
