msgstr "0"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:46
msgid "`?neighbour`"
msgstr "`?neighbour`"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:46
msgid "**out**: the RDF term whose vector was retrieved"
msgstr "**输出**：其向量被检索到的 RDF 项"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:47
msgid "`?query`"
msgstr "`?query`"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:47
msgid "**in**: the term whose vector seeds the search"
msgstr "**输入**：以其向量作为搜索种子的项"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:48
msgid "`k`"
msgstr "`k`"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:48
msgid "**in**: how many neighbours to retrieve"
msgstr "**输入**：要检索多少个近邻"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:49
msgid "`?distance`"
msgstr "`?distance`"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:49
msgid "**out**: the distance, as `xsd:double`"
msgstr "**输出**：距离，类型为 `xsd:double`"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:51
msgid ""
"The one declared mode is `fbbf`: the seed and `k` are inputs the relation "
"cannot enumerate, while `?neighbour` and `?distance` may each be bound or "
"free. `k` accepts any integer-derived datatype (`xsd:integer`, `xsd:int`, "
"`xsd:long`, `xsd:nonNegativeInteger`, …); `k = 0` is a valid request for "
"zero neighbours. A seed with no vector in the space is an **empty answer**, "
"not an abort — otherwise every query ranging a seed over partly-embedded "
"terms would die."
msgstr ""
"唯一声明的模式是 `fbbf`：种子与 `k` 是该关系无法枚举的输入，而 `?neighbour` "
"与 `?distance` 各自可以是已绑定或自由的。`k` 接受任何由整数派生的数据类型"
"（`xsd:integer`、`xsd:int`、`xsd:long`、`xsd:nonNegativeInteger`……）；`k = "
"0` 是请求零个近邻的有效请求。在该空间中没有向量的种子得到的是**空答案**，而不"
"是中止——否则，每个让种子遍历部分已嵌入项的查询都会失败终止。"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:59
msgid "PurRDF mints no IRI for this"
msgstr "PurRDF 不为此生成任何 IRI"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:61
msgid ""
"The predicate is the caller's, and it is how a query names a space: a host "
"builds one `EmbeddingSpace` per `(artifact, target set, vector space)` "
"triple it wants queryable and registers an `EmbeddingKnnRelation` over it "
"under whatever IRI its own vocabulary uses. There is no default IRI and no "
"fallback space. Registering one relation per space — rather than one "
"relation taking a space IRI as an argument — is what lets the planner read "
"an honest row bound off the space that will actually be searched."
msgstr ""
"谓词属于调用方，它是查询为空间命名的方式：宿主为每个希望可查询的 `(artifact, "
"target set, vector space)` 三元组构建一个 `EmbeddingSpace`，并在其自身词汇所"
"用的任意 IRI 之下，为其注册一个 `EmbeddingKnnRelation`。没有默认 IRI，也没有"
"后备空间。每个空间注册一个关系——而不是用一个关系把空间 IRI 作为参数——正是这一"
"点让规划器能从实际将被搜索的空间读出一个如实的行数上界。"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:72
msgid ""
"// The guard is caller-supplied configuration with no default: the largest\n"
"// space one invocation may scan, and the largest `k` it may request.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 守卫是调用方提供的配置，没有默认值：一次调用可扫描的\n"
"// 最大空间，以及它可请求的最大 `k`。\n"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:75
msgid "/* max_candidates */"
msgstr "/* max_candidates */"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:75
msgid "/* max_neighbours */"
msgstr "/* max_neighbours */"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:76
msgid ""
"// `bindings` names the RDF term each PURREMB row stands for. A row with no\n"
"// term is a construction-time refusal, not a skipped row — a top-k over a\n"
"// silently smaller candidate set would be the top-k of a subset.\n"
msgstr ""
"// `bindings` 为每个 PURREMB 行指明其所代表的 RDF 项。没有项的行\n"
"// 会在构造时被拒绝，而不是被跳过——在一个被静默缩小的候选集上\n"
"// 求 top-k，得到的只是某个子集的 top-k。\n"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:86
msgid "\"https://example.org/space/points\""
msgstr "\"https://example.org/space/points\""

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:91
msgid ""
"The registry then reaches the engine through "
"`QueryOptions::property_functions` exactly as on the [full-text](full-"
"text.md) page. This is a Rust-host seam."
msgstr ""
"随后，注册表经由 `QueryOptions::property_functions` 到达引擎，与[全文检索]"
"(full-text.md)一页完全相同。这是一个 Rust 宿主扩展点。"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:94
msgid "Exact search, ordered under the declared metric"
msgstr "精确搜索，按所声明的度量排序"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:96
msgid ""
"The search is **exact**: every candidate row is scored under the metric the "
"space's family contract declares (`FamilyView::metric()` — cosine or squared "
"Euclidean disagree on real data, and a surface using one kernel for both "
"fails the tests that pin them apart), and the `k` returned are the true `k` "
"nearest. There is no candidate pruning anywhere. That is what lets the "
"engine's row-ceiling pushdown be sound here — emission order _is_ rank "
"order, so the first `n` rows are the `n` nearest for every `n ≤ k` — and "
"what makes \"ordered correctly\" a property the module is tested for rather "
"than a property of a tuning parameter."
msgstr ""
"搜索是**精确的**：每个候选行都在该空间所属族契约声明的度量"
"（`FamilyView::metric()`）下打分——余弦与平方欧氏距离在真实数据上结果不同，而"
"对两者使用同一个内核的接口会在把二者区分开的测试中失败——返回的 `k` 个就是真正"
"最近的 `k` 个。任何地方都不做候选剪枝。正因如此，引擎的行数上限下推在这里才是"
"可靠的——输出顺序*就是*排名顺序，因此对每个 `n ≤ k`，前 `n` 行就是最近的 `n` "
"个——也正因如此，「排序正确」是本模块经过测试的属性，而不是某个调优参数的属"
"性。"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:106
msgid ""
"Rank order is `(distance ASC, row ASC)`. Row numbers are distinct, so the "
"order is strict and total, and the tie-break is meaningful: a PURREMB target "
"set is sorted and deduplicated by `TargetId`, a digest of canonical "
"identity, so ascending row number _is_ ascending canonical content order. "
"Two artifacts built from the same content in opposite insertion orders "
"answer byte for byte, serialized JSON included."
msgstr ""
"排名顺序为 `(distance ASC, row ASC)`。行号互不相同，因此该顺序是严格的全序，"
"而平局裁决也有意义：PURREMB 目标集按 `TargetId`（规范标识的摘要）排序并去重，"
"因此行号升序*就是*规范内容的升序。以相反插入顺序、由相同内容构建出的两个工"
"件，作答逐字节相同，包括序列化后的 JSON。"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:113
msgid "Binary64, in a pinned order"
msgstr "binary64，按固定顺序"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:115
msgid ""
"The workspace's other ranked-retrieval surface forbids floating point "
"entirely, because BM25 needs a logarithm and IEEE-754 does not require `ln` "
"to be correctly rounded. That reason does not transfer. A kNN kernel needs "
"no transcendental — subtraction, multiplication, addition, division and "
"square root are all correctly rounded — so binary64 gives the _same_ cross-"
"target guarantee here. `docs/PURREMB.md` fixes the artifact's own folds "
"normatively (\"binary64, round-to-nearest ties-to-even, in the written "
"order, without a fused multiply-add\"), and the L2 norm is one of them, so "
"the kNN surface uses `purrdf_core`'s normative norm fold rather than a copy "
"of it. Fixed point would have introduced a quantization step the format does "
"not have."
msgstr ""
"工作区中另一个带排名的检索接口完全禁止浮点数，因为 BM25 需要对数，而 "
"IEEE-754 并不要求 `ln` 正确舍入。这一理由在此并不适用。k 近邻内核不需要任何超"
"越函数——减法、乘法、加法、除法与平方根都是正确舍入的——因此 binary64 在这里给"
"出*同样的*跨目标保证。`docs/PURREMB.md` 以规范性条文固定了工件自身的归约"
"（「binary64，就近舍入、平局取偶，按书写顺序，不使用融合乘加」），L2 范数就是"
"其中之一，因此 k 近邻接口使用 `purrdf_core` 中规范性的范数归约，而不是它的一"
"份副本。定点数会引入一个该格式本身并不具有的量化步骤。"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:126
msgid ""
"The two residual hazards are closed structurally. Every dot product and "
"squared Euclidean sum follows one pinned law, `purrdf_core::distance::Exact` "
"(`binary64-lane16-tree-v1`): sixteen binary64 lanes over the whole sixteen-"
"element chunks, a fixed pairwise tree, then the remaining terms in ascending "
"index, never split across workers. It is the same order on every target and "
"dispatch path, and its independent lanes are what lets it vectorize without "
"licensing any reordering (a test folds a vector whose lane-tree sum is `1` "
"and whose sequential sums are `0`, and pins which). Every product is bound "
"to a named local before it is added, so no fused multiply-add can form, and "
"a thread whose float environment flushes subnormals is refused by name. "
"Distances are emitted as `xsd:double`, whose canonical lexical round-trips "
"the exact bits — a rounded decimal would print two adjacent doubles alike "
"and hide exactly the divergence this is about."
msgstr ""
"两个残余风险在结构上被消除。每一次点积求和与平方欧氏距离求和都遵循同一条固定"
"的法则 `purrdf_core::distance::Exact`（`binary64-lane16-tree-v1`）：在所有完"
"整的十六元素分块上使用十六条 binary64 通道，随后是一棵固定的两两归约树，最后"
"按下标升序处理剩余项，且绝不拆分到多个工作线程。它在每个目标、每条分派路径上"
"都是同一顺序，而正是相互独立的通道让它无需允许任何重新排序就能向量化（一个测"
"试对某个向量做归约：按通道树求和得 `1`，按顺序求和得 `0`，并固定采用哪一"
"种）。每个乘积在被累加之前都先绑定到一个具名局部变量，因此不会形成融合乘加；"
"若某线程的浮点环境会把次正规数冲刷为零，该线程会以具名错误被拒绝。距离以 "
"`xsd:double` 输出，其规范词法形式能往返还原精确的比特——舍入后的十进制表示会把"
"两个相邻的 double 打印成同一个值，恰好掩盖本节所讨论的那种分歧。"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:139
msgid ""
"One limit, stated rather than hidden: cosine self-distance is not exactly "
"zero (`dot(v, v)` and `|v|·|v|` are two roundings of one real number), so a "
"seed ranks strictly ahead of every other direction rather than at a zero "
"that is not there."
msgstr ""
"有一个限制在此明说而不隐藏：余弦自距离并不恰好为零（`dot(v, v)` 与 `|v|·|v|` "
"是对同一个实数的两次舍入），因此种子会严格排在其他所有方向之前，而不是排在一"
"个并不存在的零处。"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:144
msgid "What a search costs"
msgstr "一次搜索的代价"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:146
msgid ""
"The governor's earlier charge points priced a host relation by invocations "
"driven and rows accepted. For a generator, neither is where the cost is: a "
"scan over a million vectors returning five rows would have been priced like "
"a six-row table scan. The relation therefore reports its internal work "
"through `PfCursor::take_work` after every pull, and the engine spends one "
"unit of fuel per reported unit — so the search charge follows the space "
"size, not the rows returned, and a `KnnGuard` is what keeps both the charge "
"and the planner's row bound honest."
msgstr ""
"governor（执行调控器）早先的计费点按驱动的调用次数与接受的行数为宿主关系定"
"价。对于生成器，代价并不在这两处：在一百万个向量上扫描并返回五行，本会被定价"
"得像一次六行的表扫描。因此，该关系在每次拉取之后都通过 `PfCursor::take_work` "
"报告其内部工作量，而引擎对报告的每一单位工作量消耗一单位燃料——于是搜索的计费"
"随空间大小而变化，而不是随返回的行数，而 `KnnGuard` 正是让计费与规划器的行数"
"上界都保持如实的东西。"

#: src/sparql/embedding-knn.md:155
msgid ""
"The design record — the four decisions that were not obvious and what fixed "
"each — is [`docs/design/purrdf-embedding-knn.md`](https://github.com/"
"Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/design/purrdf-embedding-knn.md)."
msgstr ""
"设计记录——四项并不显而易见的决定以及各自是由什么确定的——见 [`docs/design/"
"purrdf-embedding-knn.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/"
"blob/main/docs/design/purrdf-embedding-knn.md)。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:8
msgid ""
"[`purrdf-shapes`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-shapes) (re-exported as "
"`purrdf::shapes`) is PurRDF's native SHACL validator and rules engine. It "
"implements **SHACL 1.2**: Core, SPARQL Extensions, Node Expressions, "
"Inference Rules and the SPARQL 1.2 RL rule language, plus the SHACL-AF 1.0 "
"spellings those documents supersede. It runs entirely on PurRDF's own "
"interned IR and native SPARQL engine (no oxigraph, no PyO3)."
msgstr ""
"[`purrdf-shapes`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-shapes)（重新导出为 "
"`purrdf::shapes`）是 PurRDF 的原生 SHACL 验证器与规则引擎。它实现了 **SHACL "
"1.2**：Core、SPARQL 扩展、节点表达式、推理规则以及 SPARQL 1.2 RL 规则语言，外"
"加被这些文档取代的 SHACL-AF 1.0 拼写。它完全运行在 PurRDF 自己的驻留 IR 与原"
"生 SPARQL 引擎之上（不含 oxigraph，不含 PyO3）。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:15
msgid ""
"It validates an RDF 1.2 data graph against a SHACL shapes graph with **no "
"inference** (parity with pySHACL `inference=\"none\"`); combine with "
"[Entailment](../entailment.md) if you want to validate a materialized "
"closure, or declare `sh:entailment sh:RulesEntailment` to run the shapes "
"graph's own rules first."
msgstr ""
"它依据 SHACL 形状图验证 RDF 1.2 数据图，**不做任何推理**（与 pySHACL "
"`inference=\"none\"` 一致）；若要验证物化后的推理闭包，可与[蕴涵](../"
"entailment.md)组合使用，或声明 `sh:entailment sh:RulesEntailment`，先运行形状"
"图自身的规则。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:21
msgid "What it covers"
msgstr "覆盖范围"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:23
msgid ""
"**SHACL 1.2 Core** — every constraint component the SHACL 1.2 vocabulary "
"declares is evaluated natively: full property paths, qualified value shapes, "
"the list components (`sh:minListLength`, `sh:maxListLength`, "
"`sh:uniqueMembers`, `sh:memberShape`, with `sh:detail` results), list-valued "
"`sh:class`, `sh:datatype` and `sh:nodeKind` (including `sh:TripleTerm`), "
"`sh:singleLine`, `sh:rootClass`, `sh:someValue`, path-valued property pairs "
"and `sh:subsetOf`, `sh:uniqueValuesFor`, `sh:closed sh:ByTypes`, "
"`sh:reifierShape` and `sh:reificationRequired`, and `sh:uniqueLang` over "
"language tag and base direction. A property shape's `sh:values` and "
"`sh:defaultValue` compute value nodes. The targets include implicit class "
"targets (`sh:ShapeClass` too), `sh:shape` in the data graph, "
"`sh:targetWhere` and node-expression `sh:targetNode`. A reifier of a "
"constraint triple can carry `sh:deactivated`, `sh:severity` or `sh:message` "
"for that one constraint. The severities include `sh:Debug` and `sh:Trace`, "
"and conformance follows the request's `sh:conformanceDisallows` set. Every "
"`sh:message` is reported with its language tag and direction."
msgstr ""
"**SHACL 1.2 Core**——SHACL 1.2 词汇表声明的每个约束组件都以原生方式求值：完整"
"的属性路径、限定值形状、列表组件（`sh:minListLength`、`sh:maxListLength`、"
"`sh:uniqueMembers`、`sh:memberShape`，带 `sh:detail` 结果）、三者均可取列表值"
"的 `sh:class`、`sh:datatype` 与 `sh:nodeKind`（`sh:nodeKind` 还可取 "
"`sh:TripleTerm`）、`sh:singleLine`、`sh:rootClass`、`sh:someValue`、属性对与 "
"`sh:subsetOf`（二者均以路径为值）、`sh:uniqueValuesFor`、`sh:closed "
"sh:ByTypes`、`sh:reifierShape` 与 `sh:reificationRequired`，以及按语言标签与"
"基础方向判定的 `sh:uniqueLang`。属性形状的 `sh:values` 与 `sh:defaultValue` "
"会计算值节点。目标包括隐式类目标（`sh:ShapeClass` 亦然）、数据图中的 "
"`sh:shape`、`sh:targetWhere`，以及以节点表达式给出的 `sh:targetNode`。约束三"
"元组的具体化节点可以为这一条约束携带 `sh:deactivated`、`sh:severity` 或 "
"`sh:message`。严重级别包括 `sh:Debug` 与 `sh:Trace`，一致性判定遵循请求中的 "
"`sh:conformanceDisallows` 集合。每条 `sh:message` 都连同其语言标签与方向一起"
"报告。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:39
msgid ""
"**SHACL 1.2 SPARQL Extensions** — SPARQL-based constraints and targets, "
"custom constraint components with pre-binding semantics, user-defined "
"`sh:SPARQLFunction` calls, `sh:SPARQLTargetType`, `sh:sparqlExpr`, and "
"`sh:prefixes` resolved as that document specifies (see [below](#prefixes-in-"
"shacl-sparql-queries)), all on the native SPARQL engine."
msgstr ""
"**SHACL 1.2 SPARQL 扩展**——基于 SPARQL 的约束与目标、具有预绑定语义的自定义约"
"束组件、用户定义的 `sh:SPARQLFunction` 调用、`sh:SPARQLTargetType`、"
"`sh:sparqlExpr`，以及按该文档规定解析的 `sh:prefixes`（见[下文](#shacl-"
"sparql-查询中的前缀)），全部运行在原生 SPARQL 引擎上。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:44
msgid ""
"**SHACL 1.2 Node Expressions** — the `shnex:` vocabulary and the older SHACL-"
"AF `sh:` spelling of a node expression parse to one representation and run "
"through one evaluator. Each expression kind keeps the order and multiplicity "
"its evaluation clause defines: an ordered sequence, a multiset or a set. "
"`sh:if` takes `sh:then` only when its condition is the list `( true )`. The "
"`shnex-sparql.ttl` function library is native. `sh:nodeByExpression` and "
"`sh:ExpressionConstraintComponent` are validated."
msgstr ""
"**SHACL 1.2 节点表达式**——`shnex:` 词汇表与较早的 SHACL-AF `sh:` 节点表达式拼"
"写解析为同一种表示，并由同一个求值器执行。每种表达式都保持其求值条款所规定的"
"顺序与重数：有序序列、多重集或集合。`sh:if` 仅当其条件为列表 `( true )` 时才"
"取 `sh:then`。`shnex-sparql.ttl` 函数库为原生实现。`sh:nodeByExpression` 与 "
"`sh:ExpressionConstraintComponent` 均参与验证。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:51
msgid ""
"**SHACL 1.2 Inference Rules** — `sh:TripleRule` and `sh:SPARQLRule`, with "
"`sh:condition`, `sh:layer`, `sh:order`, `sh:runOnce`, `sh:deactivated`, rule "
"sets and `sh:RulesGraph`, SPARQL rule templates, temporary triples, "
"`sh:expectedPredicate` and `sh:ruleProcessor`. Layers run in ascending "
"order. In each layer the run-once rules run once, then the iterating rules "
"repeat until an iteration infers nothing. Within an iteration, rules run in "
"ascending `sh:order`, rules of the same order run together, and each group "
"sees the inferences of the groups before it, so swapping two rules' orders "
"can change the inferences. An unresolvable `sh:condition` is a load error, "
"not a rule that silently never fires."
msgstr ""
"**SHACL 1.2 推理规则**——`sh:TripleRule` 与 `sh:SPARQLRule`，支持 "
"`sh:condition`、`sh:layer`、`sh:order`、`sh:runOnce`、`sh:deactivated`、规则"
"集与 `sh:RulesGraph`、SPARQL 规则模板、临时三元组、`sh:expectedPredicate` 与 "
"`sh:ruleProcessor`。各层按升序运行。在每一层中，只运行一次的规则先运行一次，"
"随后迭代规则反复执行，直到某次迭代不再推出任何结果。在一次迭代内，规则按 "
"`sh:order` 升序运行，相同次序的规则一起运行，每一组都能看到之前各组的推论，因"
"此交换两条规则的次序可能改变推论。无法解析的 `sh:condition` 是加载错误，而不"
"是一条静默地永不触发的规则。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:61
msgid ""
"**SPARQL 1.2 RL** — the rule language's text syntax is parsed, checked for "
"well-formedness, stratified, imported and evaluated (`purrdf_shapes::srl`). "
"SHACL rules lower to the same rule-set representation, and both run on one "
"rules engine, `purrdf-datalog`."
msgstr ""
"**SPARQL 1.2 RL**——该规则语言的文本语法会被解析、检查良构性、分层、处理导入并"
"求值（`purrdf_shapes::srl`）。SHACL 规则降为同一种规则集表示，二者都运行在同"
"一个规则引擎 `purrdf-datalog` 上。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:66
msgid ""
"A shapes graph is either loaded faithfully or refused. An unknown term, an "
"ill-typed parameter value, or a construct the engine does not evaluate is a "
"load error that names it, never a constraint that silently drops out. The "
"same check covers the nodes of SHACL-SPARQL: a SPARQL-based constraint, a "
"validator and a `sh:SPARQLTarget` may carry only the terms their "
"specification gives them, so an `sh:ask` beside a constraint's `sh:select`, "
"or a misspelled `sh:mesage`, is refused rather than ignored."
msgstr ""
"形状图要么被如实加载，要么被拒绝。未知的术语、类型不符的参数值，或引擎不求值"
"的构造，都会引发点名指出该项的加载错误，绝不会成为一条静默消失的约束。同样的"
"检查也覆盖 SHACL-SPARQL 的节点：基于 SPARQL 的约束、验证器与 "
"`sh:SPARQLTarget` 只能携带其规范赋予它们的术语，因此约束的 `sh:select` 旁的 "
"`sh:ask`，或拼错的 `sh:mesage`，都会被拒绝，而不是被忽略。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:74
msgid ""
"The terms the SHACL vocabularies define and the engine refuses by name are:"
msgstr "SHACL 词汇表定义、而引擎会点名拒绝的术语有："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:76
msgid ""
"the SHACL JavaScript Extensions (`sh:js`, `sh:JSConstraint` and the rest), "
"which are not part of SHACL 1.2; this engine has no JavaScript engine to "
"evaluate them;"
msgstr ""
"SHACL JavaScript 扩展（`sh:js`、`sh:JSConstraint` 等），它们不属于 SHACL "
"1.2；本引擎没有可以求值它们的 JavaScript 引擎；"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:79
msgid ""
"`sh:describe` and `sh:update` on a shape, a node expression, a SPARQL-based "
"constraint, a validator or a rule. The SHACL 1.2 vocabulary declares them as "
"the queries of `sh:SPARQLDescribeExecutable` and "
"`sh:SPARQLUpdateExecutable`, but no SHACL specification executes either "
"class, so in those positions they would otherwise be silently ignored. A "
"resource that is only such an executable, and that no shape reads, loads."
msgstr ""
"出现在形状、节点表达式、基于 SPARQL 的约束、验证器或规则上的 `sh:describe` "
"与 `sh:update`。SHACL 1.2 词汇表把它们声明为 `sh:SPARQLDescribeExecutable` "
"与 `sh:SPARQLUpdateExecutable` 的查询，但没有任何 SHACL 规范执行这两个类，因"
"此在这些位置上，它们否则会被静默忽略。若某个资源仅仅是此类可执行体，且没有任"
"何形状读取它，则它可以加载。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:86
msgid "Two terms the engine used to refuse are now evaluated:"
msgstr "引擎过去拒绝、如今会求值的术语有两个："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:88
msgid ""
"**SHACL-SPARQL result annotations.** A `sh:resultAnnotation` on a SPARQL-"
"based constraint or on a validator of a SPARQL-based constraint component "
"adds its `sh:annotationProperty` to every result the query produces. The "
"value is the solution's binding of `sh:annotationVarName`, or of the "
"property's local name when no name is given. When that variable is unbound, "
"the `sh:annotationValue` defaults are used. An ASK validator's annotations "
"read `this`, `value` and the component's parameters. The annotations appear "
"on `ValidationResult::annotations`, in the report graph, in the SARIF "
"property `shaclResultAnnotations`, in prepared products and in the Python "
"result dicts. A variable name that no SPARQL query could bind is refused at "
"load. So is a SHACL report property such as `sh:focusNode` used as the "
"annotation property."
msgstr ""
"**SHACL-SPARQL 结果注解。** 基于 SPARQL 的约束上、或基于 SPARQL 的约束组件的"
"验证器上的 `sh:resultAnnotation`，会把其 `sh:annotationProperty` 添加到该查询"
"产生的每一条结果中。其值是解中 `sh:annotationVarName` 所指变量的绑定；未给出"
"变量名时，以该属性的本地名作为变量名。该变量未绑定时，使用 "
"`sh:annotationValue` 给出的默认值。ASK 验证器的注解读取 `this`、`value` 与组"
"件的参数。这些注解出现在 `ValidationResult::annotations`、报告图、SARIF 属性 "
"`shaclResultAnnotations`、预备产物以及 Python 结果字典中。任何 SPARQL 查询都"
"无法绑定的变量名会在加载时被拒绝；把 `sh:focusNode` 之类的 SHACL 报告属性用作"
"注解属性，同样会被拒绝。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:100
msgid ""
"**`sh:minus`.** The SHACL Advanced Features 1.1 minus expression, "
"`[ sh:nodes N ; sh:minus M ]`, evaluates exactly as SHACL 1.2's "
"`[ shnex:nodes N ; shnex:remove M ]`: the nodes of N not in M, in N's order. "
"Its `sh:nodes` is required."
msgstr ""
"**`sh:minus`。** SHACL Advanced Features 1.1 的 minus 表达式 `[ sh:nodes N ; "
"sh:minus M ]`，其求值与 SHACL 1.2 的 `[ shnex:nodes N ; shnex:remove M ]` 完"
"全相同：给出 N 中不在 M 里的节点，并保持 N 的顺序。其 `sh:nodes` 是必需的。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:105
msgid ""
"Every IRI the engine implements is defined by a W3C document; PurRDF mints "
"none."
msgstr "引擎实现的每个 IRI 都由某份 W3C 文档定义；PurRDF 一个也不生成。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:108
msgid ""
"The W3C SHACL 1.0 `data-shapes` suite passes clean (129/129, zero ledgered "
"gaps at the time of writing), and so does the W3C SHACL 1.2 suite (547/547); "
"the live numbers are in [`docs/CONFORMANCE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-"
"Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/CONFORMANCE.md), and [SHACL 1.2 "
"conformance](#shacl-12-conformance) below says how to reproduce them."
msgstr ""
"W3C SHACL 1.0 `data-shapes` 套件全部通过（129/129，撰写时 0 例入账），W3C "
"SHACL 1.2 套件同样全部通过（547/547）；实时数字见[`docs/CONFORMANCE.md`]"
"(https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/"
"CONFORMANCE.md)，复现方法见下文的 [SHACL 1.2 一致性](#shacl-12-一致性)。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:115
msgid ""
"A parsed shapes graph can also be compiled once and written out as a "
"deterministic, authenticated byte artifact, so a later process restores a "
"prepared validator instead of re-parsing Turtle — see [Prepared Shapes "
"Products](shapes-products.md)."
msgstr ""
"解析后的形状图还可以编译一次，写出为一个确定性的、经认证的字节工件，这样后续"
"进程可以恢复一个预备好的验证器，而不必重新解析 Turtle——参见[预备形状产物]"
"(shapes-products.md)。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:120
msgid "`owl:imports` in a shapes graph"
msgstr "形状图中的 `owl:imports`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:122
msgid ""
"A shapes document may carry an `owl:Ontology` header that `owl:imports` "
"other documents, and the shapes it constrains with may live entirely in "
"those imports. PurRDF resolves that closure — **but it never fetches it**. "
"There is no HTTP client in the workspace, every release crate builds for "
"`wasm32-unknown-unknown`, and a validation verdict that depends on what a "
"URL served today is not reproducible. So the closure is caller-supplied "
"configuration, exactly as it is for `entails` and `shex`:"
msgstr ""
"形状文档可以带有一个 `owl:Ontology` 头，该头通过 `owl:imports` 导入其他文档，"
"而它用来施加约束的形状可以完全位于这些导入中。PurRDF 会解析这一导入闭包——**但"
"绝不获取它**。工作区中没有 HTTP 客户端，每个发布 crate 都为 `wasm32-unknown-"
"unknown` 构建，而且依赖某个 URL 今天提供了什么内容的验证裁决是不可复现的。因"
"此，导入闭包是调用方提供的配置，与 `entails` 和 `shex` 完全一样："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:137
msgid ""
"The table is followed **transitively** — an imported document's own "
"`owl:imports` are resolved from the same table — and a cycle terminates "
"rather than looping, because OWL 2 §3.4 defines the imports closure as the "
"transitive one and explicitly permits `A` to import `B` to import `A`. Each "
"imported document's own `@prefix` declarations travel with it, so a SHACL-AF "
"`sh:select` written in an imported file resolves against the prefixes that "
"file declares."
msgstr ""
"该表会被**传递地**跟随——被导入文档自身的 `owl:imports` 也从同一张表中解析——遇"
"到环时会终止而不会无限循环，因为 OWL 2 §3.4 把导入闭包定义为传递闭包，并明确"
"允许 `A` 导入 `B`、后者再导入 `A`。每个被导入文档自身的 `@prefix` 声明随其一"
"同携带，因此写在被导入文件中的 SHACL-AF `sh:select` 会依据该文件所声明的前缀"
"解析。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:144
msgid ""
"The shapes document parses under its own `file://` retrieval IRI, or under "
"`--shapes-base IRI` when given. That flag is the same one `shacl pack --"
"base` is, and it is separate from `validate --base`, which sets only the "
"DATA graph's base. An `@base` inside the shapes document still wins inside "
"it, as Turtle specifies."
msgstr ""
"形状文档在其自身的 `file://` 获取 IRI 下解析，若给出 `--shapes-base IRI` 则在"
"该 IRI 下解析。这个标志与 `shacl pack --base` 相同，并与 `validate --base` 相"
"互独立——后者只设置**数据**图的基准 IRI。按 Turtle 的规定，形状文档内部的 "
"`@base` 在该文档内仍然优先。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:150
msgid ""
"An import whose document or ontology is **already loaded** needs no pair. It "
"is resolved when it names a document that was read: the shapes document's "
"own base (its `file://` retrieval IRI, `--shapes-base`, or `shacl pack --"
"base`), an in-document `@base`, or an `--import` document's IRI. SHACL "
"relies on this. `sh:prefixes` collects `sh:declare`s along `owl:imports*`, "
"and a document often points that path at its own IRI from a node that is not "
"an `owl:Ontology`. An import is also resolved when the graph holds `<X> a "
"owl:Ontology`, or an ontology whose `owl:versionIRI` is `<X>`, and the rule "
"applies across the whole closure. A shapes document that merges the W3C "
"SHACL 1.2 vocabularies — `shnex.ttl` imports `sh:`, and `shacl.ttl` beside "
"it declares `sh:` — is complete as written."
msgstr ""
"若某个导入的文档或本体**已经加载**，则无需提供对应的配对。当它指向一份已读取"
"的文档时即视为已解析：形状文档自身的基准 IRI（其 `file://` 获取 IRI、`--"
"shapes-base` 或 `shacl pack --base`）、文档内的 `@base`，或某个 `--import` 文"
"档的 IRI。SHACL 依赖这一点：`sh:prefixes` 沿 `owl:imports*` 收集 "
"`sh:declare`，而文档常常让这条路径指向其自身的 IRI，且路径的起点节点并不是 "
"`owl:Ontology`。当图中含有 `<X> a owl:Ontology`，或含有一个 `owl:versionIRI` "
"为 `<X>` 的本体时，导入同样视为已解析，且该规则适用于整个导入闭包。合并了 "
"W3C SHACL 1.2 词汇表的形状文档——`shnex.ttl` 导入 `sh:`，而与之并列的 "
"`shacl.ttl` 声明了 `sh:` 这一本体——按原样即是完整的。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:162
msgid ""
"Every **other** `owl:imports` no pair resolves is refused (exit 1). The "
"refusal names each missing IRI and the `--import IRI=FILE` pair that "
"resolves it, and suggests `--shapes-base IRI` for a document that imports "
"its own published IRI — the W3C test vectors are such documents, read here "
"from a local file. Validating without the imported document would be a "
"verdict about a smaller shapes graph than the one named, so there is no "
"warn-and-continue path. A pair the closure never reaches is refused as "
"unused (exit 2) rather than read and ignored."
msgstr ""
"**其他**任何没有配对能够解析的 `owl:imports` 都会被拒绝（退出"
"码 1）。拒绝信息点名每个缺失的 IRI 以及可解析它的 `--import I"
"RI=FILE` 配对，并对导入自身已发布 IRI 的文档建议使用 `--sha"
"pes-base IRI`——W3C 测试向量就是这样的文档，此处从本地文件读取"
"。在缺少被导入文档的情况下进行验证，得出的将是针对一个比所指名者更小的形状图的裁"
"决，因此不存在「警告后继续」的路径。导入闭包从未到达的配对会作为未使用而被拒绝（"
"退出码 2），而不是读入后忽略。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:173
msgid "Prefixes in SHACL-SPARQL queries"
msgstr "SHACL-SPARQL 查询中的前缀"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:175
msgid ""
"A SPARQL query in a shapes graph (`sh:select`, `sh:ask`, `sh:construct`, "
"`sh:sparqlExpr`, a validator, a target or a function body) gets a `PREFIX` "
"header before it is compiled. The header follows SHACL 1.2 SPARQL "
"Extensions, \"Prefix Declarations for SPARQL Queries\":"
msgstr ""
"形状图中的 SPARQL 查询（`sh:select`、`sh:ask`、`sh:construct`、"
"`sh:sparqlExpr`、验证器、目标或函数体）在编译前会获得一个 `PREFIX` 头。该头遵"
"循 SHACL 1.2 SPARQL 扩展中的「Prefix Declarations for SPARQL Queries」："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:180
msgid ""
"**A query with `sh:prefixes`** uses the prefix declarations on the path "
"`sh:prefixes/(^owl:versionIRI?/owl:imports)*/sh:declare`. The path is read "
"from the query node and from the shape or component that carries it."
msgstr ""
"**带有 `sh:prefixes` 的查询**使用路径 `sh:prefixes/(^owl:versionIRI?/"
"owl:imports)*/sh:declare` 上的前缀声明。该路径从查询节点以及携带它的形状或组"
"件读取。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:183
msgid ""
"**A query without `sh:prefixes`** uses every `sh:declare` of every SHACL "
"instance of `owl:Ontology`, `sh:DataGraph`, `sh:ShapesGraph` or "
"`sh:RulesGraph` in the shapes graph. A subclass of one of those classes "
"counts too."
msgstr ""
"**不带 `sh:prefixes` 的查询**使用形状图中 `owl:Ontology`、`sh:DataGraph`、"
"`sh:ShapesGraph` 或 `sh:RulesGraph` 的每个 SHACL 实例的每个 `sh:declare`。这"
"些类的子类同样计入。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:187
msgid ""
"**Two different namespaces for one prefix** in the declarations a query "
"reaches make the shapes graph ill-formed. The load fails, and the error "
"names the prefix and both namespaces. The same prefix declared twice with "
"the same namespace is fine. Declarations that no query reaches are not "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"在查询所能到达的声明中，**同一前缀对应两个不同的命名空间**会使形状图不良构。"
"加载会失败，错误信息点名该前缀与两个命名空间。同一前缀以相同命名空间声明两次"
"则没有问题。没有任何查询到达的声明不会被检查。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:191
msgid ""
"**A malformed declaration** that a query reaches also fails the load. A "
"declaration needs exactly one `xsd:string` `sh:prefix` and exactly one "
"`sh:namespace`."
msgstr ""
"查询所到达的**格式错误的声明**同样会使加载失败。一条声明需要恰好一个 "
"`xsd:string` 类型的 `sh:prefix` 与恰好一个 `sh:namespace`。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:195
msgid ""
"The shapes document's own `@prefix` / `PREFIX` directives are a fallback. "
"They only supply a prefix the declarations above leave unbound, and they "
"never replace one the declarations bind. They come from the Turtle parser's "
"own record of the document, so a `PREFIX` line inside a query's string "
"literal is never mistaken for a directive. If the document declares a prefix "
"twice, the fallback uses the last declaration. A `PREFIX` in a query's own "
"text applies to that query only."
msgstr ""
"形状文档自身的 `@prefix` / `PREFIX` 指令是后备来源。它们只补充上述声明未绑定"
"的前缀，绝不替换声明已绑定的前缀。它们取自 Turtle 解析器对文档的自身记录，因"
"此查询字符串字面量中的 `PREFIX` 行绝不会被误认为指令。若文档把某个前缀声明了"
"两次，后备来源采用最后一次声明。查询自身文本中的 `PREFIX` 只作用于该查询。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:203
msgid "Built-in declarations and the W3C vocabularies"
msgstr "内置声明与 W3C 词汇表"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:205
msgid ""
"The SHACL 1.2 vocabularies (`shacl.ttl`, `shnex.ttl` and `shnex-sparql.ttl`) "
"declare every built-in constraint component and node-expression function, "
"for example `sh:SPARQLExprExpression a sh:NamedParameterExpressionFunction`. "
"None of those declarations has a body or a validator, because the engine "
"provides the implementation. A shapes graph may merge the vocabularies, and "
"loading resolves each declaration against the engine's table of what it "
"implements:"
msgstr ""
"SHACL 1.2 词汇表（`shacl.ttl`、`shnex.ttl` 与 `shnex-sparql.ttl`）声明了每个"
"内置约束组件与节点表达式函数，例如 `sh:SPARQLExprExpression a "
"sh:NamedParameterExpressionFunction`。这些声明都没有函数体或验证器，因为实现"
"由引擎提供。形状图可以合并这些词汇表，加载时会把每条声明与引擎的「已实现项」"
"表进行解析："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:212
msgid ""
"a bare declaration of a built-in binds to the native implementation and adds "
"nothing to the custom-function index or the component registry;"
msgstr ""
"对内置项的裸声明绑定到原生实现，不向自定义函数索引或组件注册表添加任何内容；"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:214
msgid ""
"a built-in declared again with a body, a validator, `sh:ask` or `sh:select` "
"is a duplicate definition, and one declared under the wrong class or with a "
"contradicting signature is a mismatch; both fail the load;"
msgstr ""
"若内置项被再次声明并带有函数体、验证器、`sh:ask` 或 `sh:select`，即为重复定"
"义；若在错误的类下声明或带有相矛盾的签名，即为不匹配；两者都会使加载失败；"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:217
msgid ""
"a function the engine does not implement still needs its body, whatever its "
"namespace: a bodiless `ex:f` fails the load, and so does a bodiless "
"`sh:NotABuiltin`;"
msgstr ""
"引擎未实现的函数无论位于哪个命名空间都仍需函数体：没有函数体的 `ex:f` 会使加"
"载失败，没有函数体的 `sh:NotABuiltin` 同样如此；"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:220
msgid ""
"a custom function whose key parameter is a built-in's key parameter fails "
"the load, because the key parameters of all node expression functions must "
"be disjoint."
msgstr ""
"若自定义函数的键参数与某个内置项的键参数相同，加载失败，因为所有节点表达式函"
"数的键参数必须互不相交（任意两个函数都不得共用同一个键参数）。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:224
msgid ""
"So merging the W3C vocabularies into a shapes graph is a no-op. A test holds "
"this over every shapes graph in three corpora (the first-party corpus, the "
"W3C SHACL 1.0 suite and the SHACL 1.2 `sht:Validate` entries): the "
"validation report is byte-identical with and without the merge. "
"`purrdf_shapes::spec` exposes what the vocabularies declare and what the "
"engine implements, and a test pins the difference at zero. `purrdf shapes "
"lint` reports, per function call site, whether the call bound natively, to a "
"custom body, to a SPARQL registration or to a host extension."
msgstr ""
"因此，把 W3C 词汇表合并进形状图不会改变任何结果。一项测试在三个语料（第一方语"
"料、W3C SHACL 1.0 套件以及 SHACL 1.2 的 `sht:Validate` 条目）中的每个形状图上"
"验证这一点：无论是否合并，验证报告都逐字节相同。`purrdf_shapes::spec` 公开词"
"汇表声明了什么、引擎实现了什么，一项测试把两者之差固定为零。`purrdf shapes "
"lint` 按每个函数调用点报告该调用绑定到了原生实现、自定义函数体、SPARQL 注册项"
"还是宿主扩展。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:233
msgid "SHACL 1.2 conformance"
msgstr "SHACL 1.2 一致性"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:235
msgid ""
"The complete W3C `shacl12-test-suite` is vendored byte-exact under `vectors/"
"shacl12/` and run through the library API: 547 tests, covering 174 "
"`sht:Validate`, 143 `sht:EvalNodeExpr` and 27 `sht:Infer` tests, and 203 "
"SPARQL 1.2 RL syntax, well-formedness, stratification and evaluation tests. "
"All 547 pass, and the expected-failure ledger is empty. A negative SPARQL "
"1.2 RL test must fail at the stage its test type names, not at an earlier "
"one. Reproduce it with:"
msgstr ""
"完整的 W3C `shacl12-test-suite` 逐字节随库固化在 `vectors/shacl12/` 下，并经"
"由库 API 运行：共 547 个测试，涵盖 174 个 `sht:Validate`、143 个 "
"`sht:EvalNodeExpr` 与 27 个 `sht:Infer` 测试，以及 203 个 SPARQL 1.2 RL 语"
"法、良构性、分层与求值测试。547 个全部通过，预期失败台账为空。SPARQL 1.2 RL "
"的负例测试必须在其测试类型所指明的阶段失败，而不能更早。复现方式："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:247
msgid ""
"The last line of the scoreboard it prints is `W3C12 TOTAL: passed 547, "
"xfailed 0, ledger 0`."
msgstr ""
"它打印的记分板最后一行是 `W3C12 TOTAL: passed 547, xfailed 0, ledger 0`。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:250
msgid ""
"Three approved tests expect a report that the normative SHACL 1.2 Core text "
"does not produce. The harness grades each against the expectation with "
"exactly one result amended, quotes the clause beside the amendment, and "
"proves that a report without the amendment, or with a different one, fails:"
msgstr ""
"有三个已批准的测试所期望的报告，与规范性的 SHACL 1.2 Core 文本所产生的报告不"
"符。测试框架对每个测试都以恰好修正了一条结果的期望进行判分，在修正旁引用相应"
"条款，并证明缺少该修正或采用不同修正的报告都会失败："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:255
msgid ""
"`core/node/xone-003` expects a result from a property shape with no "
"`sh:resultPath`. Section 6.7.2.2 says: \"For results produced by a property "
"shape, this SHACL property path is equivalent to the value of sh:path of the "
"shape, unless stated otherwise.\" The graded result carries the shape's "
"`sh:path`."
msgstr ""
"`core/node/xone-003` 期望来自某属性形状的一条结果不带 `sh:resultPath`。第 "
"6.7.2.2 节写道：「For results produced by a property shape, this SHACL "
"property path is equivalent to the value of sh:path of the shape, unless "
"stated otherwise.」判分所用的结果携带该形状的 `sh:path`。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:260
msgid ""
"`core/property/reifierShape-001` expects the value node as `sh:value`. "
"Section 7.8.5 says: \"For each reifier t that does not conform to "
"$reifierShape, there is a validation result with t as sh:value.\" The graded "
"result carries the reifier."
msgstr ""
"`core/property/reifierShape-001` 期望以值节点作为 `sh:value`。第 7.8.5 节写"
"道：「For each reifier t that does not conform to $reifierShape, there is a "
"validation result with t as sh:value.」判分所用的结果携带该具体化节点。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:264
msgid ""
"`core/property/reifierShape-002` expects the value node as `sh:value` for a "
"missing reification. Section 7.8.5 says: \"If $reificationRequired is set to "
"true and there is no reified statement for the triple term t in the data "
"graph, there is a validation result with t as sh:value.\" The graded result "
"carries the triple term."
msgstr ""
"`core/property/reifierShape-002` 在缺失具体化时期望以值节点作为 `sh:value`。"
"第 7.8.5 节写道：「If $reificationRequired is set to true and there is no "
"reified statement for the triple term t in the data graph, there is a "
"validation result with t as sh:value.」判分所用的结果携带该三元组项。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:270
msgid ""
"Six node-expression tests expect an integer-valued `xsd:decimal` in a "
"lexical form that is not canonical, such as `\"4.0\"` or `\"00\"`. XSD 1.1 "
"Part 2 (section 3.3.3.1 and the `decimalCanonicalMap` of E.1) makes the "
"canonical form `\"4\"` and `\"0\"`. PurRDF emits canonical forms, and each "
"of those tests is graded exactly against the canonical form, not by "
"comparing values."
msgstr ""
"有六个节点表达式测试期望一个取整数值的 `xsd:decimal` 采用非规范的词法形式，例"
"如 `\"4.0\"` 或 `\"00\"`。XSD 1.1 Part 2（第 3.3.3.1 节以及 E.1 中的 "
"`decimalCanonicalMap`）规定其规范形式为 `\"4\"` 与 `\"0\"`。PurRDF 输出规范形"
"式，上述每个测试都严格按规范形式判分，而不是通过比较值来判分。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:276
msgid ""
"SPARQL 1.2 RL grammar rule \\[2\\], `RuleOrDataBlock ::= Prologue "
"( RuleOrData+ ( Prologue1 RuleOrData? )* )?`, is implemented as written: "
"once a declaration follows a rule or data block, at most one rule or data "
"block may follow it before the next declaration."
msgstr ""
"SPARQL 1.2 RL 语法规则 \\[2\\] `RuleOrDataBlock ::= Prologue ( RuleOrData+ "
"( Prologue1 RuleOrData? )* )?` 按原文实现：一旦某条声明出现在规则或数据块之"
"后，在下一条声明之前最多只能再跟一个规则或数据块。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:281
msgid "Ontology-complete developer schemas"
msgstr "本体完整的开发者模式（schema）"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:283
msgid ""
"The public `compile_schema` boundary accepts a `SchemaCompileRequest` that "
"binds the parsed shapes, exact ontology dataset, caller-owned `Namespaces`, "
"and an explicit `SchemaSurfaceMode`. `ShapedOnly` retains the active SHACL "
"target-class surface. `OntologyComplete` adds existing caller-vocabulary "
"classes and optional OWL/RDFS-derived properties. The result carries JSON "
"Schema draft 2020-12, OpenAPI 3.1, the normal forward loss ledger, a "
"canonical property-coverage report, and a deterministic pre-compilation "
"cache key. Its `CompiledSchema` feeds the LinkML, TypeScript, GraphQL, and "
"Pydantic emitters without a second schema-discovery pass."
msgstr ""
"公开的 `compile_schema` 边界接受一个 `SchemaCompileRequest`，它绑定解析后的形"
"状、精确的本体数据集、调用方持有的 `Namespaces`，以及一个显式的 "
"`SchemaSurfaceMode`。`ShapedOnly` 保留活动的 SHACL 目标类接口。"
"`OntologyComplete` 额外加入调用方词汇中已有的类，以及可选的、由 OWL/RDFS 推导"
"的属性。结果携带 JSON Schema draft 2020-12、OpenAPI 3.1、常规的正向损失台账、"
"一份规范的属性覆盖报告，以及一个确定性的预编译缓存键。其 `CompiledSchema` 供 "
"LinkML、TypeScript、GraphQL 与 Pydantic 输出器使用，无需第二遍模式发现。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:293
msgid ""
"The bounded theory catalogs only schema evidence: direct IRI `sh:path`, RDF/"
"OWL property declarations, domain/range declarations, and both endpoints of "
"subproperty, equivalent-property, and inverse-property relations. A "
"predicate seen only on an instance is not promoted. Class admission is "
"likewise explicit, and synthesized definitions are limited to namespaces the "
"caller supplied; PurRDF does not turn builtin compaction prefixes into an "
"ontology boundary."
msgstr ""
"有界理论只收录模式证据：直接 IRI 形式的 `sh:path`、RDF/OWL 属性声明、定义域/"
"值域声明，以及子属性、等价属性与逆属性关系的两个端点。仅在实例上出现的谓词不"
"会被提升。类的接纳同样是显式的，合成的定义仅限于调用方提供的命名空间；PurRDF "
"不会把内置的压缩前缀变成本体边界。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:300
msgid ""
"Subclass/equivalent-class closure determines domain membership. Multiple "
"domains are conjunctive; OWL union members are alternatives and intersection "
"members are conjunctive. Subproperties inherit superproperty domains, "
"ranges, and forward functionality, equivalent properties propagate "
"bidirectionally, and inverse properties exchange domain and range. Strongly "
"connected cycles are condensed deterministically. Multiple ranges remain "
"conjunctive in emitted JSON Schema; union and intersection expressions map "
"to `anyOf` and `allOf`."
msgstr ""
"子类/等价类闭包决定定义域成员关系。多个定义域是合取关系；OWL 并集的成员是备选"
"项，交集的成员是合取关系。子属性继承父属性的定义域、值域与正向函数性，等价属"
"性双向传播，逆属性交换定义域与值域。强连通环以确定性方式收缩。多个值域在输出"
"的 JSON Schema 中仍保持合取；并集与交集表达式分别映射为 `anyOf` 与 `allOf`。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:308
msgid ""
"Direct SHACL remains authoritative. Ontology-only fields are optional; "
"`owl:FunctionalProperty` gives a scalar representation with approximation "
"provenance, while inverse functionality does not. Closed shapes reject "
"unshaped fields unless they are directly present or ignored. Classes without "
"a target shape are emitted as open carriers, never as fabricated closed "
"models. This is not ABox materialization or unrestricted OWL: property "
"chains and axioms outside the fragment do not create fields."
msgstr ""
"直接的 SHACL 仍是权威。仅来自本体的字段是可选的；`owl:FunctionalProperty` 给"
"出带近似溯源的标量表示，而逆函数性不会如此。封闭形状拒绝未被形状描述的字段，"
"除非这些字段直接出现或被忽略。没有目标形状的类以开放载体的形式输出，绝不会被"
"输出为捏造的封闭模型。这既不是 ABox 物化，也不是不受限的 OWL：属性链以及该片"
"段之外的公理不会产生字段。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:316
msgid ""
"`SchemaCoverageReport` accounts for every catalogued property once, "
"including exclusions, with sorted per-class outcomes and source-axiom "
"provenance. `SchemaCompileRequest::coverage_report` can produce it before "
"emission. The request cache key binds RDFC-1.0 identities for the shapes and "
"ontology graphs, caller namespaces, mode, value-vocabulary marker, compiler/"
"policy salts, and the fixed ceilings: 65,536 properties, 65,536 classes, "
"1,048,576 relation or coverage cells, and expression depth 64. Malformed OWL "
"lists, contradictory property kinds/ranges, key collisions, and limit "
"exhaustion are typed failures."
msgstr ""
"`SchemaCoverageReport` 对每个收录的属性恰好计入一次（包括被排除的属性），并附"
"有排序后的逐类结果与源公理溯源。`SchemaCompileRequest::coverage_report` 可以"
"在输出之前生成它。请求缓存键绑定形状图与本体图的 RDFC-1.0 标识、调用方命名空"
"间、模式（mode）、值词汇标记、编译器/策略盐值，以及固定上限：65,536 个属性、"
"65,536 个类、1,048,576 个关系或覆盖单元格，以及表达式深度 64。格式错误的 OWL "
"列表、相互矛盾的属性种类/值域、键冲突以及上限耗尽，都是带类型的失败。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:325
msgid "Run the complete two-mode and four-emitter example with:"
msgstr "运行完整的双模式、四输出器示例："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:331
msgid "Schema → SHACL imports"
msgstr "Schema → SHACL 导入"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:333
msgid ""
"The schema-projection surface is bidirectional. `SchemaImportConfig` "
"requires the caller's namespace table and the complete RDF datatype mapping "
"for JSON scalars; there is no default vocabulary. The five production "
"reverse directions are JSON Schema draft 2020-12 (`import_json_schema`), "
"native LinkML 1.11 (`import_linkml`), and verified PurRDF-emitted Pydantic "
"v2, TypeScript 7.0, and GraphQL September 2025 packages "
"(`import_*_package`). All five lower through one ordered JSON-Schema "
"semantic model and return typed shapes plus an always-computed, located "
"reverse `LossLedger`."
msgstr ""
"模式投影接口是双向的。`SchemaImportConfig` 要求调用方提供命名空间表，以及 "
"JSON 标量到 RDF 数据类型的完整映射；不存在默认词汇表。五个生产用的反向方向是 "
"JSON Schema draft 2020-12（`import_json_schema`）、原生 LinkML 1.11"
"（`import_linkml`），以及经过校验的、由 PurRDF 输出的 Pydantic v2、"
"TypeScript 7.0 与 GraphQL September 2025 包（`import_*_package`）。五者都经由"
"同一个有序的 JSON-Schema 语义模型降级，并返回带类型的形状，外加一份总会计算"
"的、带位置的反向 `LossLedger`。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:342
msgid ""
"Malformed values, open or dangling references, identity collisions, "
"generated artifact/map drift, and resource-limit exhaustion fail closed. "
"Valid source constructs without an exact SHACL interpretation are ledgered "
"at their native JSON Pointer. Arbitrary Python, TypeScript, and GraphQL SDL "
"are intentionally outside the inverse boundary because none defines one "
"unique runtime JSON acceptance relation. LinkML does have a native reader; "
"its schema identity and documentation can therefore appear as losses even "
"when the validation-bearing SHACL recompiles byte-exactly."
msgstr ""
"格式错误的值、开放或悬空的引用、标识冲突、生成的工件/映射漂移以及资源上限耗"
"尽，都按失败即关闭（fail closed）处理。没有精确 SHACL 解释的有效源构造，会在"
"其原生 JSON Pointer 处记入台账。任意的 Python、TypeScript 与 GraphQL SDL 被有"
"意排除在逆向边界之外，因为它们都没有定义唯一的运行时 JSON 接受关系。LinkML 确"
"实有原生读取器；因此，即使承载验证语义的 SHACL 逐字节重新编译一致，其模式标识"
"与文档仍可能表现为损失。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:351
msgid ""
"The executable example constructs caller-owned `example.org` configuration "
"and exercises all five paths:"
msgstr "可执行示例构造调用方持有的 `example.org` 配置，并覆盖全部五条路径："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:358
msgid "Pydantic v2 projection"
msgstr "Pydantic v2 投影"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:360
msgid ""
"`purrdf-shapes` can transliterate a compiled SHACL-derived JSON Schema into "
"a deterministic, typed Pydantic v2 package entirely in memory. The public "
"`emit_pydantic` function consumes `CompiledSchema`; `PydanticConfig` "
"requires the caller to supply the package name and package/module prose, so "
"the library does not invent a vocabulary, namespace, or downstream brand."
msgstr ""
"`purrdf-shapes` 可以完全在内存中把编译后的、由 SHACL 推导出的 JSON Schema 转"
"写为一个确定性的、带类型的 Pydantic v2 包。公开函数 `emit_pydantic` 消费 "
"`CompiledSchema`；`PydanticConfig` 要求调用方提供包名以及包/模块说明文字，因"
"此库不会自行发明词汇表、命名空间或下游品牌。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:366
msgid ""
"Every `$defs` entry gets a stable import path, JSON property names remain "
"exact through Pydantic aliases, and generated classes expose the originating "
"definition through `model_json_schema(by_alias=True)`. Pydantic runtime "
"annotations enforce the representable portion. A JSON Schema assertion with "
"no exact runtime annotation remains visible on that schema surface and "
"produces a located entry in the always-computed `json-schema` → `pydantic-"
"v2` `LossLedger`; a lossless input yields an empty ledger. The renderer "
"itself has no Python dependency and stays wasm-clean. A dev-only Python "
"oracle executes the generated code and checks the live reverse/schema "
"surface. `import_pydantic_package` separately verifies the retained source "
"schema, generated files, model map, dialect, and forward ledger before "
"importing SHACL."
msgstr ""
"每个 `$defs` 条目都获得一个稳定的导入路径，JSON 属性名通过 Pydantic 别名保持"
"精确，生成的类通过 `model_json_schema(by_alias=True)` 公开其来源定义。"
"Pydantic 运行时注解强制执行可表示的部分。没有精确运行时注解的 JSON Schema 断"
"言在该模式接口上保持可见，并在总会计算的 `json-schema` → `pydantic-v2` "
"`LossLedger` 中产生一条带位置的条目；无损输入得到空台账。渲染器本身不依赖 "
"Python，并保持 wasm-clean。一个仅用于开发的 Python 判定依据（oracle）执行生成"
"的代码，并检查实际的反向/模式接口。`import_pydantic_package` 在导入 SHACL 之"
"前，单独校验所保留的源模式、生成的文件、模型映射、方言以及正向台账。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:378
msgid ""
"The optional caller-owned `PydanticPackageTopology` is a total partition of "
"`$defs` entries into portable dotted leaf modules. Each route carries the "
"class docstring and a sorted, vocabulary-neutral `json_schema_extra` map "
"suitable for documentation URLs, content digests, and other caller-defined "
"linkage. An optional `PydanticVersionStamp` adds an exact PEP 440 "
"`__version__` export. Routed packages share schema/runtime support modules, "
"generate intermediate package initializers, use explicit symbol tables for "
"one root-level rebuild, and pass the executable runtime oracle plus strict "
"mypy. Exact route coverage, portable path/symbol uniqueness, and fixed input/"
"config/output limits all fail closed. When both topology and version "
"stamping are omitted, the original flat package bytes remain unchanged. A "
"flat version stamp adds `__about__.py` and updates the `__init__.py` exports."
msgstr ""
"可选的、由调用方持有的 `PydanticPackageTopology` 是把 `$defs` 条目划分到可移"
"植的点分叶模块中的一个全划分。每条路由携带类的 docstring，以及一个排序后的、"
"与词汇无关的 `json_schema_extra` 映射，适用于文档 URL、内容摘要以及其他由调用"
"方定义的关联。可选的 `PydanticVersionStamp` 增加一个精确的 PEP 440 "
"`__version__` 导出。经路由的包共享模式/运行时支持模块，生成中间包的初始化文"
"件，使用显式符号表完成一次根级重建，并通过可执行的运行时判定依据（oracle）以"
"及严格模式的 mypy。精确的路由覆盖、可移植的路径/符号唯一性以及固定的输入/配"
"置/输出上限，都按失败即关闭处理。拓扑与版本标记都省略时，原有的扁平包字节保持"
"不变。扁平包的版本标记会增加 `__about__.py` 并更新 `__init__.py` 的导出。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:391
msgid "LinkML 1.11 projection"
msgstr "LinkML 1.11 投影"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:393
msgid ""
"The same `CompiledSchema` carrier can be projected to canonical LinkML 1.11 "
"with `emit_linkml`. `LinkmlConfig` requires the caller's schema IRI, name, "
"description, default prefix, and complete prefix map, so PurRDF never mints "
"a consumer vocabulary or identity. The returned `LinkmlPackage` includes the "
"typed document, deterministic YAML, a reversible `$defs`\\-key mapping, and "
"a located `json-schema` → `linkml-1.11` loss ledger. It also carries "
"ordered, integrity-checked slot rename and skip-diagnostic reports."
msgstr ""
"同一个 `CompiledSchema` 载体可以用 `emit_linkml` 投影为规范的 LinkML 1.11。"
"`LinkmlConfig` 要求调用方提供模式 IRI、名称、描述、默认前缀以及完整的前缀映"
"射，因此 PurRDF 绝不会为使用方生成词汇表或标识。返回的 `LinkmlPackage` 包含带"
"类型的文档、确定性的 YAML、一个可逆的 `$defs` 键映射，以及一份带位置的 `json-"
"schema` → `linkml-1.11` 损失台账。它还携带有序的、经完整性检查的 slot 重命名"
"报告与跳过诊断报告。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:401
msgid ""
"Classes and exact property aliases, types, enums, local references, inline "
"objects, requiredness, homogeneous arrays, patterns, inclusive bounds, and "
"LinkML boolean expressions are represented directly. An unsafe LinkML slot "
"name uses `SanitizePolicy::Rename` by default; `Skip` omits only that slot "
"with a located diagnostic/loss, and `Fail` returns a contextual error. "
"Rename preserves declared CURIE and absolute-IRI identity byte-exactly in "
"`slot_uri`; an unsafe bare token or exact caller re-home receives a reported "
"identity under the caller-supplied default prefix. All valid IRI schemes "
"remain absolute unless the caller marks that exact token, so custom schemes "
"are not guessed from their spelling. Safe names reserve first and hash-plus-"
"ordinal collision allocation is bounded and deterministic."
msgstr ""
"类以及精确的属性别名、类型、枚举、本地引用、内联对象、是否必需、同质数组、模"
"式（pattern）、闭区间边界与 LinkML 布尔表达式都被直接表示。不安全的 LinkML "
"slot 名默认使用 `SanitizePolicy::Rename`；`Skip` 只省略该 slot，并给出带位置"
"的诊断/损失；`Fail` 返回带上下文的错误。Rename 在 `slot_uri` 中逐字节保留所声"
"明的 CURIE 与绝对 IRI 标识；不安全的裸令牌或调用方精确指定的重新归属，会在调"
"用方提供的默认前缀下获得一个被报告的标识。除非调用方标记了该确切令牌，所有有"
"效的 IRI scheme 都保持为绝对形式，因此不会根据拼写猜测自定义 scheme。安全名称"
"优先保留，而基于哈希加序号的冲突分配是有界且确定性的。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:413
msgid ""
"Every unsupported assertion is classified by a closed capability table; "
"malformed inputs, external/dynamic/dangling references, stale re-home hints, "
"semantic identity collisions, and fixed-limit breaches fail closed. "
"`parse_linkml` and `write_linkml` preserve all JSON-compatible metamodel "
"fields and provide byte-stable read/write round trips while rejecting YAML-"
"only tags, duplicate keys, non-string keys, and non-finite numbers."
msgstr ""
"每个不受支持的断言都由一张封闭的能力表分类；格式错误的输入、外部/动态/悬空引"
"用、过时的重新归属提示、语义标识冲突以及超出固定上限，都按失败即关闭处理。"
"`parse_linkml` 与 `write_linkml` 保留所有与 JSON 兼容的元模型字段，提供逐字节"
"稳定的读/写往返（转换），同时拒绝仅限 YAML 的标签、重复键、非字符串键以及非有"
"限数。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:421
msgid ""
"`import_linkml` consumes that validated native document; the emitted-package "
"variant `import_linkml_package` first verifies canonical YAML and the "
"reversible element map, slot reports, policy losses, aliases, and emitted "
"identities. Both use the same caller-owned SHACL import configuration. "
"Migration adapters should pass `CompiledSchema` unchanged, configure exact "
"re-homes, and consume `slot_renames`; rewriting shared property/required "
"keys is unnecessary."
msgstr ""
"`import_linkml` 消费经过验证的原生文档；面向输出包的变体 "
"`import_linkml_package` 会先校验规范 YAML 以及可逆的元素映射、slot 报告、策略"
"损失、别名与输出的标识。两者使用同一个由调用方持有的 SHACL 导入配置。迁移适配"
"器应原样传递 `CompiledSchema`，配置精确的重新归属，并消费 `slot_renames`；无"
"需重写共享的属性键/必需键。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:428
msgid ""
"The Rust production path has no LinkML-toolkit dependency. CI uses the "
"locked official LinkML 1.11.1 Python packages only as a differential oracle. "
"It loads safe, lossy, and renamed fixtures through `SchemaDefinition` and "
"`SchemaView`, regenerates JSON Schema, and verifies reverse predicates:"
msgstr ""
"Rust 生产路径不依赖 LinkML 工具包。CI 仅把锁定版本的官方 LinkML 1.11.1 "
"Python 包用作差分判定依据（oracle）。它通过 `SchemaDefinition` 与 "
"`SchemaView` 加载安全、有损与重命名的测试夹具，重新生成 JSON Schema，并验证反"
"向谓词："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:437
msgid "TypeScript 7.0 projection"
msgstr "TypeScript 7.0 投影"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:439
msgid ""
"`emit_typescript` projects the same `CompiledSchema` into deterministic "
"TypeScript 7.0 declarations. The caller supplies the package name and all "
"package/module prose through `TypeScriptConfig`. The returned package "
"contains one `index.d.ts`, a reversible `$defs`\\-key to exported-type map, "
"and a located `json-schema` → `typescript-7.0` loss ledger; PurRDF invents "
"no consumer identity or vocabulary."
msgstr ""
"`emit_typescript` 把同一个 `CompiledSchema` 投影为确定性的 TypeScript 7.0 声"
"明。调用方通过 `TypeScriptConfig` 提供包名以及所有包/模块说明文字。返回的包含"
"有一个 `index.d.ts`、一个从 `$defs` 键到导出类型的可逆映射，以及一份带位置的 "
"`json-schema` → `typescript-7.0` 损失台账；PurRDF 不为使用方发明任何标识或词"
"汇表。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:446
msgid ""
"The fixed declaration dialect uses `strict` plus "
"`exactOptionalPropertyTypes`. Type aliases preserve JSON primitives and "
"literals, required versus optional fields, explicit `null`, local recursive "
"references, unions, intersections, homogeneous arrays, and bounded tuples. "
"There are no runtime enums, mergeable interfaces, branded pseudo-validators, "
"or `any` escape hatches. Invalid keywords, open/dangling references, and "
"name collisions fail before bytes are emitted."
msgstr ""
"固定的声明方言使用 `strict` 加 `exactOptionalPropertyTypes`。类型别名保留 "
"JSON 原始类型与字面量、必需字段与可选字段之分、显式的 `null`、本地递归引用、"
"并集、交集、同质数组以及有界元组。不存在运行时枚举、可合并的接口、带品牌的伪"
"验证器或 `any` 逃生口。无效关键字、开放/悬空引用以及名称冲突都会在输出字节之"
"前失败。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:454
msgid ""
"Runtime assertions outside TypeScript structural assignability are never "
"silently erased: integer, numeric/string predicate, closure, pattern-"
"property, dependency, conditional, negation, contains/unique, evaluation-"
"state, and bounded-expansion gaps receive stable codes and JSON Pointer "
"locations. CI classifies instances independently with a draft 2020-12 "
"validator and compiles the generated declarations with the locked TypeScript "
"7.0.2 compiler, including fresh-literal and through-variable probes:"
msgstr ""
"TypeScript 结构可赋值性之外的运行时断言绝不会被静默抹去：整数、数值/字符串谓"
"词、封闭性、模式属性、依赖、条件、否定、contains/unique、求值状态以及有界展开"
"等缺口，都会获得稳定的代码与 JSON Pointer 位置。CI 用一个 draft 2020-12 验证"
"器独立地对实例分类，并用锁定版本的 TypeScript 7.0.2 编译器编译生成的声明，包"
"括新鲜字面量与经由变量的探针："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:466
msgid ""
"The projection intentionally has no arbitrary TypeScript reader. TypeScript "
"declarations do not define a unique runtime JSON acceptance relation, and "
"the projection is many-to-one. `import_typescript_package` is the "
"authoritative reverse surface: it deterministically verifies the retained "
"source schema, declaration, reversible name map, dialect, and forward "
"ledger. TypeScript is only a dev-time oracle dependency; the Rust emitter/"
"importer is filesystem-free and wasm-clean."
msgstr ""
"该投影有意不提供任意 TypeScript 的读取器。TypeScript 声明并未定义唯一的运行"
"时 JSON 接受关系，而且该投影是多对一的。`import_typescript_package` 是权威的"
"反向接口：它以确定性方式校验所保留的源模式、声明、可逆名称映射、方言以及正向"
"台账。TypeScript 只是开发期的判定依据（oracle）依赖；Rust 输出器/导入器不访问"
"文件系统，并保持 wasm-clean。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:474
msgid "GraphQL September 2025 projection"
msgstr "GraphQL September 2025 投影"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:476
msgid ""
"`emit_graphql` projects `CompiledSchema` into deterministic GraphQL "
"September 2025 SDL. `GraphqlConfig` has no defaults: the caller supplies the "
"schema name, package and module prose, and a non-built-in fallback-scalar "
"name. The returned `GraphqlPackage` contains `schema.graphql`, canonical "
"`name-map.json`, the same name map as typed Rust data, a located `json-"
"schema` → `graphql-september-2025` loss ledger, and the production value "
"codec."
msgstr ""
"`emit_graphql` 把 `CompiledSchema` 投影为确定性的 GraphQL September 2025 "
"SDL。`GraphqlConfig` 没有默认值：调用方提供模式名称、包与模块说明文字，以及一"
"个非内置的后备标量名称。返回的 `GraphqlPackage` 包含 `schema.graphql`、规范"
"的 `name-map.json`、以带类型 Rust 数据表示的同一名称映射、一份带位置的 `json-"
"schema` → `graphql-september-2025` 损失台账，以及生产用的值编解码器。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:483
msgid ""
"The SDL is deliberately a type-system fragment. PurRDF emits paired output "
"`type` and input `input` objects, but no query, mutation, or subscription "
"root, resolver, pagination rule, authorization policy, federation directive, "
"or other application behavior. A caller composes the fragment with its own "
"executable schema."
msgstr ""
"该 SDL 被有意设计为类型系统片段。PurRDF 输出成对的输出 `type` 对象与输入 "
"`input` 对象，但不输出查询、变更或订阅根类型、解析器、分页规则、授权策略、联"
"邦指令或其他应用行为。调用方把该片段与其自己的可执行模式组合起来。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:489
msgid ""
"The exact grammar includes GraphQL booleans, strings, numbers, the signed 32-"
"bit `Int` domain, explicit nullability, finite JSON `const`/`enum` sets, "
"closed object fields, requiredness, homogeneous lists, direct local `$defs` "
"references and aliases, descriptions, and inline object helpers. One global "
"collision-checked namespace covers types, helpers, and the fallback scalar; "
"fields and enum symbols are checked in their GraphQL-local namespaces. The "
"typed/canonical name maps retain the source definition keys, property keys, "
"and finite JSON values."
msgstr ""
"精确语法包括 GraphQL 布尔值、字符串、数字、有符号 32 位 `Int` 值域、显式可空"
"性、有限的 JSON `const`/`enum` 集合、封闭的对象字段、是否必需、同质列表、直接"
"的本地 `$defs` 引用与别名、描述以及内联对象辅助类型。一个全局的、经冲突检查的"
"命名空间覆盖类型、辅助类型与后备标量；字段与枚举符号在其 GraphQL 局部命名空间"
"中检查。带类型/规范的名称映射保留源定义键、属性键以及有限的 JSON 值。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:498
msgid ""
"`GraphqlPackage::encode_input` maps source JSON keys and finite values to "
"input field names and enum symbols. `decode_output` performs the inverse for "
"fields present in a GraphQL response, without inventing omitted selections. "
"Unknown or incompatible values fail. This package codec is the precise value "
"boundary; `import_graphql_package` is the schema reverse boundary and "
"verifies the SDL, typed/canonical maps, identity, retained source schema, "
"and forward ledger. Arbitrary GraphQL SDL has no unique JSON Schema "
"acceptance relation and is not accepted as an inverse format."
msgstr ""
"`GraphqlPackage::encode_input` 把源 JSON 键与有限值映射为输入字段名与枚举符"
"号。`decode_output` 对 GraphQL 响应中出现的字段执行逆映射，不会凭空补出被省略"
"的选择。未知或不兼容的值会失败。这个包编解码器是精确的值边界；"
"`import_graphql_package` 是模式的反向边界，它校验 SDL、带类型/规范的映射、标"
"识、所保留的源模式以及正向台账。任意的 GraphQL SDL 没有唯一的 JSON Schema 接"
"受关系，不被接受为逆向格式。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:507
msgid ""
"GraphQL variable coercion differs from JSON Schema validation at these "
"closed boundaries:"
msgstr "GraphQL 变量强制转换与 JSON Schema 验证在以下封闭边界上存在差异："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:510
msgid "Boundary"
msgstr "边界"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:510
msgid "Located loss families"
msgstr "带位置的损失类别"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:512
msgid "object fields and names"
msgstr "对象字段与名称"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:512
msgid "additional properties, pattern properties, property names/counts"
msgstr "附加属性、模式属性、属性名/属性数量"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:513
msgid "requiredness and recursion"
msgstr "是否必需与递归"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:513
msgid ""
"nullable-presence widening, one deterministic recursive-input nullability "
"relaxation"
msgstr "可空存在性放宽，一处确定性的递归输入可空性放宽"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:514
msgid "lists"
msgstr "列表"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:514
msgid ""
"singleton coercion, cardinality, contains, uniqueness, tuples, unevaluated "
"items"
msgstr "单例强制转换、基数、contains、唯一性、元组、未求值项"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:515
msgid "scalar assertions"
msgstr "标量断言"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:515
msgid "integer domain delegation, numeric predicates, string predicates"
msgstr "整数值域委托、数值谓词、字符串谓词"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:516
msgid "applicators"
msgstr "应用器（applicator）"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:516
msgid "conditionals, dependencies, intersections, unions, `oneOf`, negation"
msgstr "条件、依赖、交集、并集、`oneOf`、否定"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:517
msgid "runtime boundary"
msgstr "运行时边界"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:517
msgid "custom-scalar and unknown-keyword validation delegation"
msgstr "自定义标量与未知关键字的验证委托"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:519
msgid ""
"The caller-named fallback scalar is declared but PurRDF does not invent its "
"`parseValue`, `parseLiteral`, or serialization semantics. Every delegated "
"use is therefore ledgered. Loss entries carry stable codes and source JSON "
"Pointer locations; an exact package has an empty ledger."
msgstr ""
"由调用方命名的后备标量会被声明，但 PurRDF 不会自行发明其 `parseValue`、"
"`parseLiteral` 或序列化语义。因此，每一处委托使用都会记入台账。损失条目携带稳"
"定的代码与源 JSON Pointer 位置；精确的包台账为空。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:524
msgid ""
"Emission fails before returning bytes for invalid caller configuration, "
"malformed schema keywords, `$id` rebasing, external/indirect/dangling "
"`$ref`, `$dynamicRef`/`$recursiveRef`, alias cycles, unsatisfiable closed "
"required fields, and generated-name collisions. The fixed limits are 16 MiB "
"for the input schema, each artifact, and one codec value; 65,536 "
"definitions, fields per object, or finite values; depth 128; and 255 bytes "
"per GraphQL name."
msgstr ""
"对于无效的调用方配置、格式错误的模式关键字、`$id` 重定基准、外部/间接/悬空的 "
"`$ref`、`$dynamicRef`/`$recursiveRef`、别名环、无法满足的封闭必需字段以及生成"
"名称冲突，输出会在返回字节之前失败。固定上限为：输入模式、每个工件与单个编解"
"码值各 16 MiB；定义数、每个对象的字段数或有限值数各 65,536；深度 128；每个 "
"GraphQL 名称 255 字节。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:531
msgid ""
"The independent dev oracle classifies source values with `boon`, builds the "
"SDL with locked official GraphQL.js 16.14.0, and executes real variable "
"coercion. It verifies exact agreement, every closed loss family and "
"location, the name map and production codec, and deliberate corruption "
"failures:"
msgstr ""
"独立的开发期判定依据（oracle）用 `boon` 对源值分类，用锁定版本的官方 "
"GraphQL.js 16.14.0 构建 SDL，并执行真实的变量强制转换。它验证结果完全一致，验"
"证每个封闭的损失类别及其位置、名称映射与生产用编解码器，以及刻意损坏时的失"
"败："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:540
msgid ""
"GraphQL.js is dev-only. Emission and value translation remain filesystem-"
"free, wasm-clean Rust."
msgstr ""
"GraphQL.js 仅用于开发。输出与值转换仍是不访问文件系统、wasm-clean 的 Rust。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:543
msgid "Rules, node expressions and certifying a shapes graph"
msgstr "规则、节点表达式与形状图认证"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:545
msgid ""
"Three tools sit beside validation. Every host reaches the same library entry "
"point, so the command line, Python, WebAssembly and C cannot disagree about "
"the answer."
msgstr ""
"验证之外还有三个工具。每个宿主都到达同一个库入口点，因此命令行、Python、"
"WebAssembly 与 C 在答案上不可能出现分歧。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:549
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:549
msgid "Python (`purrdf.shapes`)"
msgstr "Python（`purrdf.shapes`）"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:551
msgid "Run rules, write the inference graph"
msgstr "运行规则，写出推理图"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:551
msgid "`purrdf_shapes::infer`, `srl::infer`"
msgstr "`purrdf_shapes::infer`, `srl::infer`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:551
msgid "`purrdf rules`"
msgstr "`purrdf rules`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:551
msgid "`apply_rules`"
msgstr "`apply_rules`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:551
msgid "`shaclApplyRules`"
msgstr "`shaclApplyRules`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:551
msgid "`purrdf_shacl_apply_rules`"
msgstr "`purrdf_shacl_apply_rules`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:552
msgid "Evaluate one node expression"
msgstr "对单个节点表达式求值"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:552
msgid "`free_expression::evaluate`"
msgstr "`free_expression::evaluate`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:552
msgid "`purrdf node-expr`"
msgstr "`purrdf node-expr`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:552
msgid "`eval_node_expr`"
msgstr "`eval_node_expr`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:552
msgid "`shaclEvalNodeExpr`"
msgstr "`shaclEvalNodeExpr`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:552
msgid "`purrdf_shacl_eval_node_expr`"
msgstr "`purrdf_shacl_eval_node_expr`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:553
msgid "Certify a shapes graph"
msgstr "认证形状图"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:553
msgid "`lint::lint`"
msgstr "`lint::lint`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:553
msgid "`purrdf shapes lint`"
msgstr "`purrdf shapes lint`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:553
msgid "`lint_shapes`"
msgstr "`lint_shapes`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:553
msgid "`shaclLintShapes`"
msgstr "`shaclLintShapes`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:553
msgid "`purrdf_shacl_lint_shapes`"
msgstr "`purrdf_shacl_lint_shapes`"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:555
msgid ""
"**Rules.** The rule source is either a shapes graph, whose SHACL 1.2 rules "
"run (its default rule set), or a SPARQL 1.2 RL rule set, but not both. The "
"result is the **inference graph**: the inferred triples only, never the data "
"graph, as N-Triples 1.2 in one canonical order. On request, each host also "
"returns the proof of every inferred triple. The proof is one block per "
"triple: `derived S P O .`, then `  rule R` and one `  premise S P O .` line "
"for each fact the rule's body matched. A SPARQL 1.2 RL data-block triple has "
"`  data-block` instead."
msgstr ""
"**规则。** 规则来源要么是形状图（运行其 SHACL 1.2 规则，即其默认规则集），要"
"么是 SPARQL 1.2 RL 规则集，但不能两者兼有。结果是**推理图**：只包含推出的三元"
"组，绝不包含数据图，以 N-Triples 1.2 按唯一的规范顺序给出。应请求，每个宿主还"
"会返回每个推出三元组的证明。证明对每个三元组给出一个块：`derived S P O .`，随"
"后是 `  rule R`，以及规则体所匹配的每个事实各一行 `  premise S P O .`。"
"SPARQL 1.2 RL 数据块中的三元组则改为 `  data-block`。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:563
msgid ""
"Every host takes the same **term-generating round limit**. This bounds the "
"evaluation rounds that infer a term the graph did not already hold, and one "
"more round fails the run naming the limit. The default is 65,536 rounds. **A "
"host running untrusted rule sets should lower it**: a rule set whose term "
"generation diverges (an exponential one in particular) reaches the engine's "
"fixed arena and join ceilings only slowly under the default."
msgstr ""
"每个宿主都接受同一个**生成新项的轮数上限**。它限制那些推出图中原本没有的项的"
"求值轮数，再多一轮就会以点名该上限的方式使运行失败。默认值为 65,536 轮。**运"
"行不受信任规则集的宿主应当调低它**：生成新项发散的规则集（尤其是指数式发散的"
"规则集）在默认值下只会很缓慢地触及引擎固定的项存储区与连接上限。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:575
msgid "\"inferred\""
msgstr "\"inferred\""

#: src/validation/shacl.md:575
msgid "# the inference graph, N-Triples\n"
msgstr "# 推理图，N-Triples\n"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:576
msgid "\"proof\""
msgstr "\"proof\""

#: src/validation/shacl.md:576
msgid "# the proof text\n"
msgstr "# 证明文本\n"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:577
msgid "# SPARQL 1.2 RL\n"
msgstr "# SPARQL 1.2 RL\n"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:580
msgid ""
"**Node expressions.** One node expression of a shapes graph is evaluated "
"against a focus node of a data graph, as SHACL 1.2 Node Expressions' "
"`evalExpr(expr, focusGraph, focusNode, scope)`. The expression is parsed by "
"the shapes parser itself, so custom functions, shape references and "
"`sh:prefixes` bind as they do inside a shape. The expression is named by "
"IRI, or by `_:label` for a blank node the shapes document labels. Scope "
"variables are bound by name and read by `shnex:var`. The output nodes come "
"back as N-Triples terms in the order the expression's sequence semantics "
"define."
msgstr ""
"**节点表达式。** 形状图中的单个节点表达式针对数据图的某个焦点节点求值，即 "
"SHACL 1.2 节点表达式中的 `evalExpr(expr, focusGraph, focusNode, scope)`。表达"
"式由形状解析器本身解析，因此自定义函数、形状引用与 `sh:prefixes` 的绑定方式与"
"在形状内部完全相同。表达式以 IRI 指名，或以 `_:label` 指名形状文档中带标签的"
"空节点。作用域变量按名称绑定，并由 `shnex:var` 读取。输出节点以 N-Triples 项"
"的形式返回，顺序由表达式的序列语义决定。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:590
msgid "\"_:suffix\""
msgstr "\"_:suffix\""

#: src/validation/shacl.md:591
msgid "\"http://example.org/a\""
msgstr "\"http://example.org/a\""

#: src/validation/shacl.md:591
msgid "\"suffix\""
msgstr "\"suffix\""

#: src/validation/shacl.md:591
msgid "'\"!\"'"
msgstr "'\"!\"'"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:594
msgid ""
"**Certifying a shapes graph.** Loading a shapes graph is the hot path: it "
"refuses the first construct it cannot evaluate faithfully, and does not pay "
"for validating the graph against the W3C `shacl-shacl.ttl`. Linting pays "
"that cost once, on request, and reports three sections:"
msgstr ""
"**形状图认证。** 加载形状图是热路径：它拒绝遇到的第一个无法如实求值的构造，且"
"不为依据 W3C `shacl-shacl.ttl` 验证该图付出代价。lint 按需付出这一代价一次，"
"并报告三个部分："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:599
msgid "`load`: the loader's verdict, accepted or the refusal it raised."
msgstr "`load`：加载器的裁决，即接受，或它抛出的拒绝。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:600
msgid ""
"`shacl-shacl`: every result of validating the shapes graph against the "
"vendored `shacl-shacl.ttl`. That file predates some SHACL 1.2 Core "
"relaxations (`sh:closed sh:ByTypes`, a list-valued `sh:nodeKind`, a path-"
"valued `sh:equals`, a node-expression `sh:targetNode`). A result SHACL 1.2 "
"Core makes well-formed is marked `superseded` and is not a finding, but only "
"when the loader accepted the graph."
msgstr ""
"`shacl-shacl`：依据随库固化的 `shacl-shacl.ttl` 验证形状图所得的每条结果。该"
"文件早于 SHACL 1.2 Core 的部分放宽（`sh:closed sh:ByTypes`、取列表值的 "
"`sh:nodeKind`、以路径为值的 `sh:equals`、以节点表达式给出的 "
"`sh:targetNode`）。若某条结果所指出的构造在 SHACL 1.2 Core 中是良构的，该结果"
"会被标记为 `superseded`，不算作问题，但仅在加载器接受了该图时如此。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:606
msgid ""
"`functions`: which implementation every node-expression function call binds "
"to — `native`, `custom`, `sparql-registered` or `host-extension`. For a "
"shapes graph that merges the W3C SHACL 1.2 vocabularies, a `sh:sparqlExpr` "
"call binds `native` even though the graph declares `sh:SPARQLExprExpression`."
msgstr ""
"`functions`：每个节点表达式函数调用绑定到哪个实现——`native`、`custom`、"
"`sparql-registered` 或 `host-extension`。对于合并了 W3C SHACL 1.2 词汇表的形"
"状图，即使图中声明了 `sh:SPARQLExprExpression`，`sh:sparqlExpr` 调用仍绑定为 "
"`native`。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:611
msgid ""
"A report is clean when the loader accepted the graph and every `shacl-shacl` "
"result is superseded. Every host renders the same deterministic text; the "
"[CLI reference](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/"
"crates/cli/README.md#shapes-lint) shows it."
msgstr ""
"当加载器接受了该图、且每条 `shacl-shacl` 结果都已被取代时，报告即为干净。每个"
"宿主渲染同一份确定性的文本；[CLI 参考](https://github.com/Blackcat-"
"Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/crates/cli/README.md#shapes-lint)给出了示例。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:616 src/validation/shapes-products.md:769
msgid "From Python"
msgstr "从 Python 调用"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:621
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr "\"...\""

#: src/validation/shacl.md:622
msgid "# True / False\n"
msgstr "# True / False\n"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:623
msgid "\"results\""
msgstr "\"results\""

#: src/validation/shacl.md:623
msgid "# list of violation dicts\n"
msgstr "# 违规字典列表\n"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:626
msgid ""
"Each result dict keeps the stable keys `focus`, `path`, `value`, `severity`, "
"`component`, `source_shape`, and `messages` (every `sh:resultMessage`, each "
"a dict with `text` and its `language` / `direction` / `datatype` when "
"present). A result that carries SHACL-SPARQL result annotations also has "
"`annotations`, a list of tuples, each a property IRI and a value in N-"
"Triples syntax."
msgstr ""
"每个结果字典保留稳定的键 `focus`、`path`、`value`、`severity`、`component`、"
"`source_shape` 与 `messages`（每条 `sh:resultMessage`，各为一个字典，含 "
"`text`，存在时还含其 `language` / `direction` / `datatype`）。携带 SHACL-"
"SPARQL 结果注解的结果还带有 `annotations`：一个元组列表，每个元组由一个属性 "
"IRI 与一个采用 N-Triples 语法的值组成。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:632
msgid "The report is a dataset"
msgstr "报告是一个数据集"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:634
msgid ""
"`ValidationReport::to_dataset()` materializes the W3C validation report — "
"the `sh:ValidationReport` node and its `sh:ValidationResult`s — as a frozen "
"`RdfDataset`, built straight from the report's own terms rather than through "
"a `to_ntriples()` → `parse_dataset()` round-trip. The direct path carries "
"every RDF 1.2 term the report holds (a triple-term focus node included) with "
"the report's own blank-node labels, and the blank nodes the report _mints_ "
"(the report node, one per result, the interior nodes of a complex `sh:path`) "
"are guaranteed distinct from every blank node the data graph _carries_. "
"Rendering the report in any syntax is then "
"`serialize_dataset(&report.to_dataset(), …)`, which is exactly what `purrdf "
"validate --format` does."
msgstr ""
"`ValidationReport::to_dataset()` 把 W3C 验证报告——`sh:ValidationReport` 节点"
"及其各个 `sh:ValidationResult`——物化为一个冻结的 `RdfDataset`，直接由报告自身"
"的项构建，而不是经过 `to_ntriples()` → `parse_dataset()` 的往返（转换）。这条"
"直接路径携带报告所含的每一个 RDF 1.2 项（包括作为焦点节点的三元组项），并沿用"
"报告自身的空节点标签；而报告所*生成*的空节点（报告节点、每条结果各一个、复杂 "
"`sh:path` 的内部节点）保证与数据图所*携带*的每个空节点都不相同。于是，以任意"
"语法渲染报告就是 `serialize_dataset(&report.to_dataset(), …)`，这正是 "
"`purrdf validate --format` 所做的。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:645
msgid "SARIF output"
msgstr "SARIF 输出"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:647
msgid ""
"Validation reports stay structured in the engine; the SARIF 2.1.0 boundary "
"is the separate [`purrdf-validate`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-validate) crate "
"(`purrdf::validate`), which renders a report — or parser diagnostics — as a "
"source-traced, byte-deterministic SARIF log for editors, CI, and code-"
"scanning dashboards:"
msgstr ""
"验证报告在引擎中保持结构化；SARIF 2.1.0 边界是独立的 [`purrdf-validate`]"
"(https://docs.rs/purrdf-validate) crate（`purrdf::validate`），它把报告——或解"
"析器诊断——渲染为可追溯到源位置、逐字节确定性的 SARIF 日志，供编辑器、CI 与代"
"码扫描仪表板使用："

#: src/validation/shacl.md:656
msgid ""
"r#\"\n"
"    @prefix sh:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .\n"
"    @prefix ex:  <http://example.org/> .\n"
"    @prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .\n"
"    ex:PersonShape a sh:NodeShape ;\n"
"      sh:targetClass ex:Person ;\n"
"      sh:property [ sh:path ex:age ; sh:datatype xsd:integer ] .\n"
"\"#"
msgstr ""
"r#\"\n"
"    @prefix sh:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .\n"
"    @prefix ex:  <http://example.org/> .\n"
"    @prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .\n"
"    ex:PersonShape a sh:NodeShape ;\n"
"      sh:targetClass ex:Person ;\n"
"      sh:property [ sh:path ex:age ; sh:datatype xsd:integer ] .\n"
"\"#"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:664
msgid ""
"r#\"<http://example.org/alice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-"
"ns#type> <http://example.org/Person> .\n"
"<http://example.org/alice> <http://example.org/age> \"nope\" .\n"
"\"#"
msgstr ""
"r#\"<http://example.org/alice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-"
"ns#type> <http://example.org/Person> .\n"
"<http://example.org/alice> <http://example.org/age> \"nope\" .\n"
"\"#"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:669
msgid "\"sarif produced\""
msgstr "\"sarif produced\""

#: src/validation/shacl.md:670
msgid "\"\\\"version\\\": \\\"2.1.0\\\"\""
msgstr "\"\\\"version\\\": \\\"2.1.0\\\"\""

#: src/validation/shacl.md:673
msgid ""
"Lower-level entry points (`build_report_sarif`, `build_diagnostics_sarif`) "
"build a `SarifLog` value instead of a string, so a host can merge runs "
"before serializing."
msgstr ""
"更底层的入口点（`build_report_sarif`、`build_diagnostics_sarif`）构建的是 "
"`SarifLog` 值而非字符串，因此宿主可以在序列化之前合并多个 run。"

#: src/validation/shacl.md:679
msgid ""
"The validator is gated by the vendored W3C SHACL 1.0 `data-shapes` suite, "
"the vendored W3C SHACL 1.2 suite, a vendored DASH SHACL-AF/rules corpus, and "
"a first-party frozen corpus of 73 cases with byte-frozen expected reports; "
"SHACL Rules output is compared to expected inferred graphs by RDFC-1.0 "
"isomorphism. The parser is also held to the SHACL 1.2 specification's own "
"SHACL-for-SHACL shapes graph: over every first-party and W3C shapes graph "
"and a set of generated mutants, it refuses a graph exactly when `shacl-"
"shacl.ttl` reports a violation, apart from named cases. See [Conformance & "
"Testing](../project/conformance.md)."
msgstr ""
"该验证器由随库固化的 W3C SHACL 1.0 `data-shapes` 套件、随库固化的 W3C SHACL "
"1.2 套件、随库固化的 DASH SHACL-AF/规则语料，以及一个含 73 个用例、预期报告逐"
"字节冻结的第一方冻结语料把关；SHACL Rules 的输出按 RDFC-1.0 同构与预期推理图"
"比较。解析器还受 SHACL 1.2 规范自带的 SHACL-for-SHACL 形状图约束：在每个第一"
"方与 W3C 形状图以及一组生成的变异体上，除已点名的用例外，它恰好在 `shacl-"
"shacl.ttl` 报告违规时拒绝该图。参见[一致性与测试](../project/"
"conformance.md)。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:8
msgid ""
"A shapes graph is parsed, linked and analyzed before a single focus node is "
"looked at, and that work is identical on every validation of the same "
"document. A **prepared shapes product** does it once and writes the result "
"out as bytes: a deterministic, versioned, authenticated artifact carrying "
"the compiled SHACL model plus its reusable analysis, so a process can "
"restore a prepared validator instead of re-parsing Turtle."
msgstr ""
"在查看任何一个焦点节点之前，形状图就已经过解析、链接与分析，而这项工作在同一"
"文档的每次验证中都完全相同。**预备形状产物**（prepared shapes product）只做一"
"次这项工作，并把结果以字节形式写出：一个确定性的、带版本的、经过认证的工件，"
"携带编译后的 SHACL 模型及其可复用的分析结果，从而使进程可以恢复一个预备好的验"
"证器，而无须重新解析 Turtle。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:15
msgid ""
"`purrdf shacl pack` writes one. `purrdf validate --shapes-product` restores "
"one instead of parsing a shapes document. `purrdf shacl verify` and `purrdf "
"shacl explain` are the admission surface for those bytes."
msgstr ""
"`purrdf shacl pack` 写出产物。`purrdf validate --shapes-product` 恢复产物，而"
"不是解析形状文档。`purrdf shacl verify` 与 `purrdf shacl explain` 是这些字节"
"的准入接口。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:19
msgid ""
"**A product that comes back from disk is untrusted, and decoding it is "
"admission rather than parsing.** Nothing in a product is evidence of its own "
"provenance. The stage id, the profile and the complete input binding are all "
"checked before any of it reaches the validator, and a mismatch is **refused "
"on a named dimension** rather than validated under the wrong configuration. "
"The failure that design exists to prevent is silent: a product prepared "
"under one prefix map, base, vocabulary or function registry does not crash "
"when restored under different ones — it validates, and returns a well-formed "
"report about a shapes graph nobody asked for."
msgstr ""
"**从磁盘读回的产物是不受信任的，对其解码是准入（admission），而不是解析。** "
"产物中的任何内容都不能证明其自身的溯源。阶段 id、profile 以及完整的输入绑定都"
"会在其中任何部分到达验证器之前受到检查，不匹配的情况会**在一个具名维度上被拒"
"绝**，而不是在错误的配置下进行验证。这一设计所要防止的故障是静默的：在某一前"
"缀映射、基准、词汇表或函数注册表下预备的产物，在不同的前缀映射、基准、词汇表"
"或函数注册表下恢复时并不会崩溃——它会进行验证，并返回一份良构的报告，而报告所"
"针对的形状图无人请求过。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:29
msgid ""
"The design record behind this surface is [`docs/design/purrdf-prepared-"
"products.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/"
"design/purrdf-prepared-products.md)."
msgstr ""
"这一接口背后的设计记录见 [`docs/design/purrdf-prepared-products.md`](https://"
"github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/design/purrdf-prepared-"
"products.md)。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:32
msgid "Producing a product"
msgstr "生成产物"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:41
msgid ""
"`--shapes` and `--out` are required; `--out -` writes the raw bytes to "
"stdout. A receipt goes to stderr _after_ the artifact, so it never "
"contaminates a piped product:"
msgstr ""
"`--shapes` 与 `--out` 是必需的；`--out -` 把原始字节写到 stdout。回执在工件*"
"之后*写到 stderr，因此绝不会污染经管道传出的产物："

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:50
msgid ""
"`--shapes` must be a **path**, not `-`. A product records the base its "
"shapes graph was parsed under, and standard input has no retrieval IRI to "
"derive one from; passing `--shapes -` is a usage error telling you to give a "
"path or name the base with `--base`. When `--base` is omitted, the "
"document's own `file://` retrieval IRI is derived — the same base `validate "
"--shapes` parses it under, so packing and direct validation cannot disagree "
"about what a relative reference resolves to."
msgstr ""
"`--shapes` 必须是一个**路径**，而不能是 `-`。产物会记录其形状图解析时所用的基"
"准，而标准输入没有可从中推导基准的检索 IRI；传入 `--shapes -` 属于用法错误，"
"错误信息会要求给出路径，或用 `--base` 指定基准。省略 `--base` 时，会推导出文"
"档自身的 `file://` 检索 IRI——即 `validate --shapes` 解析该文档时所用的同一基"
"准，因此打包与直接验证在相对引用解析为何物这一问题上不可能出现分歧。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:58
msgid ""
"Turtle is the accepted shapes syntax because it is the one syntax carrying a "
"`@prefix`/`PREFIX` map recoverable from source text, and that map is the "
"fallback prefix environment every SHACL-AF `sh:select` body resolves "
"against. The product records it."
msgstr ""
"Turtle 是所接受的形状语法，因为它是唯一一种携带可从源文本中恢复的 `@prefix`/"
"`PREFIX` 映射的语法，而该映射正是每个 SHACL-AF `sh:select` 主体据以解析的后备"
"前缀环境。产物会记录这一映射。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:63
msgid ""
"`owl:imports` is folded at pack time, the same way `validate --shapes` folds "
"it"
msgstr "`owl:imports` 在打包时折叠，方式与 `validate --shapes` 的折叠方式相同"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:65
msgid ""
"`shacl pack` accepts the identical `--import IRI=FILE` table `validate --"
"shapes` does, resolves the same transitive closure, and packs the merged "
"graph — see [`owl:imports` in a shapes graph](shacl.md#owlimports-in-a-"
"shapes-graph) for the closure semantics, which are shared code, not a "
"parallel re-implementation:"
msgstr ""
"`shacl pack` 接受与 `validate --shapes` 完全相同的 `--import IRI=FILE` 表，解"
"析同一个传递闭包，并打包合并后的图——闭包语义参见[形状图中的 `owl:imports`]"
"(shacl.md#形状图中的-owlimports)，二者使用的是共享代码，而不是一份平行的重新"
"实现："

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:78
msgid ""
"An import of the shapes document's own IRI (`--base`, its `file://` "
"retrieval IRI, or an in-document `@base`), or of an ontology already in the "
"shapes graph (`<X> a owl:Ontology`, or an ontology whose `owl:versionIRI` is "
"`<X>`), needs no pair. Every other `owl:imports` no pair resolves is refused "
"by name, exactly as it is for `validate --shapes`, and a pair the closure "
"never reaches is refused as unused. The product is never packed from a "
"smaller shapes graph than the one named."
msgstr ""
"对形状文档自身 IRI（`--base`、其 `file://` 获取 IRI，或文档内的 `@base`）的导"
"入，或对形状图中已有本体（`<X> a owl:Ontology`，或 `owl:versionIRI` 为 `<X>` "
"的本体）的导入，都无需配对。其他任何没有配对能够解析的 `owl:imports` 都会被点"
"名拒绝，与 `validate --shapes` 完全一致；导入闭包从未到达的配对会作为未使用而"
"被拒绝。产物绝不会从比所指名者更小的形状图打包而成。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:87
msgid ""
"This did not always hold. `shacl pack` used to read the shapes document "
"through a route with no import table and no diagnostic channel at all, so an "
"unresolved `owl:imports` was dropped with nothing printed, and the resulting "
"product carried FEWER shapes than the document it was packed from — a "
"decided, well-formed, wrong verdict every time it was restored. Packing with "
"`--import` and validating the document with the same `--import` now reach "
"the byte-identical report, by construction: the two commands read and fold "
"the closure through the same function."
msgstr ""
"过去并非总是如此。`shacl pack` 曾经通过一条既无导入表、也完全没有诊断通道的路"
"径读取形状文档，因此未解析的 `owl:imports` 会在没有任何输出的情况下被丢弃，所"
"得产物携带的形状比其打包来源文档**更少**——每次恢复时都会给出一个已判定的、良"
"构的、错误的裁决。如今，用 `--import` 打包与用同一 `--import` 验证该文档，按"
"构造就会得到逐字节相同的报告：两条命令通过同一个函数读取并折叠闭包。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:96
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Python, C-ABI and WebAssembly bindings pack through the same resolution "
"with their own import table — `imports=` in Python, `importIris` / "
"`importDocuments` in JavaScript, `import_iris` / `import_documents` / "
"`import_count` in C — and a closure that is not in hand is refused with the "
"same typed import error their validation functions raise. See [The same "
"rule on every host](shacl.md#the-same-rule-on-every-host)."
msgstr ""
"Python、C-ABI 与 WebAssembly 绑定以各自的导入表经由同一"
"解析过程打包——Python 中为 `imports=`，JavaScript "
"中为 `importIris` / `importDocuments`，C 中为"
" `import_iris` / `import_documents` / `i"
"mport_count`——导入闭包不完整时，会以与其验证函数相同的类型化导入错"
"误被拒绝。参见[每个宿主上的同一规则](shacl.md#the-same-ru"
"le-on-every-host)。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:101
msgid ""
"`--shapes-graph` is resolved and recorded at pack time, the same way "
"`validate --shapes` resolves it"
msgstr ""
"`--shapes-graph` 在打包时解析并记录，方式与 `validate --shapes` 的解析方式相"
"同"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:103
msgid ""
"SHACL-SPARQL exposes the shapes graph itself as a named graph — a "
"`sh:select` body may read `GRAPH $shapesGraph { … }` — and `--shapes-graph "
"IRI` names what that graph is called, overriding a `sh:shapesGraph` the "
"document declares:"
msgstr ""
"SHACL-SPARQL 把形状图本身公开为一个命名图——`sh:select` 主体可以读取 `GRAPH "
"$shapesGraph { … }`——而 `--shapes-graph IRI` 指定该图的名称，覆盖文档所声明"
"的 `sh:shapesGraph`："

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:114
msgid ""
"A relative value resolves against the SAME base the shapes document parses "
"under — the one `--base` names, or the document's own `file://` retrieval "
"IRI — which is the identical derivation `validate --shapes --shapes-graph` "
"spends the flag on. That agreement is the whole point: a product packed with "
"`--shapes-graph IRI` and a document validated with `--shapes --shapes-graph "
"IRI` expose `$shapesGraph` under the same absolute IRI and reach the byte-"
"identical report. Before this flag existed, `shacl pack` had no way to "
"record ANY override at all, so a shapes graph whose SHACL-SPARQL bodies "
"depend on `$shapesGraph` validated one answer through `--shapes` and a "
"different one through a restored product, with nothing on the command line "
"able to close the gap."
msgstr ""
"相对值依据形状文档解析时所用的**同一**基准进行解析——即 `--base` 指定的基准，"
"或文档自身的 `file://` 检索 IRI——这与 `validate --shapes --shapes-graph` 使用"
"该标志时的推导完全相同。这种一致正是关键所在：用 `--shapes-graph IRI` 打包的"
"产物与用 `--shapes --shapes-graph IRI` 验证的文档，会在同一个绝对 IRI 下公开 "
"`$shapesGraph`，并得到逐字节相同的报告。在这个标志出现之前，`shacl pack` 根本"
"无法记录**任何**覆盖，因此一个 SHACL-SPARQL 主体依赖 `$shapesGraph` 的形状"
"图，经由 `--shapes` 验证得到一个答案，经由恢复的产物验证却得到另一个答案，而"
"命令行上没有任何手段能够弥合这一差距。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:126
msgid ""
"Omitting `--shapes-graph` packs exactly as it always has: the product "
"records whatever `sh:shapesGraph` the shapes graph itself declares, or none "
"at all."
msgstr ""
"省略 `--shapes-graph` 时，打包行为与以往完全相同：产物记录形状图自身声明的 "
"`sh:shapesGraph`，若无声明则不记录。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:129
msgid ""
"`--box-role-vocab` is resolved and recorded at pack time, the same way "
"`validate --shapes` resolves it"
msgstr ""
"`--box-role-vocab` 在打包时解析并记录，方式与 `validate --shapes` 的解析方式"
"相同"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:131
msgid ""
"The graph-box role annotation feature takes a caller-supplied vocabulary — "
"six term IRIs derived by concatenation from one namespace — and PurRDF mints "
"no vocabulary IRIs of its own, so there is no default: without `--box-role-"
"vocab` the feature is simply **inactive**, exactly as it always has been."
msgstr ""
"图盒角色注解（graph-box role annotation）功能采用调用方提供的词汇表——由一个命"
"名空间通过拼接推导出的六个术语 IRI——而 PurRDF 不生成任何自有的词汇表 IRI，因"
"此不存在默认值：没有 `--box-role-vocab` 时，该功能只是处于**未激活**状态，与"
"以往完全一样。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:143
msgid ""
"`--box-role-vocab NS` derives `NSgraphBoxRole`, `NSboxABox`, `NSboxTBox`, "
"`NSboxRBox`, `NSboxCBox` and `NSboxConfigBox`, records the namespace into "
"the product's identity (the `box-role-vocab` component — see [The refusal "
"dimensions](#the-refusal-dimensions)), and is the identical derivation "
"`validate --shapes --box-role-vocab NS` spends the flag on: a product packed "
"with the flag and a document validated with the same flag parse to the same "
"`box_role_vocab` and therefore restore or run under the identical "
"`vocabulary` component. Omitting the flag packs exactly as it always has: "
"the component records **absent**, and no role annotation is collected or "
"stamped."
msgstr ""
"`--box-role-vocab NS` 推导出 `NSgraphBoxRole`、`NSboxABox`、`NSboxTBox`、"
"`NSboxRBox`、`NSboxCBox` 与 `NSboxConfigBox`，把该命名空间记录到产物的身份中"
"（即 `box-role-vocab` 组成项——参见[拒绝维度](#拒绝维度)），并且与 `validate "
"--shapes --box-role-vocab NS` 使用该标志时的推导完全相同：用该标志打包的产物"
"与用同一标志验证的文档，会解析出相同的 `box_role_vocab`，因此会在完全相同的 "
"`vocabulary` 组成项下恢复或运行。省略该标志时，打包行为与以往完全相同：该组成"
"项记录为**缺失**，不收集也不标记任何角色注解。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:153
msgid ""
"The writer is **byte-deterministic**. No wall clock, no randomness and no "
"hash-iteration order reach it, so two runs over the same document, base and "
"import table produce identical bytes and a content-addressed cache key over "
"a product is stable."
msgstr ""
"写出器是**逐字节确定性的**。挂钟时间、随机性与哈希迭代顺序都不会影响它，因此"
"对同一文档、基准与导入表的两次运行会产生完全相同的字节，而基于产物内容寻址的"
"缓存键是稳定的。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:158
msgid "From Rust:"
msgstr "在 Rust 中："

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:165 src/validation/shapes-products.md:774
#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:847
msgid "\"https://example.org/shapes\""
msgstr "\"https://example.org/shapes\""

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:170
msgid ""
"`ShapesProfile::CORE` is named explicitly and there is no default. It is the "
"one profile this build implements — SHACL Core plus SHACL-SPARQL plus SHACL-"
"AF with zero host-injected dependencies — and a caller cannot mint a profile "
"of its own, because a profile a caller can spell would be a claim about a "
"product rather than a fact about it."
msgstr ""
"`ShapesProfile::CORE` 需要显式指定，不存在默认值。它是本构建实现的唯一一个 "
"profile——SHACL Core 加 SHACL-SPARQL 加 SHACL-AF，且没有任何宿主注入的依赖——调"
"用方无法生成自己的 profile，因为调用方能够拼写出来的 profile 将是关于产物的一"
"项声称，而不是关于产物的一项事实。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:176
msgid ""
"\"Zero host-injected dependencies\" is a statement about what a product "
"_needs_, not a ban on host wiring. A Rust host that injects native SPARQL "
"functions or custom aggregates packs and restores through the entry points "
"described in [Host-injected implementations](#host-injected-"
"implementations); every other caller, and every non-Rust binding, uses the "
"plain path above."
msgstr ""
"「零宿主注入依赖」是关于产物*需要*什么的陈述，而不是对宿主接线的禁止。注入原"
"生 SPARQL 函数或自定义聚合的 Rust 宿主，通过[宿主注入的实现](#宿主注入的实现)"
"中描述的入口点进行打包与恢复；其他所有调用方，以及所有非 Rust 绑定，都使用上"
"面的普通路径。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:182
msgid "What a product carries, and what it does not"
msgstr "产物携带什么，不携带什么"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:184
msgid "A product carries three sections, always all three:"
msgstr "产物携带三个部分，总是三者齐全："

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:186
msgid "Section"
msgstr "部分"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:186
msgid "Carries"
msgstr "携带内容"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:188
msgid "identity"
msgstr "identity（身份）"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:188
msgid ""
"the preparation stage id, the profile id, and the parse inputs (base, prefix "
"map, `sh:shapesGraph` IRI, box-role vocabulary)"
msgstr ""
"预备阶段 id、profile id，以及解析输入（基准、前缀映射、`sh:shapesGraph` IRI、"
"盒角色词汇表）"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:189
msgid "dataset"
msgstr "dataset（数据集）"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:189
msgid "the shapes dataset itself, in PurRDF's succinct pack container"
msgstr "形状数据集本身，采用 PurRDF 的简洁（succinct）打包容器"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:190
msgid "model"
msgstr "model（模型）"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:190
msgid ""
"the declarative SHACL model — node shapes, constraints, paths, node "
"expressions, SHACL-AF rules, `sh:SPARQLTargetType` declarations — and, as "
"its last field, the reusable class analysis derived from it"
msgstr ""
"声明式 SHACL 模型——节点形状、约束、路径、节点表达式、SHACL-AF 规则、"
"`sh:SPARQLTargetType` 声明——以及作为其最后一个字段的、由该模型推导出的可复用"
"类分析"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:192
msgid ""
"Each section carries its own SHA-256; the envelope adds an identity-region "
"digest and a whole-container digest in a sealed trailer that also restates "
"the total length, so a product truncated anywhere or appended to anywhere is "
"refused."
msgstr ""
"每个部分都携带自己的 SHA-256；封套另外在一个封存的尾部中添加身份区域摘要与整"
"个容器的摘要，该尾部还会重申总长度，因此在任何位置被截断或在任何位置被追加内"
"容的产物都会被拒绝。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:197
msgid ""
"The shapes **dataset** travels inside the product for two independent "
"reasons. SHACL-SPARQL exposes the shapes graph as a named graph — "
"`$shapesGraph` is bound for every `sh:select` body — so a product that "
"dropped it would restore a validator that answers `GRAPH $shapesGraph { … }` "
"with zero rows and reports that as success. And it is what `rebuild` re-"
"derives from when a product was written by another build; see [Restoring a "
"product](#restoring-a-product)."
msgstr ""
"形状**数据集**随产物一起传递，出于两个彼此独立的原因。SHACL-SPARQL 把形状图公"
"开为一个命名图——每个 `sh:select` 主体都绑定了 `$shapesGraph`——因此丢弃它的产"
"物会恢复出一个对 `GRAPH $shapesGraph { … }` 返回零行、并将其报告为成功的验证"
"器。此外，当产物由另一个构建写出时，`rebuild` 正是从它重新推导的；参见[恢复产"
"物](#恢复产物)。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:204
msgid ""
"**Targets are not carried, and there is no section for them.** Target "
"resolution is a property of a _data graph_: a product that cached resolved "
"targets would validate a new snapshot against the focus nodes of an old one, "
"producing a report in which every finding is correct and everything added "
"since the product was written is simply absent. Targets are resolved per "
"bound dataset, every time. What a product removes from the restore path is "
"the parse, the model construction and the shape analysis — reusable "
"preparation and per-dataset binding are different lines in the budget."
msgstr ""
"**目标不被携带，也没有为目标设置的部分。** 目标解析是*数据图*的属性：缓存了已"
"解析目标的产物，会针对旧快照的焦点节点验证新快照，产生一份每项发现都正确、而"
"产物写出之后新增的一切都根本不存在的报告。目标总是按每个绑定的数据集逐次解"
"析。产物从恢复路径中去掉的是解析、模型构建与形状分析——可复用的预备工作与按数"
"据集的绑定是预算中不同的两行。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:213
msgid ""
"**The shape analysis really is removed, not merely checked.** The class "
"analysis — a cycle-safe walk collecting every reachable `sh:class`, "
"`sh:targetClass` and `shnex:instancesOf` IRI and assigning each a binding-"
"row position — is carried as the last field of the model section, and "
"`admit` reads it rather than walking the shape tree again. It is bound "
"rather than trusted: the `class-catalog` component of the identity is the "
"digest of exactly those pairs, positions included, so a carried analysis "
"that is not the one the product was packed with is refused. And it cannot go "
"stale across builds, because the preparation stage id is digested from the "
"class walk's own source — a build whose reachability rule differs cannot "
"share a stage id with the one that packed the product, so `admit` refuses it "
"and `rebuild` re-derives instead."
msgstr ""
"**形状分析确实被去掉了，而不仅仅是被检查。** 类分析——一次对循环安全的遍历，收"
"集每个可到达的 `sh:class`、`sh:targetClass` 与 `shnex:instancesOf` IRI，并为"
"每个 IRI 分配一个绑定行位置——作为模型部分的最后一个字段被携带，`admit` 读取"
"它，而不是再次遍历形状树。它是被绑定的，而不是被信任的：身份中的 `class-"
"catalog` 组成项正是这些配对（包括位置）的摘要，因此所携带的分析若不是产物打包"
"时的那一份，就会被拒绝。它也不会在不同构建之间过时，因为预备阶段 id 是从类遍"
"历自身的源码摘要得出的——可达性规则不同的构建不可能与打包该产物的构建共享同一"
"阶段 id，因此 `admit` 会拒绝它，而 `rebuild` 会改为重新推导。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:225
msgid ""
"It shares the model section rather than taking a fourth section of its own "
"so that the section directory and the container format version did not have "
"to move when it started travelling; a fourth section would have made every "
"product ever packed fail to _open_, which is the one state `rebuild` cannot "
"rescue."
msgstr ""
"它与模型共享同一部分，而不是单独占用第四个部分，这样在它开始随产物传递时，部"
"分目录与容器格式版本都无须变动；第四个部分会让此前打包的每个产物都无法*打开"
"*，而这正是 `rebuild` 无法挽救的唯一一种状态。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:230
msgid ""
"**Nor is the provenance of a restore carried, for the same kind of reason.** "
"A product records the inputs that decided what its shapes _mean_; how a "
"particular preparation was _obtained_ is a fact about one restore in one "
"process, so a product that encoded it would carry a value that is false for "
"every reader except the one that wrote it. It would also move the "
"preparation stage id — a digest over the model's meaning — for a change that "
"alters no meaning at all, invalidating every product ever written. The "
"answer lives on the restored preparation instead, where it is true: see "
"[Which shapes produced this verdict](#which-shapes-produced-this-verdict)."
msgstr ""
"**出于同类原因，恢复的溯源也不被携带。** 产物记录的是决定其形状*含义*的输入；"
"某个特定预备结果是如何*获得*的，是关于一个进程中一次恢复的事实，因此对其编码"
"的产物所携带的值，对除写出者之外的每个读取者都是假的。它还会为一个完全不改变"
"含义的变更而改动预备阶段 id——一个针对模型含义的摘要——从而使此前写出的每个产物"
"都失效。答案改为存放在恢复后的预备结果上，在那里它是真的：参见[哪些形状产生了"
"这一裁决](#哪些形状产生了这一裁决)。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:240
msgid ""
"RDF 1.2 term identity survives the round trip intact, including quoted "
"triples, reifier bindings, statement annotations, and `rdf:dirLangString` "
"literals whose base direction is part of their identity (`\"x\"@en--ltr` and "
"`\"x\"@en--rtl` are two distinct terms)."
msgstr ""
"RDF 1.2 的项身份在往返中完整保留，包括引用三元组、具体化节点（reifier）绑定、"
"陈述注解，以及基础方向构成其身份一部分的 `rdf:dirLangString` 字面量"
"（`\"x\"@en--ltr` 与 `\"x\"@en--rtl` 是两个不同的项）。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:245
msgid ""
"**SPARQL functions the shapes graph declares are carried, and they are "
"carried by the dataset.** A SHACL-AF §5 `sh:SPARQLFunction` is an IRI, an "
"ordered `sh:parameter` list, a `sh:select`/`sh:ask` body and a "
"`sh:returnType` — all of it stated by the shapes graph — so a restore re-"
"derives the declaration from the shapes dataset the product already carries "
"rather than from a second transcription of it in the model. There is one "
"parser for those declarations, and a restore runs it, which is what keeps a "
"restored function identical to the parsed one. The SHACL 1.2 expression-"
"bodied declarations (`sh:ListParameterExpressionFunction`) are carried too, "
"from the model, because their bodies _are_ node expressions."
msgstr ""
"**形状图声明的 SPARQL 函数会被携带，并且由数据集携带。** SHACL-AF §5 的 "
"`sh:SPARQLFunction` 由一个 IRI、一个有序的 `sh:parameter` 列表、一个 "
"`sh:select`/`sh:ask` 主体和一个 `sh:returnType` 组成——全部由形状图陈述——因此"
"恢复时会从产物已经携带的形状数据集重新推导该声明，而不是从模型中对它的第二份"
"转录推导。这些声明只有一个解析器，恢复时会运行它，这正是恢复出的函数与解析出"
"的函数保持一致的原因。SHACL 1.2 以表达式为主体的声明"
"（`sh:ListParameterExpressionFunction`）同样会被携带，来源是模型，因为它们的"
"主体*就是*节点表达式。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:256
msgid ""
"One capability is refused at pack time rather than lost at restore, on "
"`unsupported-capability`:"
msgstr ""
"有一种能力会在打包时被拒绝，而不是在恢复时丢失，报告为 `unsupported"
"-capability`："

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:259
msgid ""
"a declared function that nothing in the model reaches — an "
"expression-bodied declaration called only from `sh:sparql` query text, say. "
"The model is what carries those declarations, so one the model never "
"reaches is not in it, and a product written from it would resolve that call "
"site to nothing and validate green. Call the function from the shapes model "
"and it packs."
msgstr ""
"模型中没有任何部分到达的已声明函数——例如，一个仅从 `sh:sparql` 查"
"询文本中调用的、以表达式为主体的声明。携带这些声明的是模型，因此模型从未到达的声"
"明不在其中，据此写出的产物会把该调用点解析为空，并给出通过（绿色）的验证结果。从"
"形状模型中调用该函数，它就可以打包。"

#~ msgid ""
