#~ "the Python, C-ABI and WebAssembly bindings' lower-level, text-only entry "
#~ "point, which carries no `--import` table to resolve it from. An import whose "
#~ "ontology IS in the graph packs. The CLI's `purrdf shacl pack --import` can "
