msgstr "整个容器的摘要与字节不符"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:699
msgid "discard and re-pack — something outside the section bodies moved"
msgstr "丢弃并重新打包——部分主体之外的某些内容发生了变动"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:700
