#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:700
msgid ""
"expose the shapes under the same named graph and re-pack with that IRI, or "
"point the expectation at the product you meant"
msgstr ""
"在同一个命名图下公开这些形状，并以该 IRI 重新打包，或者让期望指向本意所指的产"
"物"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:701
msgid "`prefixes`"
msgstr "`prefixes`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:701
msgid "prepared against a different prefix map"
msgstr "针对不同的前缀映射预备"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:701
msgid ""
"pack and execute under the same prefixes — the map decides which IRI a "
"prefixed name denotes"
msgstr "在相同的前缀下打包与执行——前缀映射决定了前缀名表示哪个 IRI"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:702
msgid "`base`"
msgstr "`base`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:702
msgid "prepared against a different base IRI"
msgstr "针对不同的基准 IRI 预备"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:702
msgid ""
"pack and execute under the same base — relative references resolve against it"
msgstr "在相同的基准下打包与执行——相对引用依据它进行解析"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:703
msgid "`vocabulary`"
msgstr "`vocabulary`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:703
msgid "prepared under a different box-role vocabulary"
msgstr "在不同的盒角色词汇表下预备"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:703
msgid ""
"pass the SAME `--box-role-vocab NS` (or none) to both `purrdf shacl pack` "
"and the executing side; PurRDF mints no vocabulary IRIs and there is no "
"default to fall back on"
msgstr ""
"向 `purrdf shacl pack` 与执行方传入**相同的** `--box-role-vocab NS`（或都不"
"传）；PurRDF 不生成任何词汇表 IRI，也没有可供回退的默认值"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:704
msgid "`function-registry`"
msgstr "`function-registry`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:704
msgid ""
"prepared against a different SPARQL function registry, or against a "
"different build of the host implementations behind it"
msgstr "针对不同的 SPARQL 函数注册表预备，或针对其背后宿主实现的不同构建预备"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:704
msgid ""
"wire the same functions into the executing host, under the same "
"implementation identity"
msgstr "在执行宿主中接入相同的函数，并使用相同的实现身份"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:705
msgid "`aggregate-registry`"
msgstr "`aggregate-registry`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:705
msgid ""
"prepared against a different custom-aggregate registry, or against a "
"different build of the host implementations behind it"
msgstr "针对不同的自定义聚合注册表预备，或针对其背后宿主实现的不同构建预备"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:705
msgid ""
"wire the same aggregates into the executing host, under the same "
"implementation identity"
msgstr "在执行宿主中接入相同的聚合，并使用相同的实现身份"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:706
msgid "`property-function-registry`"
msgstr "`property-function-registry`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:706
msgid ""
"prepared against a different property-function registry, or against a "
"different build of the host implementations behind it"
msgstr "针对不同的属性函数注册表预备，或针对其背后宿主实现的不同构建预备"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:706
msgid ""
"wire the same relations into the executing host, under the same "
"implementation identity"
msgstr "在执行宿主中接入相同的关系，并使用相同的实现身份"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:707
msgid "`class-catalog`"
msgstr "`class-catalog`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:707
msgid ""
"the class analysis the product carries is not the one its own identity pins"
msgstr "产物所携带的类分析不是其自身身份所固定的那一份"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:707
msgid ""
"discard and re-pack from the shapes graph — the section and the binding over "
"it no longer describe one analysis"
msgstr "丢弃并从形状图重新打包——该部分与基于它的绑定已不再描述同一份分析"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:708
msgid "`unsupported-capability`"
msgstr "`unsupported-capability`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:708
msgid ""
"well-formed bytes asking for something this build cannot honour, or a "
"preparation this build will not write a product for"
msgstr ""
"良构的字节要求本构建无法兑现的东西，或者是本构建不会为之写出产物的预备结果"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:708
msgid ""
"see the message — a declared function nothing in the model reaches, a decode "
"larger than the scratch ceiling in force, or host implementations the packer "
"was given no identity for"
msgstr ""
"参见消息——模型中没有任何部分到达的已声明函数、超出当前生效的暂存（scratch）上"
"限的解码，或打包器未获得身份的宿主实现"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:709
msgid "`depth-limit`"
msgstr "`depth-limit`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:709
msgid "a structure nests past the decoder's fixed ceiling"
msgstr "某个结构的嵌套超出了解码器的固定上限"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:709
msgid ""
"re-pack from a shapes graph this build parses; the ceiling is a stack guard, "
"not a semantic limit"
msgstr "从本构建能够解析的形状图重新打包；该上限是栈保护，而不是语义限制"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:710
msgid "`malformed`"
msgstr "`malformed`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:710
msgid "structurally invalid in a way no other dimension names"
msgstr "以其他任何维度都未指明的方式在结构上无效"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:712
msgid ""
"Three of those are three genuinely different actions and that is the point "
"of naming them: `malformed` is a corrupt cache to discard, `format-version` "
"is a stale artifact to recompile, and `function-registry` is a configuration "
"error in your own process that re-packing will not fix."
msgstr ""
"其中三个对应三种真正不同的处理方式，而这正是为它们命名的意义所在："
"`malformed` 是需要丢弃的损坏缓存，`format-version` 是需要重新编译的过时工件，"
"而 `function-registry` 是调用方自身进程中的配置错误，重新打包无法修复。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:717
msgid "The certify-time dimension"
msgstr "认证时维度"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:721
msgid "`dataset-identity`"
msgstr "`dataset-identity`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:721
msgid ""
"the shapes dataset the product carries does not _canonicalize_ to the digest "
"its own binding claims"
msgstr "产物所携带的形状数据集*规范化*后得不到其自身绑定所声称的摘要"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:721
msgid ""
"discard and re-pack from the shapes graph — the section and the binding over "
"it no longer describe one dataset"
msgstr "丢弃并从形状图重新打包——该部分与基于它的绑定已不再描述同一个数据集"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:723
msgid ""
"Only `shacl verify` reports this one. A restore does **not** re-canonicalize "
"the shapes dataset: it takes that component from the product's own binding, "
"because the computation is a graph isomorphism over the shapes graph's blank "
"nodes and would plausibly cost more than the shapes parse a product exists "
"to eliminate. The envelope's per-section SHA-256 and whole-container digest "
"still cover those bytes on every path, so a swapped section is refused as "
"`section-digest` or `container-digest`; what only certification establishes "
"is that the bytes canonicalize to what the binding claims."
msgstr ""
"只有 `shacl verify` 报告这一维度。恢复**不会**对形状数据集重新规范化：它从产"
"物自身的绑定中取得该组成项，因为这项计算是针对形状图空节点的图同构，其开销很"
"可能超过产物本来要消除的形状解析开销。在每条路径上，封套按部分计算的 SHA-256 "
"与整个容器的摘要仍然覆盖这些字节，因此被替换的部分会以 `section-digest` 或 "
"`container-digest` 被拒绝；只有认证才能确立的是，这些字节规范化后得到绑定所声"
"称的结果。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:732
msgid ""
"So a product whose stored canonical digest has been tampered with **will "
"open, will admit, and will fail `shacl verify`.** That is a documented split "
"pinned by test, not a hole: if you need the statement, run `verify` — from a "
"build step, a release check or a conformance harness, never before every "
"validation."
msgstr ""
"因此，一个存储的规范化摘要被篡改过的产物**能够打开，能够准入，而会在 `shacl "
"verify` 中失败。** 这是一个由测试固定、有文档记录的划分，而不是漏洞：如果需要"
"这一陈述，就运行 `verify`——在构建步骤、发布检查或一致性测试框架中运行，绝不要"
"在每次验证之前运行。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:737
msgid ""
"One failure carries **no** dimension: a shapes or data _document_ that does "
"not parse never reached the admission boundary, so nothing was inspected and "
"naming a dimension for it would claim otherwise. On the CLI no `shacl "
"dimension` line is printed; in Python the exception's `.dimension` is "
"`None`; in JavaScript `dimension` is `undefined`."
msgstr ""
"有一种失败**不**带有任何维度：无法解析的形状*文档*或数据*文档*从未到达准入边"
"界，因此没有检查任何内容，为它指明一个维度就等于声称并非如此。在 CLI 上不会打"
"印 `shacl dimension` 行；在 Python 中，异常的 `.dimension` 为 `None`；在 "
"JavaScript 中，`dimension` 为 `undefined`。"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:743
msgid "The command-line verbs"
msgstr "命令行动词"

