msgstr "退出码 `2`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:747
msgid ""
"`purrdf shacl pack --shapes FILE --out OUT [--base IRI] [--shapes-graph IRI] "
"[--import IRI=FILE] [--box-role-vocab NS]`"
msgstr ""
"`purrdf shacl pack --shapes FILE --out OUT [--base IRI] [--shapes-graph IRI] "
"[--import IRI=FILE] [--box-role-vocab NS]`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:747
msgid "parse, prepare, write the product"
msgstr "解析、预备、写出产物"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:747
msgid "product written"
msgstr "产物已写出"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:747
msgid ""
"the shapes did not parse, the graph declares something a product cannot "
"carry, or an `owl:imports` is unresolved"
msgstr ""
"形状未能解析、图中声明了产物无法携带的内容，或某条 `owl:imports` 未解析"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:747
msgid ""
"bad flags, `--shapes -`, or a `--shapes-graph`/`--import` the shapes graph "
"cannot resolve"
msgstr ""
"错误的标志、`--shapes -`，或形状图无法解析的 `--shapes-graph`/`--import`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:748
msgid "`purrdf shacl verify [IN]`"
msgstr "`purrdf shacl verify [IN]`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:748
msgid "corroborate the carried dataset against the claimed identity"
msgstr "依据所声称的身份佐证所携带的数据集"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:748
