msgstr "打印身份摘要"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:748
msgid "refused, with `shacl dimension <label>` on stderr"
msgstr "被拒绝，并在 stderr 上输出 `shacl dimension <label>`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:748 src/validation/shapes-products.md:749
msgid "bad flags"
msgstr "错误的标志"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:749
msgid "`purrdf shacl explain [IN]`"
msgstr "`purrdf shacl explain [IN]`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:749
msgid "print what the product says it was compiled from"
msgstr "打印产物声称自己编译自什么"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:749
msgid "prints the `key value` rendering"
msgstr "打印 `key value` 呈现"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:749
msgid "the bytes are not a well-formed product"
msgstr "这些字节不是良构的产物"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:750
msgid "`purrdf shacl diff A B`"
msgstr "`purrdf shacl diff A B`"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:750
msgid "compare two products' declared identities, without admitting either"
msgstr "比较两个产物声明的身份，而不准入其中任何一个"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:750
msgid "the two identities are identical"
msgstr "两个身份完全相同"

#: src/validation/shapes-products.md:750
