#: src/project/releases.md:8
msgid ""
"PurRDF ships to three registries — the crates.io crate suite, the PyPI "
"`purrdf` package, and the npm `@blackcatinformatics/purrdf` package — from "
"**one** workspace version, in lockstep. The full process is [`docs/"
"RELEASE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/"
"RELEASE.md)."
msgstr ""
"PurRDF 以**同一个**工作区版本、同步地发布到三个注册表——crates.io 上的 crate "
"套件、PyPI 上的 `purrdf` 包，以及 npm 上的 `@blackcatinformatics/purrdf` 包。"
"完整流程见 [`docs/RELEASE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/"
"purrdf/blob/main/docs/RELEASE.md)。"

#: src/project/releases.md:13
msgid "Semver policy from 1.0.0"
msgstr "自 1.0.0 起的语义化版本（semver）策略"

#: src/project/releases.md:15
msgid "From 1.0.0 the suite follows semantic versioning in full:"
msgstr "自 1.0.0 起，整套软件完整遵循语义化版本："

#: src/project/releases.md:17
msgid ""
"a **breaking** change bumps the **major** version. A commit carrying `!` or "
"a `BREAKING CHANGE:` footer is a major-bump trigger, and the changelog marks "
"each such entry **BREAKING**;"
msgstr ""
"**破坏性**变更递增**主**版本号。带有 `!` 或 `BREAKING CHANGE:` 脚注的提交会触"
"发主版本递增，变更日志会把每个此类条目标记为 **BREAKING**；"

#: src/project/releases.md:20
msgid "a **minor** bump is additive and API-compatible;"
msgstr "**次**版本递增仅作增补，且与 API 兼容；"

#: src/project/releases.md:21
msgid "a **patch** bump is bugfix-only."
msgstr "**补丁**版本递增仅修复缺陷。"

#: src/project/releases.md:23
msgid ""
"That is what the version number commits to; it is a policy statement, not a "
"claim of stability beyond what semver means. All three published surfaces "
"share one workspace version and are released together, and a version-"
"coherence check in CI fails the build if the version sources (`Cargo.toml`, "
"`pyproject.toml`, `package.json`, `CITATION.cff`) disagree."
msgstr ""
"这就是版本号所承诺的内容；它是一项策略声明，而不是超出 semver 含义之外的稳定"
"性声称。全部三个已发布的接口共享同一个工作区版本并一同发布；CI 中的版本一致性"
"检查会在各版本来源（`Cargo.toml`、`pyproject.toml`、`package.json`、"
"`CITATION.cff`）不一致时使构建失败。"

#: src/project/releases.md:29
msgid ""
"The one exception is the C ABI. `libpurrdf`'s [`purrdf.h`](https://"
"github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/crates/rdf-capi/include/"
"purrdf.h) carries its own `PURRDF_ABI_MAJOR.PURRDF_ABI_MINOR` (currently "
"**0.7**), bumped on every exported-signature change, pinned by `crates/rdf-"
"capi/tests/abi_signatures.rs`, and read back at runtime through "
"`purrdf_abi_version`. It is versioned separately from the workspace and "
"stays `0.x`: it is not frozen, and the workspace's 1.0.0 makes no promise "
"about it."
msgstr ""
"唯一的例外是 C ABI。`libpurrdf` 的 [`purrdf.h`](https://github.com/Blackcat-"
"Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/crates/rdf-capi/include/purrdf.h) 带有自己的 "
"`PURRDF_ABI_MAJOR.PURRDF_ABI_MINOR`（目前为 **0.7**），每当导出签名变更时递"
"增，由 `crates/rdf-capi/tests/abi_signatures.rs` 固定，并在运行时通过 "
"`purrdf_abi_version` 读回。它的版本独立于工作区，并保持在 `0.x`：它并未冻结，"
"工作区的 1.0.0 对它不作任何承诺。"

#: src/project/releases.md:31
msgid "MSRV policy"
msgstr "MSRV 策略"

#: src/project/releases.md:33
msgid ""
"The supported minimum Rust is `rust-version` in the root `Cargo.toml` — "
"currently **1.98** — on the **stable** channel, enforced by a dedicated CI "
"MSRV job that sets `RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN` explicitly and asserts the compiler it "
"measured really is 1.98. Raising the MSRV is a notable change recorded in "
"the changelog; it rides a **minor** bump and never ships in a patch release."
msgstr ""
"支持的最低 Rust 版本是根 `Cargo.toml` 中的 `rust-version`——当前为 **1.98**——"
"位于 **stable** 通道，由专门的 CI MSRV 作业强制执行：该作业显式设置 "
"`RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN`，并断言它所度量的编译器确实是 1.98。提高 MSRV 是一项记入变"
"更日志的显著变更；它随**次版本**提升进行，绝不在修订版发布中出现。"

#: src/project/releases.md:39
msgid ""
"The MSRV is a promise to consumers; the development toolchain is a tool "
"choice, and the two are orthogonal. `rust-toolchain.toml` names a **floating "
"nightly** for local work and the CI gates, because nightly clippy and "
"rustdoc carry lints stable lacks and its default borrow checker is the "
"stronger one — but by policy the source uses zero nightly (unstable) "
"features (no `#![feature(...)]` attributes, which the MSRV job proves on "
"every change), and the release lanes build every published artifact on "
"stable."
msgstr ""
"MSRV 是对使用方的承诺；开发工具链是一项工具选择，二者相互正交。`rust-"
"toolchain.toml` 为本地工作与 CI 关卡指定了一个**浮动的 nightly**，因为 "
"nightly 的 clippy 与 rustdoc 带有 stable 所缺少的 lint，且其默认借用检查器更"
"强——但按照策略，源码不使用任何 nightly（不稳定）特性（没有任何 `#!"
"[feature(...)]` 属性，MSRV 作业在每次变更时都会证明这一点），而发布通道在 "
"stable 上构建每一个已发布的工件。"

#: src/project/releases.md:47
msgid "Tag-driven trusted publishing"
msgstr "由标签驱动的可信发布"

#: src/project/releases.md:49
msgid ""
"Releases are tag-driven: `rust-v<version>` publishes the crate suite to "
"crates.io, `py-v<version>` publishes to PyPI, and `npm-v<version>` publishes "
"the wasm package to npm. The lanes share the supply-chain posture of the "
"cargo lane:"
msgstr ""
"发布由标签驱动：`rust-v<version>` 把 crate 套件发布到 crates.io，`py-"
"v<version>` 发布到 PyPI，`npm-v<version>` 把 wasm 包发布到 npm。各通道共享 "
"cargo 通道的供应链安全姿态："

#: src/project/releases.md:54
msgid ""
"publication uses **Trusted Publishing** through GitHub Actions OIDC — no "
"long-lived registry secret;"
msgstr ""
"发布通过 GitHub Actions OIDC 使用**可信发布**（Trusted Publishing）——没有长期"
"有效的注册表密钥；"

#: src/project/releases.md:56
msgid "the privileged publish jobs use pinned actions and no dependency cache;"
msgstr "拥有特权的发布作业使用固定版本的 action，且不使用依赖缓存；"

#: src/project/releases.md:57
msgid ""
"every `.crate` package receives a GitHub **build-provenance attestation**;"
msgstr ""
"每个 `.crate` 包都会获得一份 GitHub **构建溯源证明**（build-provenance "
"attestation）；"

#: src/project/releases.md:58
msgid "the package set receives an **SPDX SBOM** and SBOM attestation;"
msgstr "整套包会获得一份 **SPDX SBOM** 及 SBOM 证明；"

#: src/project/releases.md:59
msgid ""
"the release crate set is checked on `wasm32-unknown-unknown` before "
"publishing;"
msgstr "发布的 crate 集合在发布前会在 `wasm32-unknown-unknown` 上接受检查；"

#: src/project/releases.md:61
msgid "every workspace crate version must match the tag version."
msgstr "每个工作区 crate 的版本都必须与标签版本一致。"

#: src/project/releases.md:63
msgid ""
"After its initial record bootstrap, every version of every crate in the 25-"
"crate release set is published by that lane. Each existing crate record is "
"locked on crates.io with _Require trusted publishing_ (`trustpub_only`), so "
"an API token cannot publish a new version of any of them: crates.io answers "
"with `403 Forbidden: New versions of this crate can only be published using "
"Trusted Publishing`. A token has exactly one role left, creating the record "
"of a brand-new crate — the one thing a Trusted Publishing token is refused "
"(`Trusted Publishing tokens do not support creating new crates`) — and the "
"release process document above is exact about how that bootstrap works: the "
"lane publishes up to the first crate that depends on a new one and stops "
"cleanly, the token creates the new crate's record, Trusted Publishing is "
"enabled on it, and the same run is resumed."
msgstr ""
"在各自最初的记录引导（bootstrap）之后，25 个 crate 的发布集合中每个 crate 的"
"每个版本都由该通道发布。每个已有的 crate 记录都在 crates.io 上以 _Require "
"trusted publishing_（`trustpub_only`）锁定，因此 API 令牌无法为其中任何一个发"
"布新版本：crates.io 会回应 `403 Forbidden: New versions of this crate can "
"only be published using Trusted Publishing`。令牌只剩下恰好一种用途，即为一个"
"全新的 crate 创建记录——这正是可信发布令牌唯一被拒绝的事（`Trusted Publishing "
"tokens do not support creating new crates`）——而上文的发布流程文档准确说明了"
"该引导如何进行：通道发布到第一个依赖某个新 crate 的 crate 为止并干净地停止，"
"由令牌创建新 crate 的记录，在其上启用可信发布，然后恢复同一次运行。"

#: src/project/releases.md:75
msgid ""
"Seven workspace members are deliberately never published to crates.io: "
"`purrdf-capi` (built via cargo-c, distributed as `libpurrdf`), `purrdf-"
"sparql-conformance` (the test harness), `purrdf-cli` (the `purrdf` binary), "
"`purrdf-envelope-probe` (the micro-hardware envelope capture tool), `purrdf-"
"bench` (benchmark tooling), `purrdf-alloc-probe` (the shared counting "
"allocator the allocation tests and benches measure with), and `purrdf-"
"python` (the extension crate, which ships to PyPI via maturin instead)."
msgstr ""
"有七个工作区成员有意从不发布到 crates.io：`purrdf-capi`（经由 cargo-c 构建，"
"以 `libpurrdf` 的形式分发）、`purrdf-sparql-conformance`（测试框架）、"
"`purrdf-cli`（`purrdf` 二进制文件）、`purrdf-envelope-probe`（微型硬件包络采"
"集工具）、`purrdf-bench`（基准测试工具）、`purrdf-alloc-probe`（分配测试与基"
"准测试进行测量时所共用的计数分配器），以及 `purrdf-python`（扩展 crate，改为"
"经由 maturin 发布到 PyPI）。"

#: src/project/releases.md:83
msgid ""
"`purrdf-alloc-probe` is the only one of the seven that published crates "
"depend on, and it reaches them solely through `[dev-dependencies]`. Its root "
"`[workspace.dependencies]` entry is therefore path-only, with no `version` "
"key, which is what makes cargo drop it from the packaged manifest: an "
"unpublished crate cannot be a versioned dependency of a published one, and "
"`cargo publish`'s verification step resolves dev-dependencies too."
msgstr ""
"`purrdf-alloc-probe` 是这七个成员中唯一被已发布 crate 所依赖的，并且仅通过 "
"`[dev-dependencies]` 到达它们。因此，它在根 `[workspace.dependencies]` 中的条"
"目只有路径、没有 `version` 键，这正是 cargo 将其从打包后的清单中去除的原因："
"未发布的 crate 不能成为已发布 crate 的带版本依赖，而 `cargo publish` 的验证步"
"骤也会解析 dev-dependencies。"

#: src/project/releases.md:90
msgid "Cutting a release"
msgstr "切出一个发布"

#: src/project/releases.md:92
msgid ""
"The coherent flow from `main` uses the `make` helpers so the three lanes can "
"never drift:"
msgstr ""
"从 `main` 出发的连贯流程使用 `make` 辅助目标，因此三条通道永远不会出现偏差："

#: src/project/releases.md:96
msgid ""
"# 1. Bump all three version sources in lockstep (fails unless they end up "
"equal).\n"
msgstr "# 1. 同步递增全部三个版本来源（除非最终三者相等，否则失败）。\n"

#: src/project/releases.md:98
msgid ""
"# 2. Regenerate the committed C-ABI header from the bumped crate version.\n"
msgstr "# 2. 依据递增后的 crate 版本重新生成已提交的 C-ABI 头文件。\n"

#: src/project/releases.md:101
msgid "# 3. Regenerate the changelog from the conventional-commit history.\n"
msgstr "# 3. 依据约定式提交（conventional commit）历史重新生成变更日志。\n"

#: src/project/releases.md:104
msgid ""
"# 4. Review, then commit the release bump, generated header, and changelog.\n"
msgstr "# 4. 审阅后，提交版本递增、生成的头文件与变更日志。\n"

#: src/project/releases.md:106
msgid "\"chore(release): 0.2.2\""
msgstr "\"chore(release): 0.2.2\""

#: src/project/releases.md:107
msgid ""
"# 5. From an up-to-date main, run every release gate, then push all three "
"tags.\n"
msgstr "# 5. 从最新的 main 出发，运行每一道发布关卡，然后推送全部三个标签。\n"

#: src/project/releases.md:112
msgid ""
"`make release-tags` refuses to run unless the working tree is clean, the "
"branch is `main` and synchronized with `origin/main`, the version check "
"passes, `VERSION` matches the tree, the release-notes section exists, and "
"none of the three tags already exists locally or remotely. It then runs the "
"Rust and wasm workspace gate, the generated C-ABI/header check, the native "
"Python binding suite, and the optimized size-gated npm/wasm package tests. "
"Only after every surface passes does it recheck the clean synchronized state "
"and atomically push the `rust-v`, `py-v`, and `npm-v` tags together. No tag "
"is created before the complete cross-surface preflight passes. Each tag "
"triggers its own lane, and the cargo lane additionally publishes a GitHub "
"Release built from the committed `CHANGELOG.md`."
msgstr ""
"`make release-tags` 在以下条件未全部满足时拒绝运行：工作树干净、分支为 "
"`main` 且与 `origin/main` 同步、版本检查通过、`VERSION` 与工作树一致、发布说"
"明小节存在，且三个标签都不在本地或远程已存在。随后它运行 Rust 与 wasm 工作区"
"关卡、生成的 C-ABI/头文件检查、原生 Python 绑定测试套件，以及经过优化、带体积"
"关卡的 npm/wasm 包测试。只有在每个接口都通过之后，它才会重新检查干净且已同步"
"的状态，并以原子方式一同推送 `rust-v`、`py-v` 与 `npm-v` 标签。在完整的跨接口"
"预检通过之前，不会创建任何标签。每个标签触发各自的通道，而 cargo 通道还会额外"
"发布一个依据已提交的 `CHANGELOG.md` 构建的 GitHub Release。"

#: src/project/releases.md:124
msgid "Citing PurRDF"
msgstr "引用 PurRDF"

#: src/project/releases.md:126
msgid ""
"Releases carry a DOI; if you use PurRDF in research, please cite it — see "
"[`CITATION.cff`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/"
"CITATION.cff) in the repository."
msgstr ""
"每个发布都带有 DOI；若在研究中使用 PurRDF，请引用它——参见仓库中的 "
"[`CITATION.cff`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/"
"CITATION.cff)。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:8
msgid ""
"Every failure PurRDF reports carries a stable, machine-readable `code` on "
"its `RdfDiagnostic` (`severity`, `code`, `message`, `detail`, `location`). "
"The code is the contract: tests, the SARIF emitter, the CLI, the Python "
"`ValueError` text and downstream matchers key on it, while the `message` is "
"free prose that may change wording. This page lists the codes by family, "
"with the failure each one names and what a caller can do about it. The set "
"was enumerated from the constructor sites in the source tree, not written "
"from memory; if a code you see is missing here, the source is authoritative "
"and the page is stale."
msgstr ""
"PurRDF 报告的每一个失败，都在其 `RdfDiagnostic`（`severity`、`code`、"
"`message`、`detail`、`location`）上携带一个稳定的、机器可读的 `code`。代码就"
"是契约：测试、SARIF 生成器、CLI、Python `ValueError` 文本以及下游的匹配器都以"
"它为键，而 `message` 是可能改变措辞的自由文本。本页按族列出这些代码，以及每个"
"代码所指的失败和调用方可以采取的措施。这个集合是从源码树中的构造位置枚举出来"
"的，而不是凭记忆写成的；如果看到的某个代码不在此列，以源码为准，本页已过时。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:18
msgid ""
"Codes are kebab-case, prefixed by the family that owns them. They are never "
"translated, and a caller should compare the whole string rather than a "
"prefix."
msgstr ""
"代码采用 kebab-case，以拥有它们的族作为前缀。它们永远不会被翻译，调用方应比较"
"整个字符串，而不是前缀。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:21
msgid "`iri-*` — IRI parsing and base resolution (`purrdf-iri`)"
msgstr "`iri-*`——IRI 解析与基准解析（`purrdf-iri`）"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:23
msgid ""
"`IriError::diagnostic_code` is the single owner of these strings for the "
"whole workspace; every codec, SPARQL, ShEx and SHACL route an IRI failure "
"through it. The two base-related codes are distinct because their remedies "
"are: one is fixed by supplying a base, the other is not."
msgstr ""
"`IriError::diagnostic_code` 是整个工作区中这些字符串的唯一所有者；每个编解码"
"器、SPARQL、ShEx 与 SHACL 都把 IRI 失败交由它处理。两个与基准相关的代码之所以"
"分开，是因为它们的补救办法不同：一个可以通过提供基准来修复，另一个则不能。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:28 src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:42
#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:68 src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:85
