msgid "Supply a base IRI that has a scheme, e.g. `http://example.org/dir/`."
msgstr "提供一个带有 scheme 的基准 IRI，例如 `http://example.org/dir/`。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:37
msgid ""
"A relative IRI reference was met with no base in scope: no in-document "
"directive, no caller-supplied base, no retrieval IRI."
msgstr ""
"遇到一个相对 IRI 引用，但作用域内没有基准：没有文档内指令，没有调用方提供的基"
"准，也没有获取 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:37
msgid ""
"Add a base to the document (`@base`/`BASE` in Turtle-family syntaxes, "
"`xml:base` in RDF/XML, `@context.@base` in JSON-LD) or pass a base IRI to "
"the API."
msgstr ""
"为文档添加基准（Turtle 族语法中用 `@base`/`BASE`，RDF/XML 中用 `xml:base`，"
"JSON-LD 中用 `@context.@base`），或向 API 传入一个基准 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:38
msgid ""
"The reference is not absolute and the syntax admits no relative reference at "
"all (N-Triples, N-Quads), so no base could ever apply."
msgstr ""
"该引用不是绝对的，而该语法根本不允许相对引用（N-Triples、N-Quads），因此任何"
"基准都不可能适用。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:38
msgid "Write the IRI in absolute form; supplying a base will not help."
msgstr "以绝对形式书写 IRI；提供基准无济于事。"

