"definition complexity, or the offline context registry size."
msgstr ""
"超出了某项上下文处理上限：已加载字节数、工作计数、定义复杂度，或离线上下文注"
"册表的大小。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:74
msgid "Reduce the context, or raise the limit the options document declares."
msgstr "缩减上下文，或提高选项文档所声明的上限。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:75
msgid "`jsonld-derived-invalid`"
msgstr "`jsonld-derived-invalid`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:75
msgid ""
"The deterministic dataset-IRI `derived` mode could not derive a prefix (an "
"invalid IRI, or a null mapping)."
msgstr ""
"确定性的数据集 IRI `derived` 模式无法推导出前缀（无效的 IRI，或 null 映射）。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:75
msgid "Correct the IRI the prefix would be derived from."
msgstr "更正用于推导前缀的那个 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:76
msgid "`jsonld-derived-limit`"
msgstr "`jsonld-derived-limit`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:76
msgid "A derived-context work or byte ceiling was exceeded."
msgstr "超出了派生上下文的工作量或字节上限。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:76
msgid "Reduce the dataset's IRI vocabulary or raise the declared limit."
msgstr "缩减数据集的 IRI 词汇，或提高所声明的上限。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:77
msgid "`jsonld-options-unused`"
msgstr "`jsonld-options-unused`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:77
msgid ""
"JSON-LD serialization options were supplied for a format that is not JSON-LD "
"or YAML-LD."
msgstr "为一种既非 JSON-LD 也非 YAML-LD 的格式提供了 JSON-LD 序列化选项。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:77
msgid "Drop the options, or serialize to JSON-LD/YAML-LD."
msgstr "去掉这些选项，或序列化为 JSON-LD/YAML-LD。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:79
msgid "`cdt-*` — SEP-0009 composite literals"
msgstr "`cdt-*`——SEP-0009 复合字面量"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:81
msgid ""
"A `cdt:List` or `cdt:Map` lexical form denotes blank nodes in the enclosing "
"document's scope, so a form that does not parse leaves that scope undefined "
"and the whole document is refused rather than the literal being kept opaque."
msgstr ""
"`cdt:List` 或 `cdt:Map` 的词法形式表示的是外层文档作用域中的空节点，因此一个"
"无法解析的词法形式会使该作用域处于未定义状态，于是整个文档被拒绝，而不是把该"
"字面量作为不透明值保留。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:87
msgid "`cdt-literal-malformed`"
msgstr "`cdt-literal-malformed`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:87
msgid "A composite literal's lexical form does not parse."
msgstr "复合字面量的词法形式无法解析。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:87
msgid "Correct the literal."
msgstr "更正该字面量。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:88
msgid "`cdt-literal-scan-disagreement`"
msgstr "`cdt-literal-scan-disagreement`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:88
msgid ""
"The bounded lexical scanner and the full parser disagree about the literal."
msgstr "有界词法扫描器与完整解析器对该字面量的判断不一致。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:88
msgid "This is a defect in PurRDF; report it with the literal."
msgstr "这是 PurRDF 的缺陷；请连同该字面量一起报告。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:90
msgid "`rdf-ir-*` — dataset structure (`purrdf-core` freeze and GTS import)"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-*`——数据集结构（`purrdf-core` 冻结与 GTS 导入）"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:92
msgid ""
"`RdfDatasetBuilder::freeze()` validates the structure of the dataset it is "
"about to freeze; the GTS import sink reports the same family for a container "
"whose terms do not form a well-formed dataset."
msgstr ""
"`RdfDatasetBuilder::freeze()` 会验证它即将冻结的数据集的结构；若某个容器中的"
"项不构成良构的数据集，GTS 导入接收器也报告同一族代码。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:98
msgid "`rdf-ir-term-out-of-range`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-term-out-of-range`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:98
msgid "A quad references a `TermId` the builder never interned."
msgstr "某个四元组引用了构建器从未驻留过的 `TermId`。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:98
msgid "Intern the term before pushing the quad."
msgstr "在推入该四元组之前先驻留该项。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:99
msgid "`rdf-ir-predicate-not-iri`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-predicate-not-iri`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:99
msgid "A quad's predicate is not an IRI."
msgstr "四元组的谓词不是 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:100
msgid "`rdf-ir-literal-subject`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-literal-subject`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:100
msgid "A literal occupies subject position."
msgstr "字面量出现在主语位置。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:100
msgid "RDF admits no literal subject; restructure the statement."
msgstr "RDF 不允许字面量作主语；请重新组织该陈述。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:101
msgid "`rdf-ir-triple-subject`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-triple-subject`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:101
msgid "A triple term occupies subject position."
msgstr "三元组项出现在主语位置。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:101
msgid "RDF 1.2 admits triple terms in object position only; use a reifier."
msgstr "RDF 1.2 只允许三元组项出现在宾语位置；请使用具体化节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:102
msgid "`rdf-ir-graph-name-invalid`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-graph-name-invalid`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:102
msgid "A graph name is a literal or a triple term."
msgstr "图名是字面量或三元组项。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:102
msgid "A graph name must be an IRI or a blank node."
msgstr "图名必须是 IRI 或空节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:103
msgid "`rdf-ir-reifier-not-triple`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-reifier-not-triple`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:103
msgid "A reifier binding points at something other than a triple term."
msgstr "具体化节点绑定指向的不是三元组项。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:104
msgid "`rdf-ir-triple-cycle`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-triple-cycle`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:104
msgid "A triple term contains itself, directly or through nesting."
msgstr "某个三元组项直接或通过嵌套包含了它自身。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:104 src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:126
msgid "Remove the cycle."
msgstr "消除该环。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:105
msgid "`rdf-ir-triple-nesting-limit`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-triple-nesting-limit`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:105
msgid "Triple-term nesting exceeds the builder's depth limit."
msgstr "三元组项的嵌套超出了构建器的深度上限。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:105 src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:111
#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:127 src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:134
msgid "Flatten the nesting."
msgstr "将嵌套展平。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:106
msgid "`rdf-ir-dangling-term-ref`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-dangling-term-ref`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:106
msgid "A GTS role references a term id that no term event introduced."
msgstr "某个 GTS 角色引用了一个没有任何项事件引入的项 id。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:106 src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:118
msgid "The container is inconsistent; regenerate it."
msgstr "该容器不一致；请重新生成它。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:107
msgid "`rdf-ir-gts-fold-diagnostic`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-gts-fold-diagnostic`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:107
msgid "The GTS fold reported a diagnostic, surfaced through the import."
msgstr "GTS 折叠报告了一条诊断，经由导入呈现出来。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:107
msgid "The fold diagnostic's own code and detail are in the message."
msgstr "折叠诊断自身的代码与详情包含在消息中。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:108
msgid "`rdf-ir-iri-missing-value`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-iri-missing-value`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:108
msgid "An imported IRI term has an empty value."
msgstr "某个导入的 IRI 项的值为空。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:109
msgid "`rdf-ir-literal-datatype-not-iri`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-literal-datatype-not-iri`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:109
msgid "An imported literal's datatype resolves to a non-IRI."
msgstr "某个导入的字面量的数据类型解析为非 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:110
msgid "`rdf-ir-missing-reifier-binding`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-missing-reifier-binding`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:110
msgid "An imported triple term references a reifier with no recorded binding."
msgstr "某个导入的三元组项引用了一个没有记录绑定的具体化节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:110 src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:124
msgid "Bind the reifier in the container."
msgstr "在容器中绑定该具体化节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:111
msgid "`rdf-ir-term-nesting-limit`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-term-nesting-limit`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:111
msgid "Imported triple-term nesting exceeds the depth limit."
msgstr "导入的三元组项嵌套超出了深度上限。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:112
msgid "`rdf-ir-unbound-triple-term`"
msgstr "`rdf-ir-unbound-triple-term`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:112
msgid "An imported triple term names neither its components nor a reifier."
msgstr "某个导入的三元组项既未给出其组成部分，也未指明具体化节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:114
msgid "`gts-*` and `rdf-*` — GTS graph resolution, verification and writing"
msgstr "`gts-*` 与 `rdf-*`——GTS 图的解析、验证与写出"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:118
msgid "`gts-term-out-of-range`"
msgstr "`gts-term-out-of-range`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:118
msgid "A GTS term id is out of range for the graph."
msgstr "某个 GTS 项 id 超出了该图的范围。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:119
msgid "`gts-iri-missing-value`"
msgstr "`gts-iri-missing-value`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:119
msgid "A GTS IRI term has an empty value."
msgstr "某个 GTS IRI 项的值为空。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:120
msgid "`gts-predicate-not-iri`"
msgstr "`gts-predicate-not-iri`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:120
msgid "A GTS predicate term is not an IRI."
msgstr "某个 GTS 谓词项不是 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:121
msgid "`gts-literal-datatype-not-iri`"
msgstr "`gts-literal-datatype-not-iri`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:121
msgid "A GTS literal datatype does not resolve to an IRI."
msgstr "某个 GTS 字面量的数据类型未解析为 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:122
msgid "`gts-direction-without-language`"
msgstr "`gts-direction-without-language`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:122
msgid "A GTS literal carries a base direction but no language tag."
msgstr "某个 GTS 字面量带有基础方向，却没有语言标签。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:123
msgid "`gts-invalid-direction`"
msgstr "`gts-invalid-direction`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:123
msgid "A GTS literal base direction is neither `ltr` nor `rtl`."
msgstr "某个 GTS 字面量的基础方向既不是 `ltr` 也不是 `rtl`。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:124
msgid "`gts-missing-reifier-binding`"
msgstr "`gts-missing-reifier-binding`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:124
msgid "A GTS triple term references a reifier the graph does not bind."
msgstr "某个 GTS 三元组项引用了一个该图未绑定的具体化节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:125
msgid "`gts-unbound-triple-term`"
msgstr "`gts-unbound-triple-term`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:125
msgid "A GTS triple term names neither its own components nor a reifier."
msgstr "某个 GTS 三元组项既未给出其自身的组成部分，也未指明具体化节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:126
msgid "`gts-self-reaching-term`"
msgstr "`gts-self-reaching-term`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:126
msgid ""
"A GTS term resolves through itself, so no walk of its components can "
"terminate."
msgstr "某个 GTS 项经由其自身解析，因此对其组成部分的任何游走都无法终止。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:127
msgid "`gts-term-nesting-limit`"
msgstr "`gts-term-nesting-limit`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:127
msgid "GTS term nesting exceeds the depth limit."
msgstr "GTS 项嵌套超出了深度上限。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:128
msgid "`gts-fold-diagnostic`"
msgstr "`gts-fold-diagnostic`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:128
msgid "The GTS fold reported one or more diagnostics."
msgstr "GTS 折叠报告了一条或多条诊断。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:128
msgid "Inspect the fold diagnostics listed in the detail."
msgstr "检查详情中列出的折叠诊断。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:129
msgid "`gts-verify-digest-inclusion`"
msgstr "`gts-verify-digest-inclusion`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:129
msgid "Content-addressed terms are not included in the verified chain."
msgstr "内容寻址的项未被包含在已验证的链中。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:129
msgid "The container's chain does not cover its content; do not trust it."
msgstr "该容器的链没有覆盖其内容；不要信任它。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:130
msgid "`gts-verify-signature`"
msgstr "`gts-verify-signature`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:130
msgid "COSE signature verification failed."
msgstr "COSE 签名验证失败。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:130
msgid "Check the signing key and the container's integrity."
msgstr "检查签名密钥与容器的完整性。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:131
msgid "`gts-writer-codec`"
msgstr "`gts-writer-codec`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:131
msgid "The GTS writer's codec reported an error while writing."
msgstr "GTS 写出器的编解码器在写出时报告了错误。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:131
msgid "The codec's own error is in the message."
msgstr "编解码器自身的错误包含在消息中。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:132
msgid "`rdf-graph-name-not-node`"
msgstr "`rdf-graph-name-not-node`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:132
msgid ""
"While building a GTS graph, a named-graph name is not an IRI or blank node."
msgstr "在构建 GTS 图时，某个命名图的名称不是 IRI 或空节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:132
msgid "Use an IRI or blank node graph name."
msgstr "使用 IRI 或空节点作为图名。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:133
msgid "`rdf-reifier-not-node`"
msgstr "`rdf-reifier-not-node`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:133
msgid ""
"While building a GTS graph, an RDF 1.2 reifier is not an IRI or blank node."
msgstr "在构建 GTS 图时，某个 RDF 1.2 具体化节点不是 IRI 或空节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:133
msgid "Use an IRI or blank node reifier."
msgstr "使用 IRI 或空节点作为具体化节点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:134
msgid "`rdf-term-nesting-limit`"
msgstr "`rdf-term-nesting-limit`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:134
msgid "RDF term nesting exceeded the depth limit while building a GTS graph."
msgstr "在构建 GTS 图时，RDF 项嵌套超出了深度上限。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:136
msgid "`native-sparql-*` — the SPARQL engine boundary (`purrdf-sparql-eval`)"
msgstr "`native-sparql-*`——SPARQL 引擎边界（`purrdf-sparql-eval`）"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:140
msgid "`native-sparql-query-parse`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-query-parse`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:140
msgid ""
"The query text does not parse under the SPARQL 1.1/1.2 grammar (including "
"the enforced `VERSION` declaration)."
msgstr ""
"查询文本无法按 SPARQL 1.1/1.2 语法解析（包括强制执行的 `VERSION` 声明）。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:140
msgid "Fix the query at the reported position."
msgstr "在所报告的位置修正查询。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:141
msgid "`native-sparql-update-parse`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-update-parse`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:141
msgid "The update request does not parse."
msgstr "更新请求无法解析。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:141
msgid "Fix the update at the reported position."
msgstr "在所报告的位置修正更新。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:142
msgid "`native-sparql-query-explain`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-query-explain`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:142
msgid ""
"Evaluation under `--explain` failed; the evaluator's error is in the message."
msgstr "在 `--explain` 下求值失败；求值器的错误包含在消息中。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:142
msgid "Address the underlying evaluation error."
msgstr "处理底层的求值错误。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:143
msgid "`native-sparql-property-function`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-property-function`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:143
msgid ""
"The property-function seam refused the query: a predicate under a declared "
"namespace has no registration, a call site's arity does not match the "
"relation, no total order can serve a chain, or a prepared plan is being "
"evaluated under a different registry than it was prepared with."
msgstr ""
"属性函数（property function）扩展点拒绝了该查询：某个已声明命名空间下的谓词没"
"有注册，某个调用点的元数与该关系不匹配，没有任何全序能用于某条链，或者一个预"
"备好的计划正在一个与其预备时不同的注册表下求值。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:143
msgid ""
"Register the relation, correct the arity, or prepare and evaluate under the "
"same registry."
msgstr "注册该关系、更正元数，或在同一个注册表下预备并求值。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:144
msgid "`native-sparql-aggregate-function`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-aggregate-function`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:144
msgid ""
"The custom-aggregate seam refused the query: an `AGG(<iri>, …)` names no "
"registered aggregate, or a prepared plan is being evaluated under a "
"different aggregate registry."
msgstr ""
"自定义聚合扩展点拒绝了该查询：某个 `AGG(<iri>, …)` 没有指向任何已注册的聚合，"
"或者一个预备好的计划正在另一个聚合注册表下求值。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:144
msgid ""
"Register the aggregate, or prepare and evaluate under the same registry."
msgstr "注册该聚合，或在同一个注册表下预备并求值。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:145
msgid "`native-sparql-custom-function`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-custom-function`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:145
msgid ""
"A function or aggregate IRI resolved to no registered custom function, "
"native function, or XSD constructor."
msgstr ""
"某个函数或聚合 IRI 没有解析到任何已注册的自定义函数、原生函数或 XSD 构造函"
"数。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:145
msgid "Register the function under that IRI, or use a native one."
msgstr "在该 IRI 下注册函数，或使用原生函数。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:146
msgid "`native-sparql-quoted-triple-term-variable`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-quoted-triple-term-variable`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:146
msgid ""
"A variable occupies a component of a quoted-triple term in a basic graph "
"pattern or property path; structural triple-term matching is out of scope."
msgstr ""
"在基本图模式或属性路径中，某个变量占据了引用三元组项的一个组成部分；结构化的"
"三元组项匹配不在支持范围之内。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:146
msgid ""
"Bind the triple term as a whole, or match its components through the reifier "
"surface."
msgstr "把三元组项作为整体绑定，或通过具体化节点接口匹配其组成部分。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:147
msgid "`native-sparql-heldin-unconfigured`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-heldin-unconfigured`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:147
msgid ""
"`heldIn` was called with no caller-supplied standpoint-predicate "
"configuration."
msgstr "调用 `heldIn` 时没有调用方提供的 standpoint（立场）谓词配置。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:147
msgid "Configure the standpoint predicates before using `heldIn`."
msgstr "在使用 `heldIn` 之前先配置 standpoint 谓词。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:148
msgid "`native-sparql-graph-pattern-depth-exceeded`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-graph-pattern-depth-exceeded`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:148
msgid ""
"A manually constructed graph pattern nests deeper than the parser's safety "
"bound."
msgstr "某个手工构造的图模式嵌套深度超出了解析器的安全界限。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:148
msgid "Flatten the pattern."
msgstr "将该模式展平。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:149
msgid "`native-sparql-bnode-mint-prefix`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-bnode-mint-prefix`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:149
msgid "The blank-node mint prefix supplied in the options is invalid."
msgstr "选项中提供的空节点生成前缀无效。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:149
msgid "Supply a valid prefix."
msgstr "提供一个有效的前缀。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:150
msgid "`native-sparql-load-no-resolver`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-load-no-resolver`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:150
msgid ""
"`LOAD <iri>` was requested but no `GraphResolver` host seam was provided."
msgstr "请求了 `LOAD <iri>`，却没有提供 `GraphResolver` 宿主扩展点。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:150
msgid "Inject a resolver, or remove the `LOAD`."
msgstr "注入一个解析器，或去掉该 `LOAD`。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:151
msgid "`native-sparql-update-bad-destination`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-update-bad-destination`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:151
msgid ""
"An `ADD`/`MOVE`/`COPY`/`LOAD` destination is `NAMED` or `ALL`; it must be "
"`DEFAULT` or a single named `GRAPH`."
msgstr ""
"`ADD`/`MOVE`/`COPY`/`LOAD` 的目标是 `NAMED` 或 `ALL`；它必须是 `DEFAULT` 或单"
"个命名的 `GRAPH`。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:151
msgid "Name a single destination graph."
msgstr "指定单个目标图。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:152
msgid "`native-sparql-subst-iri`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-subst-iri`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:152
msgid "A substitution value is not a valid IRI."
msgstr "某个替换值不是有效的 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:152
msgid "Supply a valid IRI."
msgstr "提供一个有效的 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:153
msgid "`native-sparql-subst-triple-predicate`"
msgstr "`native-sparql-subst-triple-predicate`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:153
msgid "A substituted quoted triple has a predicate that is not an IRI."
msgstr "某个被替换的引用三元组的谓词不是 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:155
msgid "`reasoning-*` — SPARQL under an entailment regime (`purrdf`)"
msgstr ""
"`reasoning-*`——在蕴涵机制（entailment regime）下执行的 SPARQL（`purrdf`）"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:159
msgid "`reasoning-closure-relation-witness`"
msgstr "`reasoning-closure-relation-witness`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:159
msgid ""
"Property-function relations derived from the closure cannot be combined with "
"an OWL Direct-Semantics run whose restricted chase minted existential "
"witnesses: a relation walking the closure could return a minted blank node "
"the regime's scoping graph does not contain."
msgstr ""
"从推理闭包派生的属性函数关系，不能与其受限 chase 生成了存在性见证的 OWL "
"Direct-Semantics 运行组合使用：遍历闭包的关系可能返回一个生成的空节点，而该机"
"制的作用域图并不包含它。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:159
msgid ""
"Query under a regime that mints no witnesses (`rdf`, `rdfs`, `owl-rl`, `d`, "
"`rif`, `simple`), or drop the dataset-derived relations from the call."
msgstr ""
"在不生成见证的机制（`rdf`、`rdfs`、`owl-rl`、`d`、`rif`、`simple`）下查询，或"
"从该调用中去掉由数据集派生的关系。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:160
msgid "`reasoning-closure-relation-rebuild`"
msgstr "`reasoning-closure-relation-rebuild`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:160
msgid "Rebuilding the property-function relations over the closure failed."
msgstr "在推理闭包上重建属性函数关系失败。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:160
msgid "The relation builder's own error is in the message."
msgstr "关系构建器自身的错误包含在消息中。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:162
msgid "`statements-*` — statement-metadata ingestion (`purrdf-rdf`)"
msgstr "`statements-*`——陈述元数据的摄入（`purrdf-rdf`）"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:164
msgid ""
"These arise when a document's `rdf:reifies` and `owl:Axiom` statements are "
"read into the statement layer."
msgstr ""
"当把文档的 `rdf:reifies` 与 `owl:Axiom` 陈述读入陈述层时，会出现这些代码。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:169
msgid "`statements-turtle-parse`"
msgstr "`statements-turtle-parse`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:169
msgid "The statement-metadata Turtle failed to parse."
msgstr "陈述元数据 Turtle 解析失败。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:169
msgid "Fix the Turtle."
msgstr "修正该 Turtle。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:170
msgid "`statements-non-iri`"
msgstr "`statements-non-iri`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:170
msgid "A term that must be an IRI in this context is not one."
msgstr "在此上下文中必须是 IRI 的某个项不是 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:170
msgid "Use an IRI."
msgstr "使用 IRI。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:171
msgid "`statements-reifies-non-triple`"
msgstr "`statements-reifies-non-triple`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:171
msgid "The object of `rdf:reifies` is not a triple term."
msgstr "`rdf:reifies` 的宾语不是三元组项。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:171
msgid "Reify a triple term."
msgstr "对一个三元组项进行具体化。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:172
msgid "`statements-malformed-axiom`"
msgstr "`statements-malformed-axiom`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:172
msgid "An `owl:Axiom` lacks its source, property or target."
msgstr "某个 `owl:Axiom` 缺少其源、属性或目标。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:172
msgid "Complete the axiom."
msgstr "补全该公理。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:173
msgid "`statements-conflicting-structural`"
msgstr "`statements-conflicting-structural`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:173
msgid "One subject carries two different values for a structural field."
msgstr "同一个主语在某个结构字段上带有两个不同的值。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:173
msgid "Keep one value."
msgstr "只保留一个值。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:175
msgid "Other single-code families"
msgstr "其他单代码族"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:179
msgid "`sssom-tsv-parse`"
msgstr "`sssom-tsv-parse`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:179
msgid ""
"An SSSOM TSV document is malformed: a missing or unreadable header row, a "
"malformed `curie_map` entry or set comment, a malformed row, or a non-"
"numeric confidence; the location names the line."
msgstr ""
"某个 SSSOM TSV 文档格式错误：缺少表头行或表头行不可读、`curie_map` 条目或集合"
"注释格式错误、某行格式错误，或置信度不是数值；位置信息指明所在行。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:179
msgid "Fix the TSV at the reported line."
msgstr "在所报告的行修正该 TSV。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:180
msgid "`content-id-scheme`"
msgstr "`content-id-scheme`"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:180
msgid ""
"A content-id scheme prefix is invalid: empty, non-ASCII, or ending in a "
"hexadecimal digit (which would make it ambiguous with the 64-hex-character "
"tail)."
msgstr ""
"某个内容 id 的 scheme 前缀无效：为空、含非 ASCII 字符，或以十六进制数字结尾"
"（这会使它与 64 个十六进制字符的尾部产生歧义）。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:180
msgid ""
"Choose a prefix that is non-empty ASCII and does not end in `0-9`, `a-f` or "
"`A-F`."
msgstr "选择一个非空、纯 ASCII 且不以 `0-9`、`a-f` 或 `A-F` 结尾的前缀。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:182
msgid "Where the code reaches you"
msgstr "代码在何处呈现给调用方"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:184
msgid ""
"**Rust** — `RdfDiagnostic::code` on the returned error; its `Display` form "
"is `<severity> <code>: <message>`."
msgstr ""
"**Rust**——返回错误上的 `RdfDiagnostic::code`；其 `Display` 形式为 "
"`<severity> <code>: <message>`。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:186
msgid ""
"**Python** — the `ValueError` message is that `Display` form (for example "
"`error native-codec-parse: …`); an IRI failure is rendered as `<code>: "
"<message>` (for example `iri-relative-no-base: …`)."
msgstr ""
"**Python**——`ValueError` 消息即该 `Display` 形式（例如 `error native-codec-"
"parse: …`）；IRI 失败则输出为 `<code>: <message>`（例如 `iri-relative-no-"
"base: …`）。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:189
msgid "**JavaScript** — the thrown `Error` message carries the same text."
msgstr "**JavaScript**——抛出的 `Error` 消息携带相同的文本。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:190
msgid ""
"**C** — the error string returned through the C ABI carries the same text."
msgstr "**C**——经由 C ABI 返回的错误字符串携带相同的文本。"

#: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:191
msgid ""
"**SARIF** — the `ruleId` of each result is the code, with a "
"`reportingDescriptor` in the run's rule table ([`purrdf-validate`](https://"
"docs.rs/purrdf-validate))."
msgstr ""
"**SARIF**——每条结果的 `ruleId` 即该代码，并在本次运行的规则表中带有一个 "
"`reportingDescriptor`（[`purrdf-validate`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-"
"validate)）。"
